_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/smit-khoa","id":134053297,"login":"smit-khoa","node_id":"U_kgDOB_19sQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smit-khoa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smit-khoa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smit-khoa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smit-khoa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smit-khoa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smit-khoa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smit-khoa/MF-2-vue/commits/9fb43d173d705e0870c582f431f4839a6aa1611c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-06T11:35:37Z","email":"134053297+smit-khoa@users.noreply.github.com","name":"nguyễn đăng khoa"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-06T11:35:37Z","email":"134053297+smit-khoa@users.noreply.github.com","name":"nguyễn đăng khoa"},"message":"feat(shared-ui): data-grid Table with Excel-like range-select + copy\n\nReplace shadcn table primitives with a virtualized data-grid Table\n(frozen columns, resize, custom-column, sort, pagination, pivot) and add\nopt-in Excel-like range selection + copy.\n\nRange-select (enableRangeSelect, default false -> zero regression on the\nMF singleton):\n- cell-background highlight (solid color-mix, no overlay layer) so frozen\n  cells stay pinned on scroll and transparency never stacks\n- drag cell range, Ctrl/Cmd multi-range, Shift extend, header column-handle\n- auto-scroll near edges, Cmd+C -> TSV, localStorage column presets, picker\n- clamped floating copy/settings buttons that pin to the table edge\n\nLogic split into composables (use-range-copy, range-copy-presets,\nuse-table-range-selection, range-coords, use-range-copy-flow) with Vitest\n(jsdom) unit tests for the pure copy + geometry layer.\n\nAlso: icon sprite generation script + svg set, ads-manager showcase demo,\ndocs + feature-map sync.","tree"