https://api.github.com/users/smonier/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/smonier","id":722535,"login":"smonier","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyMjUzNQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jcustomer-sfdc-connector/commits/422593d1f44ce5a9e7eff3a411a6d61bfa03d7cd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-04T09:34:28Z","email":"smonier@jahia.com","name":"Stephane Monier"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-04T09:34:28Z","email":"smonier@jahia.com","name":"Stephane Monier"},"message":"Type connector config with a proper CND (jcsfdcnt:*) instead of nt:unstructured\n\nStore /settings/jcustomer-sfdc-connector under typed node types defined in\nMETA-INF/definitions.cnd so the config is browsable and self-describing in the\nJCR/Definitions browser, with real JCR property types (boolean/long/date/string).\n\n- definitions.cnd: 9 types (connection, fieldMapping, objectMapping, mappingSet,\n  triggers, outboundTriggers, syncState, outbound, connectorConfig), all > jnt:content.\n- ConnectorConfigService: create typed nodes; write booleans/longs/dates as their\n  JCR types; reads tolerate the legacy nt:unstructured string layout (isoOf + JCR\n  conversion) so nothing breaks pre-migration. Public API (Map<String,String>) unchanged.\n- migration/2100-migrate-config-to-typed.groovy: idempotent one-time patch that\n  captures the legacy config via the service, deletes the untyped subtree, and\n  recreates it typed. Loads the module class via the bundle classloader\n  (FrameworkService) and aborts before any delete if the CND is not registered.\n\nVerified live on 8.2.3.2: CND registers (9 types), migration runs clean (no data\nloss), tree fully typed, values/JCR-types correct, read + save round-trips keep\nnodes typed.","tree":{"sha":"a1488c0ff82f997bd8ac80ee8244c2d6edcb17f3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jcustomer-sfdc-connector/git/trees/a1488c0ff82f997bd8ac80ee8244c2d6edcb17f3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jcustomer-sfdc-connector/git/commits/422593d1f44ce5a9e7eff3a411a6d61bfa03d7cd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/722535?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/smonier","id":722535,"login":"smonier","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyMjUzNQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/jcustomer-sfdc-connector/commit/422593d1f44ce5a9e7eff3a411a6d61bfa03d7cd","node_id":"C_kwDOSw3eDtoAKDQyMjU5M2QxZjQ0Y2U1YTllN2VmZjNhNDExYTZkNjFiZmEwM2Q3Y2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/jcustomer-sfdc-connector/commit/f326071c48f63c513fa77d6b8edde233a2b36c3c","sha":"f326071c48f63c513fa77d6b8edde233a2b36c3c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jcustomer-sfdc-connect