ers/ajju853/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajju853/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajju853/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajju853","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ajju853/SystemDesignHandbook/commits/d26b201a2f90470e23bb827df8193c1def91569f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-04T14:05:48Z","email":"ajimp340@gmail.com","name":"Ajju853"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-04T14:05:48Z","email":"ajimp340@gmail.com","name":"Ajju853"},"message":"feat: expand Linux (9->14), Docker (8->14), Microservices (10->14)\n\n03-Linux: +5 files\n  - Storage management (LVM, RAID, iSCSI, device-mapper)\n  - Namespaces & cgroups deep-dive (container primitives)\n  - I/O scheduling & process scheduling\n  - Troubleshooting & debugging (strace, perf, eBPF/bcc, crash)\n  - Filesystem internals (VFS, ext4/XFS/btrfs, overlayfs)\n\n08-Docker: +6 files\n  - Container registries (Harbor, cosign, scanning, GC)\n  - Docker in CI/CD (BuildKit, buildx, Kaniko, caching)\n  - Logging & monitoring (drivers, cAdvisor, healthchecks)\n  - Advanced networking (overlay, Calico, Cilium, MACVLAN)\n  - Volume management (backup/restore, Portworx, migration)\n  - Debugging & troubleshooting (nsenter, ephemeral debug)\n\n07-Microservices: +4 files\n  - API composition & BFF patterns\n  - Service mesh deep-dive (Istio, Linkerd, mTLS)\n  - Resilience patterns (bulkhead, retry, circuit breaker)\n  - Microservices security (SPIFFE/SPIRE, mTLS, OAuth2)","tree":{"sha":"e1bb2c401833d59fa75418f2cd33fba6dc7c1632","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ajju853/SystemDesignHandbook/git/trees/e1bb2c401833d59fa75418f2cd33fba6dc7c1632"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ajju853/SystemDesignHandbook/git/commits/d26b201a2f90470e23bb827df8193c1def91569f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":n