api.github.com/users/ajju853/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajju853","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ajju853/SystemDesignHandbook/commits/d013ad75cf4473e5aa447b509e00bf9586ee314e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-04T13:45:36Z","email":"ajimp340@gmail.com","name":"Ajju853"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-04T13:45:36Z","email":"ajimp340@gmail.com","name":"Ajju853"},"message":"fix: resolve 9 broken links and standardize module README titles\n\nFixes broken internal links:\n- 13-Terraform/09-best-practices.md: 6 broken AWS/Azure/GCP/DevOps refs\n  (wrong file names from old module structure) -> corrected to actual file paths\n- 19-Projects/12-end-to-end-implementation-guide.md: 3 broken ../../\n  relative links (went 2 levels up instead of 1) -> corrected to ../\n\nStandardizes module README headings to consistent ''# NN — Name'' format:\n- 03-Linux: was ''# 03-Linux: Linux Fundamentals...''\n- 11-Azure: was ''# Azure Module Overview'' (no number)\n- 12-GCP: was ''# GCP Module Overview'' (no number)\n- 13-Terraform: was ''# 13 - ...'' (hyphen -> em dash)\n- 14-DevOps: was ''# 14 - ...'' (hyphen -> em dash)\n- 22-AI-ML: was ''# 22 - ...'' (hyphen -> em dash)\n- 23-API-Design: was ''# Module 23: ...'' (different format)\n- 24-Testing: was ''# Module 24: ...'' (different format)\n- 25-Clean-Architecture: was ''# 25 - ...'' (hyphen -> em dash)\n\nVerified: all 770 internal links across 448 files now resolve correctly.","tree":{"sha":"c9f10f6ffbfbf532b9bcfe81b95ac0124af9d0e3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ajju853/SystemDesignHandbook/git/trees/c9f10f6ffbfbf532b9bcfe81b95ac0124af9d0e3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ajju853/SystemDesignHandbook/git/commits/d013ad75cf4473e5aa447b509e00bf9586ee314e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.co