":"https://api.github.com/users/ajju853/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajju853/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajju853/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajju853/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajju853/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajju853","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ajju853/SystemDesignHandbook/commits/566426ceaa12e9cefe54cd76341683cbdaf704d0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-04T13:30:39Z","email":"ajimp340@gmail.com","name":"Ajju853"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-04T13:30:39Z","email":"ajimp340@gmail.com","name":"Ajju853"},"message":"feat: add 4 new modules (22-25) — AI/ML System Design, API Design, Testing & Quality Engineering, Clean Architecture\n\nAdds 44 new files across 4 specialization modules:\n\n22-AI-ML-System-Design (11 files):\n  - Transformer architecture, RAG, vector DBs, model serving (vLLM/TGI/Triton)\n  - Prompt engineering patterns, AI agent architectures, ML pipeline infra\n  - Model evaluation/monitoring, GPU optimization, cost optimization\n  - AI system design examples (chatbot, RAG pipeline, code assistant)\n\n23-API-Design (10 files):\n  - RESTful design, OpenAPI 3.1, GraphQL (schema/resolvers/federation/N+1)\n  - gRPC (protobuf/4 streaming modes), API versioning, API security\n  - API gateway patterns (BFF/aggregation/circuit breaking)\n  - WebSocket/SSE, webhook patterns, API testing\n\n24-Testing-Quality-Engineering (10 files):\n  - Testing strategies, unit/integration testing, contract testing (Pact)\n  - E2E testing (Cypress/Playwright), performance testing (k6/Locust)\n  - Load testing patterns, chaos engineering, test infrastructure\n  - CI test strategy, quality metrics (DORA/SLI-SLO)\n\n25-Clean-Architecture-Design-Patterns (11 files):\n  - SOLID principles (multi-language), 23 GoF patterns\n  - Clean/Hexagonal/Onion architecture, Domain-Driven Design\n  - CQRS, Event Sourcing, Saga pattern, Strangler Fig\n  - Architecture Decision Records, Twelve-Factor App\n\nUpdated root README with new learning path (5 phases with specialization),\nmodule index, expandable highlights, and navigation for all 25 modules.\nUpdated CI validation scripts to check 01-25 modules.\nTotal: 448 .md files, 553 Mermaid diagrams across 25 modules.","tree":{"sha":"33ad13a8ca2847dea0612c32caeebf570a894f1f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ajju853/SystemDesignHandbook/git/trees/33ad13a8ca2847dea0612c32caeebf570a894f1f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ajju853/SystemDesignHandbook/git/commits/566426ceaa12e9cefe54cd76341683cbdaf704d0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146695622?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajju853/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajju853/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajju853/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajju853/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ajju853","id":146695622,"login":"ajju853","node_id":"U_kgDOCL5lxg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajju853/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajju853/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajju853/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajju853/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajju853/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajju853","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ajju853/SystemDesignHandbook/commit/566426ceaa12e9cefe54cd76341683cbdaf704d0","node_id":"C_kwDOSw348doAKDU2NjQyNmNlYWExMmU5Y2VmZTU0Y2Q3NjM0MTY4M2NiZGFmNzA0ZDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/a