, API/container security, threat modeling, compliance)\n- Observability: 18 files (SLI/SLO deep, commercial tools, dashboards, oncall, eBPF, maturity model, K8s observability)\n- Case Studies: 25 files (Slack, Discord, TikTok, Stripe, LinkedIn, Zoom, DoorDash)\n- Projects: 19 files (video conf, chat, events, airline, banking ledger, healthcare EMR)\n- Interview Prep: 26 files (Tinder, distributed KV, notifications, collab editor, elevator, cache, job scheduler, rec sys)\n- Staff Engineer: 19 files (mentorship, strategy, migrations, API versioning, exec comm, hiring, tech debt, incident, culture, growth)\n- 100% Mermaid diagram coverage (400/400 files)","tree":{"sha":"0f3446a0c2f95732a8458563e3973c878a3f6ea5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ajju853/SystemDesignHandbook/git/trees/0f3446a0c2f95732a8458563e3973c878a3f6ea5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ajju853/SystemDesignHandbook/git/commits/9c8504371bcf4c50463a1c44a0d154bc275d902d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146695622?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajju853/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajju853/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajju853/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajju853/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ajju853","id":146695622,"login":"ajju853","node_id":"U_kgDOCL5lxg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajju853/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajju853/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajju853/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajju853/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajju853/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajju853","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":