89cd98baedfd","node_id":"C_kwDOSw9BL9oAKDMxYWE1MmNlY2Q2YTkyMDMyODQ4MjkxMmEwMTY4OWNkOThiYWVkZmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/edly-io/frontend-app-sessions/commit/c4511be71e6b772f8d04dcaca0e0935d8e012230","sha":"c4511be71e6b772f8d04dcaca0e0935d8e012230","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edly-io/frontend-app-sessions/commits/c4511be71e6b772f8d04dcaca0e0935d8e012230"}],"sha":"31aa52cecd6a920328482912a01689cd98baedfd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edly-io/frontend-app-sessions/commits/31aa52cecd6a920328482912a01689cd98baedfd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57627710?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eemaanamir/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eemaanamir/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eemaanamir/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eemaanamir/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/eemaanamir","id":57627710,"login":"eemaanamir","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3NjI3NzEw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eemaanamir/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eemaanamir/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eemaanamir/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eemaanamir/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eemaanamir/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/eemaanamir","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edly-io/frontend-app-sessions/commits/c4511be71e6b772f8d04dcaca0e0935d8e012230/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T12:08:51Z","email":"57627710+eemaanamir@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Eemaan Amir"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T12:08:51Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(sessions): scope instructor pickers to the picked course + handle all-on-leave (#41)\n\nTwo related regressions in the session-scheduling flow:\n\n- ScheduleMeetingModal dropped the course filter for non-lecture session\n  types, so the Instructor list fell back to every instructor in the\n  program''s city. It now passes the picked course whenever one is\n  selected — regardless of session type. Helper text under the field\n  reflects the actual scope, and switching course clears the stale\n  selection.\n\n- AssignSubstituteModal listed every city instructor, including those\n  on approved leave. It now course-scopes the same way, filters out\n  instructors on leave on the session''s date, shows a prominent session\n  summary (title, course, time), and — when every candidate is on leave\n  — swaps the picker for a warning + Cancel Session button that\n  cancels the session and closes the request in one action.\n\nSubstitute Requests row:\n- Hide the row''s actions once a substitute is assigned (previously only\n  hidden on ''closed''); the request is resolved.\n- Substitute column now lists every cover pulled from the session''s\n  current roster (with the on-leave instructor removed), formatted as\n  \"Name (email)\" — previously only one substitute rendered.","tree":{"sha":"b58bfb464015e2117ffc50d14bc7f3c191745601","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edly-io/frontend-app-sessions/git/trees/b58bfb464015e2117ffc50d14bc7f3c191745601"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edly-io/frontend-app-sessions/git/commits/c4511be71e6b772f8d04dcaca0e0935d8e012230","verification":{"payload":"tree b58bfb464015e2117ffc50d14bc7f3c191745601\nparent 98b7b56fbc7a36d53c505d23b1435e5c9249b2ed\nauthor Eemaan Amir <57627710+eemaanamir@users.noreply.github.com> 1790251731 +0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790251731 +0500\n\nfix(sessions): scope instructor pickers to the picked course + handle all-on-leave (#41)\n\nTwo related regressions in the session-scheduling flow:\n\n- ScheduleMeetingModal dropped the course filter for non-lecture session\n  types, so the Instructor list fell back to every instructor in the\n  program''s city. It now passes the picked course whenever one is\n  selected — regardless of session type. Helper text under the field\n  reflects the actual scope, and switching course clears the stale\n  selection.\n\n- AssignSubstituteModal listed every city instructor, including those\n  on approved leave. It now course-scopes the same way, filters out\n  instructors on leave on the session''s date, shows a prominent session\n  summary (title, course, time), and — when every candidate is on leave\n  — swaps the picker for a warning + Cancel Session button that\n  cancels the session and closes the request in one action.\n\nSubstitute Requests row:\n- Hide the row''s actions once a substitute is assigned (previously only\n  hidden on ''closed''); the request is resolved.\n- Substitute column now lists every cover pulled from the session''s\n  current roster (with the on-leave instructor removed), formatted as\n  \"Name (email)\" — previously only one substitute rendered.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqtRLTCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAJZIQAIsrh0fIcqzuz9KDaUJXQbkH\n4l7UV8Z5I9CqBTVXTGhgMa6tXiGJ8ArEOMG7R4H1A4/qTudWlDpZNnY7Aagcdwvg\nDMeQcQPQ/cQGKFG2K8yPCVz4DpSOs8v0M01rl1Gho8zVt5sJMiYDBMVpvPdlCv4q\numsQTyYcIk95hR3CWPFuagbTvlmX2Maf314+vE4hlUWMXLE5Y5Ycxa2gQrgqfd2j\nI1NuUJNZ6nlKkWZ2BAXIVfrGeMcItwhmk7XbGy1cKMMJqtKjpvkouwVK12wJ7/VW\nRkj/3M5PInAN2fdyQ/syi2hwooM7+v50tpSFM3KGiAXDwAOUV/Be4TDcBf/UuOLr\n5zqW/WZ84leZp+k5wETS09/F+KQIybeLrn4zyT3vbn8LSSzW6Jlg1geIw2QCGgUb\n+nBnIy78MLySqz3eTodnz5Qu2U1fMqhx13Nc8pIw0E/p1WcNI6fG1gQeKEigfvtO\nKjiStHcMGxMha1qfmilPuQlK0SmkV3HLfXrsO7uwh1Mec8ssgSbRhCNS03SQFIDp\nwA4E70wGZYHQQM9gCoeYNUJ9Dw8Wrixqx9dqmR7fuxKZJK4bVrW+8ZqCsiNDqkwQ\nMcxCt9y2yfbIyqGZEePVitEOuN2gjWL5oT2QndiQfuykHn90q1mOtutn5SIrd/If\n49cNgUZHv+SVxEyUzszu\n=J1L0\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-24T12:08:51Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/edly-io/frontend-app-sessions/commit/c4511be71e6b772f8d04dcaca0e0935d8e012230","node_id":"C_kwDOSw9BL9oAKGM0NTExYmU3MWU2Yjc3MmY4ZDA0ZGNhY2EwZTA5MzVkOGUwMTIyMzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/edly-io/frontend-app-sessions/commit/98b7b56fbc7a36d53c505d23b1435e5c9249b2ed","sha":"98b7b56fbc7a36d53c505d23b1435e5c9249b2ed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edly-io/frontend-app-sessions/commits/98b7b56fbc7a36d53c505d23b1435e5c9249b2ed"}],"sha":"c4511be71e6b772f8d04dcaca0e0935d8e012230","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edly-io/frontend-app-sessions/commits/c4511be71e6b772f8d04dcaca0e0935d8e012230"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57627710?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eemaanamir/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eemaanamir/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eemaanamir/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eemaanamir/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/eemaanamir","id":57627710,"login":"eemaanamir","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3NjI3NzEw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eemaanamir/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eemaanamir/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eemaanamir/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eemaanamir/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eemaanamir/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/eemaanamir","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edly-io/frontend-app-sessions/commits/98b7b56fbc7a36d53c505d23b1435e5c9249b2ed/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T07:24:42Z","email":"57627710+eemaanamir@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Eemaan Amir"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T07:24:42Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(audit-log): QA fixes — batch grouping, label overrides, session instructor events (#40)\n\n* feat(audit-log): QA fixes — batch grouping, label overrides, session instructor events\n\n- AuditLogTable: batch grouping — consecutive LogEntries sharing a batch_id\n  are collapsed into a single expandable row; rowType/batchId/batchCount\n  properties replace _type/_batchId/_count to satisfy lint naming rules\n- AuditLogTable: change-aware label overrides for session cancellations\n  (status→cancelled shows Cancelled) and leave state transitions\n  (approved/rejected/withdrawn/cancelled show the appropriate label)\n- CalendarPage: add sessioninstructor to audit log models so instructor\n  add/remove events appear alongside session events in the calendar audit log\n\n* feat(audit-log): clear filter and multi-model filter labels\n\n- hasActiveFilters includes recordFilter so clear button appears on\n  record-linked views\n- handleClearFilters propagates to parent via onClearFilter()\n- MULTI_MODEL_FILTER_LABELS for session+sessioninstructor (Calendar) and\n  leaverequest+remotesessionrequest+substituterequest (Requests) so\n  dropdown labels match the table action labels\n\n* refactor(audit-log): use IconButtonWithTooltip for the full-history action\n\nReplaces the unicode-arrow link Button with Paragon''s IconButtonWithTooltip\nusing the History icon, and removes the SCSS overrides that were faking a\nlink appearance. The row action is now a proper icon-only control with a\ntooltip.","tree":{"sha":"7043dc5ceda1cd36225250ad9f1364fee2181926","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edly-io/frontend-app-sessions/git/trees/7043dc5ceda1cd36225250ad9f1364fee2181926"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edly-io/frontend-app-sessions/git/commits/98b7b56fbc7a36d53c505d23b1435e5c9249b2ed","verification":{"payload":"tree 7043dc5ceda1cd36225250ad9f1364fee2181926\nparent 0a54ec3ee5f84996f9f3f86d21ae04a3cae7e6b0\nauthor Eemaan Amir <57627710+eemaanamir@users.noreply.github.com> 1790234682 +0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790234682 +0500\n\nfeat(audit-log): QA fixes — batch grouping, label overrides, session instructor events (#40)\n\n* feat(audit-log): QA fixes — batch grouping, label overrides, session instructor events\n\n- AuditLogTable: batch grouping — consecutive LogEntries sharing a batch_id\n  are collapsed into a single expandable row; rowType/batchId/batchCount\n  properties replace _type/_batchId/_count to satisfy lint naming rules\n- AuditLogTable: change-aware label overrides for session cancellations\n  (status→cancelled shows Cancelled) and leave state transitions\n  (approved/rejected/withdrawn/cancelled show the appropriate label)\n- CalendarPage: add sessioninstructor to audit log models so instructor\n  add/remove events appear alongside session events in the calendar audit log\n\n* feat(audit-log): clear filter and multi-model filter labels\n\n- hasActiveFilters includes recordFilter so clear button appears on\n  record-linked views\n- handleClearFilters propagates to parent via onClearFilter()\n- MULTI_MODEL_FILTER_LABELS for session+sessioninstructor (Calendar) and\n  leaverequest+remotesessionrequest+substituterequest (Requests) so\n  dropdown labels match the table action labels\n\n* refactor(audit-log): use IconButtonWithTooltip for the full-history action\n\nReplaces the unicode-arrow link Button with Paragon''s IconButtonWithTooltip\nusing the History icon, and removes the SCSS overrides that were faking a\nlink appearance. The row action is now a proper icon-only control with a\ntooltip.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqtNA6CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAp44QAEOsUGsh17eiWojUOaAPMEie\nq4+yLpuOxoYg9gr6cH+L5ItNcRkTe53DuIYlJeGRA8BM3Ru1DYx8Ro4mu7K78Ge9\nJ6bwxN21uQOxBP/PlYg9gySbS4VGDJVdPpadEoO9CVpLK8yZWaE7ju4VcN0+Q2AL\nBSBhNylT4G5Ks5fWeh/DHTAwzanvGmA/C4GYGPLzZr7xu3yYmjx4IcHwDBdXa0Ql\nu+O7EduE0Jhka+no7V0dyBtdtScmS8Px1Fb/7xJIZwSakTbospWu64vLmiziJdTg\n3MBackyB33FRYw88WieeTDzTM1S6/kxAnKgxx+qT19iWH3jmPRVLINUspS2zBkcy\niIe5cNxGguPl4h5/LN1TGiSYZIgcscwjpbKGhBlGl1BcOe3d14ZFkfJNO+HnjTzj\nYxFzvXbB2RcMOzGwtKHAF3Ljx9rT1x1I6ePG9H9xYSfIEGuU88mAC4Zvepw6IYDD\nlU17Uzma4k7ZSW/p1WqcLb5vCUpIN8p/3Nk4ULhhEJO4JuHvbMh+10hPFG+1Gf8p\niNUm0ikfBF+SAi37epiUFmP216ckqwuH+6L00OyEX/8yy/xu2dSIqRIYpCTah4Qc\nak2nL5OQ41078CT2xwiQlO0HEiC5xF0hNlOrOUH2G/JioJSSuGCYfA0A3YiNOLCA\nR0Qs72GtOg8d+tSjVvEQ\n=dY04\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-24T07:24:43Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"ht