"html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/edly-io/frontend-app-sessions/commit/2535c2a8f5b43550e09b9bac38647eedef089b10","node_id":"C_kwDOSw9BL9oAKDI1MzVjMmE4ZjViNDM1NTBlMDliOWJhYzM4NjQ3ZWVkZWYwODliMTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/edly-io/frontend-app-sessions/commit/db2a3dab7a8ac1a35792fccdb070832d75e6ab07","sha":"db2a3dab7a8ac1a35792fccdb070832d75e6ab07","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edly-io/frontend-app-sessions/commits/db2a3dab7a8ac1a35792fccdb070832d75e6ab07"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/edly-io/frontend-app-sessions/commit/69c523783ee3b043c07331daaf27b8808bc79a23","sha":"69c523783ee3b043c07331daaf27b8808bc79a23","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edly-io/frontend-app-sessions/commits/69c523783ee3b043c07331daaf27b8808bc79a23"}],"sha":"2535c2a8f5b43550e09b9bac38647eedef089b10","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edly-io/frontend-app-sessions/commits/2535c2a8f5b43550e09b9bac38647eedef089b10"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260585696?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/muhammadammar-ma","id":260585696,"login":"muhammadammar-ma","node_id":"U_kgDOD4g44A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edly-io/frontend-app-sessions/commits/69c523783ee3b043c07331daaf27b8808bc79a23/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T00:54:18Z","email":"muhammad.ammar@arbisoft.com","name":"Muhammad Ammar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T00:54:18Z","email":"muhammad.ammar@arbisoft.com","name":"Muhammad Ammar"},"message":"test(calendar): cover ScheduleMeetingModal scheduling and recurrence payloads\n\nScheduleMeetingModal had no test coverage, so the recurrence payload rules\nwere only verified through the backend contract.\n\nAdds 29 tests over the create, edit, correction and description-only paths,\nwith the load-bearing cases pinned:\n\n- create sends is_recurring plus the recurrence rules; edit sends neither,\n  because an edit applies to the single occurrence being edited\n- weekly_days is seeded from the start date across the full 1-7 range,\n  including the Saturday and Sunday boundaries\n- daily maps to type 1 and monthly to type 3; multiple weekdays are sorted\n  and comma-joined; Ends-on sends end_date_time instead of end_times\n- recurrence validation: no weekday selected, end date before the start,\n  end date beyond the two-month cap, occurrence count clamped to 30\n- 409 handling: a hard conflict offers no override, and Proceed anyway\n  resubmits the same payload with acknowledge: true\n\nVerified by mutation: reverting the edit-payload guard and narrowing the\nweekday filter back to 2-6 fails exactly the three tests that cover them.","tree":{"sha":"569b7c4a35cbfb1254638310c68eda0f084c9630","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edly-io/frontend-app-sessions/git/trees/569b7c4a35cbfb1254638310c68eda0f084c9630"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edly-io/frontend-app-sessions/git/commits/69c523783ee3b043c07331daaf27b8808bc79a23","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260585696?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/muhammadammar-ma","id":260585696,"login":"muhammadammar-ma","node_id":"U_kgDOD4g44A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/edly-io/frontend-app-sessions/commit/69c523783ee3b043c07331daaf27b8808bc79a23","node_id":"C_kwDOSw9BL9oAKDY5YzUyMzc4M2VlM2IwNDNjMDczMzFkYWFmMjdiODgwOGJjNzlhMjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/edly-io/frontend-app-sessions/commit/6a9170b6a8b6cea6c37f6f5c56997cd2c500d5f8","sha":"6a9170b6a8b6cea6c37f6f5c56997cd2c500d5f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edly-io/frontend-app-sessions/commits/6a9170b6a8b6cea6c37f6f5c56997cd2c500d5f8"}],"sha":"69c523783ee3b043c07331daaf27b8808bc79a23","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edly-io/frontend-app-sessions/commits/69c523783ee3b043c07331daaf27b8808bc79a23"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260585696?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/muhammadammar-ma","id":260585696,"login":"muhammadammar-ma","node_id":"U_kgDOD4g44A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edly-io/frontend-app-sessions/commits/6a9170b6a8b6cea6c37f6f5c56997cd2c500d5f8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T16:36:17Z","email":"muhammad.ammar@arbisoft.com","name":"Muhammad Ammar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T16:36:17Z","email":"muhammad.ammar@arbisoft.com","name":"Muhammad Ammar"},"message":"fix(calendar): stop sending recurrence rules on session edits\n\nRecurrence is fixed when a session is created, and an edit applies to the\nsingle occurrence being edited — the backend has no series-wide update. The\nmodal nonetheless rebuilt the rules and sent is_recurring plus recurrence on\nevery PATCH, where the view''s field allow-list silently dropped them. Send\nthem on create only, so the request says what it actually does.\n\nAlso corrects a comment claiming Zoom recurrence type 1 means \"every\nweekday\"; it is every day, weekends included.","tree":{"sha":"793561d78a31f9a6411609c3dac5ed764ef1a000","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edly-io/frontend-app-sessions/git/trees/793561d78a31f9a6411609c3dac5ed764ef1a000"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edly-io/frontend-app-sessions/git/commits/6a9170b6a8b6cea6c37f6f5c56997cd2c500d5f8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260585696?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/muhammadammar-ma","id":260585696,"login":"muhammadammar-ma","node_id":"U_kgDOD4g44A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/edly-io/frontend-app-sessions/commit/6a9170b6a8b6cea6c37f6f5c56997cd2c500d5f8","node_id":"C_kwDOSw9BL9oAKDZhOTE3MGI2YThiNmNlYTZjMzdmNmY1YzU2OTk3Y2QyYzUwMGQ1Zjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/edly-io/frontend-app-sessions/commit/d9e8017102d12062b10688637ad4aaa4ac422c66","sha":"d9e8017102d12062b10688637ad4aaa4ac422c66","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edly-io/frontend-app-sessions/commits/d9e8017102