o}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbirali/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbirali","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edly-io/frontend-app-sessions/commits/330f21fe57f0ed0af31144540e5eb3cf5d297001/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T16:28:30Z","email":"rahat.ali@arbisoft.com","name":"Rahat Ali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T16:28:30Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"refactor: use a Paragon ButtonGroup for the page view toggles (#30)\n\nThe Audit Log / list toggle on the Attendance, Requests, Locations and\nCalendar pages was a `Tabs`/`Tab` pair restyled by ~70 lines of local SCSS\nto stop looking like tabs. It announced itself to assistive tech as a\ntablist even though nothing below it is a tab panel, and every page\nrepeated the same override.\n\nReplaced with Paragon''s `ButtonGroup` - small, filled primary for the\nactive view and outlined for the inactive one - right aligned and free to\nwrap on narrow screens. The overrides in `index.scss` go with it. Page\nstate, handlers and the rendered views are unchanged; the two tests that\nqueried `role=\"tab\"` now query `role=\"button\"`.","tree":{"sha":"3621bbf5aa9ad1e5ba7b8e7acc10e22f355395f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edly-io/frontend-app-sessions/git/trees/3621bbf5aa9ad1e5ba7b8e7acc10e22f355395f2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edly-io/frontend-app-sessions/git/commits/330f21fe57f0ed0af31144540e5eb3cf5d297001","verification":{"payload":"tree 3621bbf5aa9ad1e5ba7b8e7acc10e22f355395f2\nparent 948ba012857efe313b5ec5c086c871aee8f5ec57\nauthor Rahat Ali <rahat.ali@arbisoft.com> 1789403310 +0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789403310 +0500\n\nrefactor: use a Paragon ButtonGroup for the page view toggles (#30)\n\nThe Audit Log / list toggle on the Attendance, Requests, Locations and\nCalendar pages was a `Tabs`/`Tab` pair restyled by ~70 lines of local SCSS\nto stop looking like tabs. It announced itself to assistive tech as a\ntablist even though nothing below it is a tab panel, and every page\nrepeated the same override.\n\nReplaced with Paragon''s `ButtonGroup` - small, filled primary for the\nactive view and outlined for the inactive one - right aligned and free to\nwrap on narrow screens. The overrides in `index.scss` go with it. Page\nstate, handlers and the rendered views are unchanged; the two tests that\nqueried `role=\"tab\"` now query `role=\"button\"`.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqqCCuCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAlrEQABiDV1s+abGWnfnwtLW/wkDK\nWeli/k/IFKBgrv04m5tN1bFVdh/LvwdPcSuCizL1/pNNHHmW6QS4jv7wBaItAV1U\nVQQUVha/Dl5hCu9QgoiOh/YhYFF4FviUf1OPAjmirRdjQ47rGqTeTJV1kVt5nahH\nWacXhw7slR/+DJ4gy6e/ELTRT/yRvyQ0H8lkySBxHBzOhx6XoEq2x6aGTnKHs8tT\nWn+w77meWc93nMFU+xrOGOpyYPo44x0XZPMWYglokVTUfmdbKxpnxwKXRk4KpBPV\nRo3XvG5cTwSrNIIs02qh6KsHr7mugBK5MYcHKxTQi5NGUH8Esj7bqb1NcufEs9px\ngeu21KLZJLS0mgauqF000mhjKWJDLTgnywxJstYcgAow2iaT077KTh5zmFLVhq5X\nESeDqarAA/c80vfLLyAZXvslEv3tCbv9PyRew/O/e5J1CUi9vYshNBwBAqjiaHzJ\nPlkl/EFQJYnb49e+ZGX5Q7Yn1acpQ3fUQkSYwMKftsLL2c9tzFmcct8thE6f1S7r\nXAGNIkkTXyhRBKLSrRaMpmgkfGviAE0r2rwdIzicHB9CG/+CUKwprYQpSsphorN/\nT4S2L/V83GBHDGAJWCwqLkxoSz2zuQJn10NXqUFhRj/XSJJ322bth72W894qGb64\n++VagmT4fnwvA/277/r6\n=P60i\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-14T16:28:30Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_even