 confirmation modal with a required justification note, mirroring the\nserver-side gate. A \"review carefully\" warning is shown inline on past-dated\nrows, and the note-modal is reused with a configurable confirm variant/label\nand a note-required flag that disables confirm until text is entered.\n\nAdds an isLeaveStartDatePast util (noon-parsed to avoid timezone off-by-one)\nwith tests, and covers the new approval flows in AdminRequestsView tests.","tree":{"sha":"8b3996272e27227929cbea357911fa569e6c2879","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edly-io/frontend-app-sessions/git/trees/8b3996272e27227929cbea357911fa569e6c2879"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edly-io/frontend-app-sessions/git/commits/58842c1ebe3786774d1f6471f4bd01aaa5fca5ed","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260585696?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/muhammadammar-ma","id":260585696,"login":"muhammadammar-ma","node_id":"U_kgDOD4g44A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/edly-io/frontend-app-sessions/commit/58842c1ebe3786774d1f6471f4bd01aaa5fca5e