A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edly-io/frontend-app-sessions/commits/53b6a1d492361ee88629121a767b8e8733360968/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-09T11:44:26Z","email":"muhammad.ammar@arbisoft.com","name":"Muhammad Ammar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-09T11:48:46Z","email":"muhammad.ammar@arbisoft.com","name":"Muhammad Ammar"},"message":"feat(requests): warn trainees when a full-day leave covers sessions\n\nFor a full-day leave the session picker is hidden, so a trainee had no\nindication that the selected date range overlaps scheduled sessions —\nthey''d unknowingly take leave across sessions they should attend.\n\nShow an inline info notice directly below the date-range pickers when a\nfull-day leave range contains scheduled sessions: \"You have N scheduled\nsession(s) during this leave period.\" The sessions are already fetched for\nthe range (and auto-selected for full-day leave), so this reuses existing\nstate with no extra request.\n\nScoped to trainees (non-instructors): instructors already get a\nsubmit-time warning listing the covered sessions (PR #8), so this avoids\nshowing them two overlapping warnings.\n\nAdd tests covering the notice appearing with sessions in range and being\nabsent when the range covers none.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e0997a106b5cdc90cbea343922c690c301d0ed71","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edly-io/frontend-app-sessions/git/trees/e0997a106b5cdc90cbea343922c690c301d0ed71"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edly-io/frontend-app-sessions/git/commits/53b6a1d492361ee88629121a767b8e8733360968","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260585696?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/muhammadammar-ma","id":260585696,"login":"muhammadammar-ma","node_id":"U_kgDOD4g44A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/edly-io/frontend-app-sessions/commit/53b6a1d492361ee88629121a767b8e8733360968","node_id":"C_kwDOSw9BL9oAKDUzYjZhMWQ0OTIzNjFlZTg4NjI5MTIxYTc2N2I4ZTg3MzMzNjA5Njg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/edly-io/frontend-app-sessions/commit/a01055ef1a7f7c9a0d4b731d80f1a345be15f245","sha":"a01055ef1a7f7c9a0d4b731d80f1a345be15f245","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edly-io/frontend-app-sessions/commits/a01055ef1a7f7c9a0d4b731d80f1a345be15f245"}],"sha":"53b6a1d492361ee88629121a767b8e8733360968","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edly-io/frontend-app-sessions/commits/53b6a1d492361ee88629121a767b8e8733360968"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260585696?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/muhammadammar-ma","id":260585696,"login":"muhammadammar-ma","node_id":"U_kgDOD4g44A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edly-io/frontend-app-sessions/commits/a01055ef1a7f7c9a0d4b731d80f1a345be15f245/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-09T09:19:54Z","email":"muhammad.ammar@arbisoft.com","name":"Muhammad Ammar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-09T10:37:08Z","email":"muhammad.ammar@arbisoft.com","name":"Muhammad Ammar"},"message":"fix(requests): use a neutral badge color for withdrawn leave\n\nA withdrawn leave rendered a green \"success\" badge — visually identical to\nan approved leave — because REQUEST_STATUS_VARIANTS mapped WITHDRAWN to\n''success''. On the trainee view this made a withdrawn (terminal, no-longer-\nactive) leave read as active/approved.\n\nMap WITHDRAWN to ''secondary'' (neutral grey) instead, matching CANCELLED,\nwhich is the same kind of terminal/inactive outcome. RequestStatusBadge\nreads this central map, so the change corrects the badge everywhere it is\nshown (learner view, admin view, calendar popups) in one place.\n\nAdd a test pinning WITHDRAWN -> ''secondary''.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a88cf79dc4b3141d7a990600d8cfc79ab10160c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edly-io/frontend-app-sessions/git/trees/a88cf79dc4b3141d7a990600d8cfc79ab10160c4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edly-io/frontend-app-sessions/git/commits/a01055ef1a7f7c9a0d4b731d80f1a345be15f245","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260585696?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/muhammadammar-ma","id":260585696,"login":"muhammadammar-ma","node_id":"U_kgDOD4g44A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/edly-io/frontend-app-sessions/commit/a01055ef1a7f7c9a0d4b731d80f1a345be15f245","node_id":"C_kwDOSw9BL9oAKGEwMTA1NWVmMWE3ZjdjOWEwZDRiNzMxZDgwZjFhMzQ1YmUxNWYyNDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/edly-io/frontend-app-sessions/commit/3ee5c30b67cd1646cc69aeb2a084e76c74ed57c2","sha":"3ee5c30b67cd1646cc69aeb2a084e76c74ed57c2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edly-io/frontend-app-sessions/commits/3ee5c30b67cd1646cc69aeb2a084e76c74ed57c2"}],"sha":"a01055ef1a7f7c9a0d4b731d80f1a345be15f245","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edly-io/frontend-app-sessions/commits/a01055ef1a7f7c9a0d4b731d80f1a345be15f245"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260585696?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/muhammadammar-ma","id":260585696,"login":"muhammadammar-ma","node_id":"U_kgDOD4g44A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edly-io/frontend-app-sessions/commits/3ee5c30b67cd1646cc69aeb2a084e76c74ed57c2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-09T08:40:41Z","email":"muhammad.ammar@arbisoft.com","name":"Muhammad Ammar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-09T10:37:08Z","email":"muhammad.ammar@arbisoft.com","name":"Muhammad Ammar"},"message":"feat(requests): indicate that Medical/Emergency leave requires an attachment\n\nMED and EMER leave categories require a supporting attachment — isValid()\nblocks submission without one — but the modal gave no explanation. The\nonly cue was a red asterisk on the Attachment label, which sits at the\nvery bottom of a tall form and is below the fold in the fixed-height\nmodal, so users hit a silently disabled Submit with no idea why.\n\nAdd an inline note directly under the Leave category dropdown, shown when\nMED or EMER is selected: \"Medical and Emergency leave require a\nsupporting attachment.\" Placing it at the point of decision (top of the\nform) keeps it visible without scrolling. It uses text-info (informational\nblue) rather than a red/error style, since it is guidance, not an error.\n\nAdd a test asserting the note appears for MED and is absent for CASUAL.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2d227c7d68b68d0c23cc77c4b19cac058959e5b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edly-io/frontend-app-sessions/git/trees/2d227c7d68b68d0c23cc77c4b19cac058959e5b4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edly-io/frontend-app-sessions/git/commits/3ee5c30b67cd1646cc69aeb2a084e76c74ed57c2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260585696?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/muhammadammar-ma","id":260585696,"login":"muhammadammar-ma","node_id":"U_kgDOD4g44A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/edly-io/frontend-app-sessions/commit/3ee5c30b67cd1646cc69aeb2a084e76c74ed57c2","node_id":"C_kwDOSw9BL9oAKDNlZTVjMzBiNjdjZDE2NDZjYzY5YWViMmEwODRlNzZjNzRlZDU3YzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/edly-io/frontend-app-sessions/commit/18388e5facc0b03a0171a4097fb6c346202666ed","sha":"18388e5facc0b03a0171a4097fb6c346202666ed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edly-io/frontend-app-sessions/commits/18388e5facc0b03a0171a4097fb6c346202666ed"}],"sha":"3ee5c30b67cd1646cc69aeb2a084e76c74ed57c2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edly-io/frontend-app-sessions/commits/3ee5c30b67cd1646cc69aeb2a084e76c74ed57c2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260585696?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/muhammadammar-ma","id":260585696,"login":"muhammadammar-ma","node_id":"U_kgDOD4g44A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edly-io/frontend-app-sessions/commits/18388e5facc0b03a0171a4097fb6c346202666ed/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-09T08:32:37Z","email":"muhammad.ammar@arbisoft.com","name":"Muhammad Ammar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-09T10:37:08Z","email":"muhammad.ammar@arbisoft.com","name":"Muhammad Ammar"},"message":"fix(requests): send exclusive end_date when fetching sessions for leave\n\nThe calendar-sessions endpoint treats its date window as half-open\n[start_date, end_date) — end_date is an exclusive upper bound, and every\nother caller (CalendarPage day/week/month views) advances end by one day\nto honour that. CreateRequestModal was the lone exception: it passed the\nraw inclusive picker dates straight through.\n\nFor a session-specific leave the user picks a single date, so start_date\n== end_date. The backend rejects that with HTTP 400\n\"end_date must be after start_date\", making single-day leave impossible.\nMulti-day ranges were silently broken too: end_date landed on the last\nday''s 00:00, so `scheduled_start_time < end` dropped every session on the\nfinal day.\n\nFix: convert endDate to its exclusive bound (+1 day) before calling\ngetCalendarSessions, matching what CalendarPage already does. The\nconversion runs entirely in UTC (parse as ...T00:00:00Z, setUTCDate,\nformat) so it is not shifted by the local timezone — a naive local-parse\n+ toISOString round-trip cancels the +1 in UTC+ zones. setUTCDate also\nnormalises month/year/leap rollovers (Jul 31 -> Aug 1, Dec 31 -> Jan 1,\nFeb 28 -> Feb 29 on leap years).\n\nThe +1 is applied unconditionally, not only when the dates are equal, so\nboth the single-day 400 and the multi-day last-day-drop are fixed. The\nbackend and the shared getCalendarSessions wrapper are left untouched;\nboth callers remain responsible for sending an exclusive end.\n\nAdd two regression tests asserting the exclusive end is sent for a\nsingle-day selection and across a month boundary.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f8f56058eb58980186b3d656972521e0474b2396","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edly-io/frontend-app-sessions/git/trees/f8f56058eb58980186b3d656972521e0474b2396"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edly-io/frontend-app-sessions/git/commits/18388e5facc0b03a0171a4097fb6c346202666ed","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260585696?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/muhammadammar-ma","id":260585696,"login":"muhammadammar-ma","node_id":"U_kgDOD4g44A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/muhammadammar-ma","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/edly-io/frontend-app-sessions/commit/18388e5facc0b03a0171a4097fb6c346202666ed","node_id":"C_kwDOSw9BL9oAKDE4Mzg4ZTVmYWNjMGIwM2EwMTcxYTQwOTdmYjZjMzQ2MjAyNjY2ZWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/edly-io/frontend-app-sessions/commit/3292c648726d561838487ab0bf680c9da9079572","sha":"3292c648726d561838487ab0bf680c9da9079572","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edly-io/frontend-app-sessions/commits/3292c648726d561838487ab0bf680c9da9079572"}],"sha":"18388e5facc0b03a0171a4097fb6c346202666ed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edly-io/frontend-app-sessions/commits/18388e5facc0b03a0171a4097fb6c346202666ed"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82031750?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saqib-Rafique