gnature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82031750?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saqib-Rafique/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saqib-Rafique/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saqib-Rafique/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saqib-Rafique/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Saqib-Rafique","id":82031750,"login":"Saqib-Rafique","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyMDMxNzUw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saqib-Rafique/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saqib-Rafique/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saqib-Rafique/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saqib-Rafique/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saqib-Rafique/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saqib-Rafique","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/edly-io/frontend-app-sessions/commit/6899e62c1b0e5a5ef3ecbcc50ed6a0e7e267a478","node_id":"C_kwDOSw9BL9oAKDY4OTllNjJjMWIwZTVhNWVmM2VjYmNjNTBlZDZhMGU3ZTI2N2E0Nzg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/edly-io/frontend-app-sessions/commit/618b8e0539aeee6e9874963bcee26098bad01a16","sha":"618b8e0539aeee6e9874963bcee26098bad01a16","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edly-io/frontend-app-sessions/commits/618b8e0539aeee6e9874963bcee26098bad01a16"}],"sha":"6899e62c1b0e5a5ef3ecbcc50ed6a0e7e267a478","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edly-io/frontend-app-sessions/commits/6899e62c1b0e5a5ef3ecbcc50ed6a0e7e267a478"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57627710?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eemaanamir/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eemaanamir/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eemaanamir/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eemaanamir/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/eemaanamir","id":57627710,"login":"eemaanamir","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3NjI3NzEw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eemaanamir/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eemaanamir/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eemaanamir/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eemaanamir/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eemaanamir/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/eemaanamir","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edly-io/frontend-app-sessions/commits/618b8e0539aeee6e9874963bcee26098bad01a16/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-06T12:39:25Z","email":"57627710+eemaanamir@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Eemaan Amir"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-06T12:39:25Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: redesign attendance tab with per-course and per-learner views (#7)\n\n* feat(attendance): redesign attendance tab with per-course and per-learner views\n\n- Replace old session list / course summary sub-tabs with By Course and By Learner views\n- PerCourseView: course selector → session list → roster; uses dedicated\n  GET /v1/courses/{id}/sessions/ endpoint (no client-side filtering)\n- PerLearnerView: program learner picker + course selector → paginated\n  records table; learners fetched from GET /programs/{key}/learners/\n- AttendanceRosterPage: rebuilt on single getAttendanceRoster call; 4-state\n  model (present/absent/leave/pending); marking_window_open gate; reason\n  modal for status overrides; live note save via mark-attendance notes field;\n  smart 💬/+ note icon driven by roster notes field\n- Attendance tab hidden for instructors; learners see My Attendance only\n- Reduce ATTENDANCE_STATUS from 6 states to 4 (remove late/left_early/partial)\n\n* feat(attendance): Phase 1 backend migration + roster UI redesign\n\n- Migrate deprecated GET /v1/records/ calls to canonical GET /v1/trainees/{id}/attendance/\n- Add getCourseSummary for GET /v1/courses/{id}/attendance-summary/\n- Add getCourseSessionsList for GET /v1/courses/{id}/sessions/\n- Revive CourseSummaryReport with real endpoint; add Summary sub-tab and route\n- Fix note + button disappearing after save by reloading full roster post-markAttendance\n- Fix reason modal not triggering on status change after save (same root cause: record_id was null)\n- Add Change reason column to attendance roster\n- Replace radio buttons with pill-style toggle buttons in StatusCell\n- Merge Learner + Email into single LearnerCell; remove standalone Email column\n\n* fix(attendance): pass program_key to GET /v1/trainees/{id}/attendance/\n\nBackend requires program_key query param on the per-learner attendance endpoint.\n\n* fix(attendance): pass program_key to attendance-summary and trainees endpoints\n\n* feat(attendance): immediate per-change saves; inline editing in By Learner tab\n\n- Remove bulk Save button from roster — each status change now calls\n  POST /sessions/{id}/mark-attendance/ immediately\n- Reason modal confirm triggers the API call directly instead of buffering\n- PerLearnerView: add inline Present/Absent pill buttons for admin users\n  when marking_window_open is true; reason modal for records that already\n  exist; silent roster reload after save to pick up fresh record_ids\n- NoteCell: replace bare ''+'' with ''Add note'' / ''💬 View note'' buttons\n\n* feat(attendance): add note column and modal to By Learner tab\n\n* feat(attendance): inline notes with pencil edit icon; show — for empty reason\n\n* fix(attendance): show edit controls for admin in By Learner tab\n\nmarking_window_open is not in the trainee attendance response so the\ncanEdit check was always false. Removed the check — admin sees pill\nbuttons for all non-leave rows; backend rejects if window is closed.\nAdded BACKEND_REQUESTS.md entry to get the field included per row.\n\n* feat(attendance): sessions-without-course option + align columns with roster\n\n- Add ''Sessions without course'' option to course selector (sentinel __none__);\n  omits course_id param so backend returns programme-only sessions\n- Align By Learner columns with roster: Session | Status | Change reason | Note\n  (removed Source and Marked by; renamed Override reason → Change reason)\n\n* feat(attendance): restore Source/Marked by in both tabs; document field gaps\n\n- Add Source and Marked by columns to both By Course roster and By Learner tab\n- Normalize record_id in PerLearnerView (trainee endpoint uses ''id'', not ''record_id'')\n- Backend request filed for: overridden_by_email + override_reason in roster rows;\n  notes + marking_window_open + record_id alias in trainee attendance rows\n\n* fix(attendance): normalize session_id from trainee attendance API response\n\nThe AttendanceRecordListSerializer returns ''session'' (FK PK) not ''session_id''.\nFall back to row.session in tableData and all direct records[] reads so that\nmark-attendance calls and isSaving checks work without a backend field rename.\nAlso re-enables marking_window_open gating on canEdit (field is in the serializer).\n\n* fix(attendance): show change reason after save; note UX; column order\n\n- Fix change reason showing — after roster reload, fall back to\n  row.override_reason from the API so the column doesn''t reset to -\n- Note cell: show ''Add note'' button (outline) when no note exists,\n  pencil icon + inline text only when a note is present\n- Rename ''Marked by'' -> ''Changed by''; move adjacent to Change reason\n  in both By Course roster and By Learner tab\n\n* fix(attendance): restore course selection on back; highlight By Course tab in session\n\n- Pass ?course_id= when navigating to a session roster so the Back button\n  returns to by-course with the same course pre-selected\n- PerCourseView reads course_id from query params to restore selected course\n- AttendanceSubNav marks By Course tab active when on a /sessions/:id route\n\n* feat(attendance): show disabled Add note button with tooltip when attendance unmarked\n\n* feat(attendance): dashboard tab, bulk export, at-risk filter, marking window display, session roster links\n\n- Rename Summary tab → Dashboard and make it the default landing for admins\n- Add bulk XLSX export button on Dashboard (GET /programs/{key}/attendance-export/)\n- Add attendance threshold and marking window settings with per-field save buttons and info tooltips; save button only appears when value has changed\n- Add at-risk flag display: red attendance %, At Risk badge in learner cell, and All/At Risk filter buttons backed by is_at_risk from API\n- Show marking window remaining days in By Course session table, in the roster info bar (bold), and in By Learner tab\n- Add View Attendance link in session popover and detail modal for admins\n- Rewrite MyAttendanceView: course dropdown first, sessions per course merged with attendance records, Sessions without a course option\n- Add exportProgramAttendance, getAttendanceSettings, updateAttendanceSettings to attendance API\n\n\n* chore: remove BACKEND_REQUESTS.md from repo and ignore local project docs\n\nBACKEND_REQUESTS.md, CLAUDE.md, and FEATURE_CONTEXT.md are local\nworking documents and should not be version-controlled.\n\n\n* test(attendance): update MyAttendanceView tests for course-first UX\n\nThe component was rewritten to show a course selector before any table.\nTests now wrap with MemoryRouter to provide programId via useParams, mock\nfetchProgramCourses and getCourseSessionsList, and simulate course selection\nvia the SearchableSelect dropdown before asserting on table content.\n\n* chore(attendance): rename export button to ''Export Attendance Report''","tree":{"sha":"2fbd08073e799a6e02b27ec0570a0ba8f2778e37","url":"https://api.github.com/re