s://api.github.com/users/eemaanamir/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eemaanamir/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eemaanamir/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eemaanamir/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/eemaanamir","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edly-io/frontend-app-sessions/commits/f46f9d5550245e99fd33853534a705726080c0eb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-30T12:35:17Z","email":"eemaan.amir@gmail.com","name":"eemaanamir"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-30T12:35:17Z","email":"eemaan.amir@gmail.com","name":"eemaanamir"},"message":"feat: migrate to programs API, city-scoped locations, stale-data fix on program switch\n\n- Replace removed LMS course-runs/instructors endpoints with the new CMS\n  programs API: fetchProgramCourses (GET /programs/<key>/courses/) and\n  fetchProgramInstructors (GET /programs/users/?role=instructor&no_page).\n  Updated ScheduleMeetingModal, AssignSubstituteModal, PerLearnerHistoryReport,\n  and CourseSummaryReport to use the new functions; all tests updated.\n\n- City-scoped locations: pass ?program_key= when fetching locations so the\n  backend filters to the program''s city. LocationsPage shows a City column\n  and fetches programInfo on mount. LocationModal receives cityId/cityName\n  and includes city in the create payload. ScheduleMeetingModal location\n  picker is also scoped to the program''s city.\n\n- Fix stale data on program switch: add key={programId} to the content div\n  in SessionsAdminLayout so every page component fully remounts when the\n  selected program changes, clearing all state and re-running all effects.\n\n- Lock session type on edit with tooltip; add program/city context notes\n  in ScheduleMeetingModal under course and instructor fields.\n\n- CalendarPage: fetch programInfo at mount and pass to ScheduleMeetingModal\n  so helper notes are visible immediately when the modal opens.\n\n- HolidayModal: add info banner clarifying holidays are global (not\n  program-specific).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"30060839ace719d13e43a0ff826d4eba72c10387","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edly-io/frontend-app-sessions/git/trees/30060839ace719d13e43a0ff826d4eba72c10387"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edly-io/frontend-app-sessions/git/commits/f46f9d5550245e99fd33853534a705726080c0eb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57627710?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eemaanamir/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eemaanamir/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eemaanamir/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eemaanamir/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/eemaanamir","id":57627710,"login":"eemaanamir","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3NjI3NzEw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eemaanamir/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eemaanamir/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eemaanamir/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eemaanamir/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eemaanamir/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/eemaanamir","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/edly-io/frontend-app-sessions/commit/f46f9d5550245e99fd33853534a705726080c0eb","node_id":"C_kwDOSw9BL9oAKGY0NmY5ZDU1NTAyNDVlOTlmZDMzODUzNTM0YTcwNTcyNjA4MGMwZWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/edly-io/frontend-app-sessions/commit/5679f4d45267bb76a9e04459007fa85cc38aa692","sha":"5679f4d45267bb76a9e04459007fa85cc38aa692","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edly-io/