v"},"message":"Refactor technical execution plan and enhance CI/CD workflows\n\n- Updated the technical execution plan to reflect the current project status, including completed features and remaining tasks for production launch.\n- Improved GitHub Actions workflows for Python tests and linting, ensuring compatibility with updated dependencies and enhancing test coverage.\n- Added new environment variables for Amadeus and Google Places integrations in the API configuration.\n- Enhanced the API gateway to support new chat planning and replan endpoints, along with structured feedback and preferences handling.\n- Updated frontend components to utilize React Query for data fetching and improved user experience with new trip planning features.","tree":{"sha":"c9f0df7820012538485503bc2a4c77d7cd51bf12","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/p172913/Travel-Agents/git/trees/c9f0df7820012538485503bc2a4c77d7cd51bf12"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/p172913/Travel-Agents/git/commits/0d462abfc72b2e4dfeb94fe9db8f165249f69950","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72274012?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p172913/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p172913/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p172913/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p172913/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/p172913","id":72274012,"login":"p172913","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyMjc0MDEy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p172913/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p172913/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p172913/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p172913/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p172913/subscriptions","type":"User","u