/users/loudship/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/loudship","id":216501259,"login":"loudship","node_id":"U_kgDODOeMCw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loudship/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loudship/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loudship/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loudship/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loudship/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/loudship","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/loudship/MasterWebUi/commits/918ba4cf2be859ee69cf47251478348babf05d35/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-14T05:07:45Z","email":"christianoallen618@gmail.com","name":"loudship"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-14T05:07:45Z","email":"christianoallen618@gmail.com","name":"loudship"},"message":"Grok audit follow-up: harden workspace-catalog, excise final patches, add audit tooling\n\n- services/workspace-catalog/main.py: add attachment counting for models, risk-by-kind+specs, _category/_validation/_version helpers, dependency_health, updated API paths (/models/list etc.), richer metadata in catalog items\n\n- Delete all remaining override patches (backend routers for catalog/research + frontend Svelte Catalog* components + patch_*.{mjs,py})\n\n- workspace/open-webui-overrides/: retain only gVisor Dockerfile + new README documenting the post-audit architecture (microservice + reconcile seeding)\n\n- Add ops/audit_config.py: automated zero-trust config auditor (signs in, pulls auth/connections/export, writes ui_audit_report.md)\n\n- Update tests to assert absence of old patch artifacts and presence of transition docs\n\n- ui_audit_report.md: refreshed (2026-06-14, port 3000); all zero-trust vars now match baseline (no mismatches)","tree":{"sha":"2833be065eccf3b0c4f8a581489c9bebd88d239e","url":"https://api.