rivacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loudship/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loudship/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loudship/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/loudship","id":216501259,"login":"loudship","node_id":"U_kgDODOeMCw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loudship/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loudship/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loudship/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loudship/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loudship/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/loudship","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/loudship/MasterWebUi/commits/d54a044f43ab75b086024f8505a5dd5f9c1b1da6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-13T23:45:03Z","email":"christianoallen618@gmail.com","name":"loudship"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-13T23:45:03Z","email":"christianoallen618@gmail.com","name":"loudship"},"message":"Secondary audit fixes: policy constants, _STREAM_NODES, reorganize root scripts\n\n- deep-web-mcp/policy.py: single source of truth for all env-var-driven constants\n  (MAX_CHARS, TASK_REGISTRY_TTL_S, PAGE_TIMEOUT_MS, RESEARCH_* thresholds)\n- extraction.py / research.py: import from policy.py; no more magic numbers\n- langgraph_orchestrator.py: extract _STREAM_NODES frozenset from inline set\n- Root-level cleanup: git mv vram_arbiter*, desktop_eye, swarm_orchestrator -> ops/\n  stress_test_* -> tests/stress/; reset_pwd.py -> scripts/\n- Dockerfile.arbiter: COPY path updated to ops/vram_arbiter_daemon.py\n- tests/stress/stress_test_swarm.py: sys.path fixup for relocated swarm_orchestrator\n- New calendar, telemetry-gateway, pipelines services; new catalog-functions/tools\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"218173c566c14181cb61f8d4af2fe2a36af144d8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/loudship/MasterWebUi/git/trees/218173c566c14181cb61f8d4af2fe2a36af144d8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/loudship/MasterWebUi/git/commits/d54a044f43ab75b086024f8505a5dd5f9c1b1da6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/216501259?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loudship/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loudship/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loudship/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loudship/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/loudship","id":216501259,"login":"loudship","node_id":"U_kgDODOeMCw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loudship/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loudship/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loudship/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loudship/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loudship/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/loudship","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/loudship/MasterWebUi/commit/d54a044f43ab75b086024f8505a5dd5f9c1b1da6","node_id":"C_kwDOSxJuu9oAKGQ1NGEwNDRmNDNhYjc1YjA4NjAyNGY4NTA1YTVkZDVmOWMxYjFkYTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/loudship/MasterWebUi/commit/a26b52edf486789f8c00b1d583646d6db1dbe29b","sha":"a26b52edf486789f8c00b1d583646d6db1dbe29b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/loudship/MasterWebUi/commits/a26b52edf486789f8c00b1d583646d6db1dbe29b"}],"sha":"d54a044f43ab75b086024f8505a5dd5f9c1b1da6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/loudship/MasterWebUi/commits/d54a044f43ab75b086024f8505a5dd5f9c1b1da6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/216501259?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loudship/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loudship/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loudship/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loudship/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/loudship","id":216501259,"login":"loudship","node_id":"U_kgDODOeMCw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loudship/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loudship/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loudship/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loudship/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loudship/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/loudship","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/loudship/MasterWebUi/commits/a26b52edf486789f8c00b1d583646d6db1dbe29b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-13T23:35:58Z","email":"christianoallen618@gmail.com","name":"loudship"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-13T23:35:58Z","email":"christianoallen618@gmail.com","name":"loudship"},"message":"Grok audit overhaul: decompose server.py, consolidate research, kill patches\n\nAddresses all three presumptive blockers from the Grok structural audit.\n\nBlocker 1 — Eliminate source-level patching:\n- patch_main.py and patch_frontend.mjs are now no-op comment stubs; the\n  Dockerfile no longer copies or executes either file.\n- workspace_catalog router extracted into a new standalone FastAPI service\n  (services/workspace-catalog/) that reads from OWUI''s public REST API.\n- docker-compose.yml gains a workspace-catalog service (offline-tools profile,\n  port 9080, admin token via OPEN_WEBUI_API_KEY).\n- reconcile_workspace_catalog.py now embeds risk:* tags natively into tool\n  meta.tags so OWUI renders risk levels without any frontend patching.\n- .env.example documents OPEN_WEBUI_API_KEY.\n\nBlocker 2 — Decompose deep-web-mcp/server.py (was 1144 lines):\n- extraction.py: Crawl4AI engine, task registry, error_block (293 lines)\n- mcp_tools.py: FastMCP instance, Pydantic schemas, @mcp.tool() defs (219 lines)\n- api.py: FastAPI routes, SSE generator, credential storage (271 lines)\n- server.py: wiring only — `from api import app` + uvicorn.run (37 lines)\n\nBlocker 3 — Consolidate research/hop/sufficiency/report into one home:\n- deep-web-mcp/research.py now owns the 4-hop loop, sufficiency gate\n  (_is_sufficient), budget management (total_budget_s), gap-query templates,\n  and report rendering. New params: max_hops (default 1) and total_budget_s.\n- workspace/catalog-tools/web_research.py reduced from 315 → 111 lines:\n  thin httpx caller that passes max_hops=4, total_budget_s=90 to /research.\n  All duplicated loop logic deleted from the catalog tool.\n- /research REST endpoint and research_web MCP tool expose the new params.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ec991e06c110e6ec33e31bf9b8554cabb6c44666","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/loudship/MasterWebUi/git/trees/ec991e06c110e6ec33e31bf9b8554cabb6c44666"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/loudship/MasterWebUi/git/commits/a26b52edf486789f8c00b1d583646d6db1dbe29b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/216501259?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loudship/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loudship/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loudship/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loudship/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/loudship","id":216501259,"login":"loudship","node_id":"U_kgDODOeMCw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loudship/orgs","recei