"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/9091f31a0f3ecee5c3021b2fffc2673127849da6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-06T23:02:29Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-06T23:02:29Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"message":"test(wc-web): pin the federated stylesheet <link> injection (bug 4 regression)\n\nAsserts WeeklyCommitApp injects a <link rel=stylesheet data-wc-remote-theme> on\nmount + cleans it up between tests. Pins the injection MECHANISM (so the bug-4 fix\ncan''t be silently dropped); the href VALUE is a build-time ?url resolution (empty\nunder jsdom) verified against the real vite build dist, not here.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a6e33b4f4c2399ec5e3eff71d0b14faacf03ebdf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/trees/a6e33b4f4c2399ec5e3eff71d0b14faacf03ebdf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/commits/9091f31a0f3ecee5c3021b2fffc2673127849da6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.