:"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/1b3854a0ed01cfda6260b62e9d5c00783931dc71/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-06T22:58:58Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-06T22:58:58Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"message":"fix(wc-web): inject the remote stylesheet via base-resolved ?url (federated CSS, bug 4)\n\nThe embedded Weekly Commit rendered UNSTYLED in the host: theme.css (the single\n@tailwind/Flowbite stylesheet, Lesson #3) was imported only in standalone/main.tsx,\nwhich the federated host never loads, so the exposed tree shipped zero CSS.\n\n@originjs''s auto CSS-injection is unusable with our absolute `--base`: validated the\nlive remoteEntry — its `y()` helper builds the href as base + bare-filename\n(https://wc…/remote/ + theme.css) and DROPS the `assets/` dir → 404. So a plain\nside-effect `import ''./theme.css''` lists the CSS but injects a broken link.\n\nFix: import the stylesheet as a base-resolved URL (`?url`) — Vite resolves the\nPROCESSED css to the correct https://wc…/remote/assets/theme-<hash>.css — and inject\na <link> on mount ourselves (idempotent; harmless if standalone already loaded it\nvia main.tsx). Verified: the WeeklyCommitApp chunk bakes the correct /remote/assets/\nURL, the expose''s @originjs CSS list stays empty (no broken auto-inject), the emitted\ncss is Tailwind-compiled (35k, 0 @tailwind), wc-web 313/313, tsc clean.\n\nRemote-only (host unchanged). REQ-I-008 green (theme.css carries no demo/persona).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f79d6eab70c8ab3c0ff844cb8641026ea7e51d2b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/trees/f79d6eab70c8ab3c0ff844cb8641026ea7e51d2b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/commits/1b3854a0ed01cfda6260b62e9d5c00783931dc71","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commit/1b3854a0ed01cfda6260b62e9d5c00783931dc71","node_id":"C_kwDOSxKwgtoAKDFiMzg1NGEwZWQwMWNmZGE2MjYwYjYyZTlkNWMwMDc4MzkzMWRjNzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commit/b8dc4121da10b616d431bf113f37d86769f0495c","sha":"b8dc4121da10b616d431bf113f37d86769f0495c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/b8dc4121da10b616d431bf113f37d86769f0495c"}],"sha":"1b3854a0ed01cfda6260b62e9d5c00783931dc71","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/1b3854a0ed01cfda6260b62e9d5c00783931dc71"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/b8dc4121da10b616d431bf113f37d86769f0495c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-06T22:41:32Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-06T22:41:32Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"message":"fix(wc-web): register host accessor synchronously — fixes \"No access-token provider configured\" (§29)\n\nLive host bug 3 (after the deadlock + dual-React fixes): the portal mounted but\nerrored with \"Failed to acquire access token / No access-token provider configured\"\n— the remote''s eager first RTK Query (AppRoutes → useCurrentUser → meApi →\nprepareHeaders → getAccessToken()) fired BEFORE WeeklyCommitApp''s mount useEffect\nregistered the host''s getAccessToken. Child effects run before parent effects, so\nthe effect was too late (LESSONS §29). Standalone was unaffected because\nAuth0IdentityProvider wires the seam synchronously; the host path (WeeklyCommitApp''s\nown prop registration) was never runtime-exercised until now.\n\nFix: register the host accessor SYNCHRONOUSLY in a lazy useState initializer during\nrender (before the child AppRoutes renders + dispatches), with a ref so the closure\ntracks the current prop, and unmount cleanup only when this component registered it\n(standalone''s seam stays owned by Auth0IdentityProvider). Mirrors the §29 pattern.\n\nAdds WeeklyCommitApp.accessor-timing.test.tsx — a probe replacing AppRoutes that\nasserts the seam is wired AT the child''s first render (catches the ordering; the\nprior test passed even with the buggy useEffect). wc-web 313/313; host tsc clean;\nremote dist unchanged in shape (WeeklyCommitApp expose + 5 shared chunks).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e249f49265d204a1eb18a25d794b1828b0f7d6a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/trees/e249f49265d204a1eb18a25d794b1828b0f7d6a2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/commits/b8dc4121da10b616d431bf113f37d86769f0495c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commit/b8dc4121da10b616d431bf113f37d86769f0495c","node_id":"C_kwDOSxKwgtoAKGI4ZGM0MTIxZGExMGI2MTZkNDMxYmYxMTNmMzdkODY3NjlmMDQ5NWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commit/faef62db2a789b9d473aa7397e92b297d16f99c0","sha":"faef62db2a789b9d473aa7397e92b297d16f99c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/faef62db2a789b9d473aa7397e92b297d16f99c0"}],"sha":"b8dc4121da10b616d431bf113f37d86769f0495c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/b8dc4121da10b616d431bf113f37d86769f0495c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/faef62db2a789b9d473aa7397e92b297d16f99c0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-06T22:19:33Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-06T22:19:33Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"message":"docs(wc-host): correct shared-scope contract — redux IS shared (singleton React) + store self-provided\n\nFollow-up to 2f817b8: the READMEs (from the prior fix-a state) wrongly said\n@reduxjs/toolkit + react-redux are NOT shared. They ARE shared (all 5 React-coupled\nsingletons) so the remote uses the host''s single React — a bundled react-redux runs\nuseSyncExternalStore→React.useRef against a 2nd React → dual-React \"useRef of null\"\nblank page. The store remains self-provided (no ./store expose); the two are\nindependent. Docs only; host-integration anti-drift test green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3f62d4126233caf154e4e2cdbff85f947c146591","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/trees/3f62d4126233caf154e4e2cdbff85f947c146591"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/commits/faef62db2a789b9d473aa7397e92b297d16f99c0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commit/faef62db2a789b9d473aa7397e92b297d16f99c0","node_id":"C_kwDOSxKwgtoAKGZhZWY2MmRiMmE3ODliOWQ0NzNhYTczOTdlOTJiMjk3ZDE2Zjk5YzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commit/2f817b86c5e9edf6fe7655b841669dad64b3dc39","sha":"2f817b86c5e9edf6fe7655b841669dad64b3dc39","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/2f817b86c5e9edf6fe7655b841669dad64b3dc39"}],"sha":"faef62db2a789b9d473aa7397e92b297d16f99c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/faef62db2a789b9d473aa7397e92b297d16f99c0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/2f817b86c5e9edf6fe7655b841669dad64b3dc39/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-06T22:17:10Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-06T22:17:10Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"message":"fix(wc-web): re-share react-redux + @reduxjs/toolkit (dual-React regression from 2c89708)\n\nAfter 2c89708 the portal mounted past \"Connecting…\" (deadlock gone) but went blank\nwith `TypeError: Cannot read properties of null (reading ''useRef'')` in react-redux''s\nuseSyncExternalStoreWithSelector ← useQuery = DUAL-REACT: unsharing react-redux +\n@reduxjs/toolkit made the remote bundle them, and their hooks ran against a second\nReact instead of the shared renderer.\n\nPut @reduxjs/toolkit + react-redux BACK in the federation `shared` scope (wc-web +\nwc-host) so the remote uses the host''s single React instance. KEEP the deadlock fix:\nthe store is still self-provided inside WeeklyCommitApp (no `./store` expose, single\nWeeklyCommitApp ensure) — that single-entry change is what actually killed the\ndeadlock, NOT the unsharing. So redux is shared AND the store is self-contained;\nthe redux importShared now resolves inside the WeeklyCommitApp ensure (canonical,\nlike react), so sharing doesn''t reintroduce the deadlock.\n\nhost-integration.test SHARED_SINGLETONS back to all 5.\nVerified: wc-web 310/310; remote+host build emit __federation_shared_{react,react-dom,\n@reduxjs/toolkit,react-redux,react-router-dom}; only the WeeklyCommitApp expose (no\n_Store); host base /portal/ + remote URL baked; host tsc clean.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9bff8cd736eb8942a3afdefc3f334b407a4c35bc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/trees/9bff8cd736eb8942a3afdefc3f334b407a4c35bc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/commits/2f817b86c5e9edf6fe7655b841669dad64b3dc39","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commit/2f817b86c5e9edf6fe7655b841669dad64b3dc39","node_id":"C_kwDOSxKwgtoAKDJmODE3Yjg2YzVlOWVkZjZmZTc2NTViODQxNjY5ZGFkNjRiM2RjMzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commit/58a56f9776691f5f6202b6c019cce274c3618da0","sha":"58a56f9776691f5f6202b6c019cce274c3618da0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/58a56f9776691f5f6202b6c019cce274c3618da0"}],"sha":"2f817b86c5e9edf6fe7655b841669dad64b3dc39","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/2f817b86c5e9edf6fe7655b841669dad64b3dc39"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/58a56f9776691f5f6202b6c019cce274c3618da0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-06T21:46:29Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-06T21:46:29Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"message":"docs(wc-host): align host-integration contract with the self-provided-store fix + Option-B\n\nUpdate both READMEs to the realized contract after 2c89708 + the Option-B (same-origin\n/portal/) topology:\n- Remote SELF-PROVIDES its store; host provides only router + getAccessToken (no\n  ./store expose, no host store import).\n- Shared scope is react/react-dom/react-router-dom only (@reduxjs/toolkit + react-redux\n  are remote-internal, not shared — they caused the importShared deadlock).\n- wc-host README: Option-B same-origin topology (portal at wc./portal/, remote at\n  wc./remote/), no CORS needed, --base=/portal/ host build, the /portal/ CloudFront\n  rewrite + --delete-exclude infra notes, Auth0 callback wc./portal/callback.\n\nDocs only; host-integration.test.ts (README ↔ vite.config anti-drift) stays green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fdd41066a11c4b3e5650fd499522371f74f2f3fe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/trees/fdd41066a11c4b3e5650fd499522371f74f2f3fe"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/commits/58a56f9776691f5f6202b6c019cce274c3618da0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commit/58a56f9776691f5f6202b6c019cce274c3618da0","node_id":"C_kwDOSxKwgtoAKDU4YTU2Zjk3NzY2OTFmNWY2MjAyYjZjMDE5Y2NlMjc0YzM2MThkYTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commit/2c89708de7d214e563ca87f70e0958409fa0cf48","sha":"2c89708de7d214e563ca87f70e0958409fa0cf48","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/2c89708de7d214e563ca87f70e0958409fa0cf48"}],"sha":"58a56f9776691f5f6202b6c019cce274c3618da0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/58a56f9776691f5f6202b6c019cce274c3618da0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/2c89708de7d214e563ca87f70e0958409fa0cf48/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-06T21:42:04Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-06T21:42:04Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"message":"fix(wc-web): remote self-provides its store; drop shared-redux federation deadlock\n\nLive portal hung forever on \"Connecting to Weekly Commit\" after login. Root cause:\nthe host did a separate `import(''wc_web/store'')` whose exposed chunk ran a\ntop-level `await importShared(\"@reduxjs/toolkit\")`; that cross-build shared-scope\nresolution never settled (silent deadlock — every chunk loaded 200/304, no error,\nno /api/me ever fired). Diagnosed against the live site: API URL was baked, all\nchunks served, host loaded — so it was runtime shared-scope, not loading.\n\nFix — make the remote self-contained for state so nothing does `await\nimportShared(...)` for redux at module eval:\n- WeeklyCommitApp now wraps `<Provider store={store}>` itself (store + baseApi are\n  remote-internal); the host no longer imports a store across the boundary.\n- Drop the `./store` federation expose.\n- Remove @reduxjs/toolkit + react-redux from the federation `shared` scope (both\n  wc-web + wc-host) — they no longer cross the boundary, so the remote bundles\n  them (no importShared, no top-level-await). Only react/react-dom (single React)\n  + react-router-dom (shared <BrowserRouter> context) stay shared.\n- Host WeeklyCommitMount: just <Suspense><WeeklyCommitApp getAccessToken/></Suspense>\n  (no store import/Provider); drop the wc_web/store type decl.\n- host-integration.test: SHARED_SINGLETONS → [react, react-dom, react-router-dom].\n\nVerified: wc-web 310/310; remote build emits only the WeeklyCommitApp expose +\nreact/react-dom/react-router-dom shared chunks (no expose_Store, no shared redux,\nno importShared(@reduxjs/toolkit) in the exposed chunk); host builds with base\n/portal/, no wc_web/store import. Runtime mount re-tested live (browser harness\nunavailable locally).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"59da9d31179020ef0671d16725c52156f40a102e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/trees/59da9d31179020ef0671d16725c52156f40a102e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/commits/2c89708de7d214e563ca87f70e0958409fa0cf48","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commit/2c89708de7d214e563ca87f70e0958409fa0cf48","node_id":"C_kwDOSxKwgtoAKDJjODk3MDhkZTdkMjE0ZTU2M2NhODdmNzBlMDk1ODQwOWZhMGNmNDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commit/da6f29c5953d6550d09d4543257a008c9be0cde7","sha":"da6f29c5953d6550d09d4543257a008c9be0cde7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/da6f29c5953d6550d09d4543257a008c9be0cde7"}],"sha":"2c89708de7d214e563ca87f70e0958409fa0cf48","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/2c89708de7d214e563ca87f70e0958409fa0cf48"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/da6f29c5953d6550d09d4543257a008c9be0cde7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-06T20:56:48Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-06T20:59:33Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"message":"fix(infra): Deploy-2 Option B — federation portal on wc./portal/ (same-origin), drop portal distribution\n\nThe AWS account CloudFront-creation gate blocks a new portal.* distribution, so serve\nthe federation host same-origin from a /portal/ path on the EXISTING wc. distribution.\n\nterraform (s3_cloudfront.tf):\n- additive /portal/* ordered cache behavior → the existing s3-assets origin (host\n  published to the wc. bucket /portal/); default + /remote/* behaviors byte-identical.\n- a portal-spa-rewrite CloudFront Function (viewer-request) rewriting extension-less\n  /portal/* → /portal/index.html — REQUIRED: the distribution-wide custom-error maps to\n  the MAIN /index.html, so without it /portal/callback would load the wrong app and break\n  the Auth0 exchange.\n- drop portal.tf (separate dist/cert/bucket/route53) + its outputs → next apply destroys\n  the orphaned partials (empty portal bucket + ISSUED cert) from the failed Deploy-2 apply.\n\ndeploy.yml:\n- f1 main site: SKIPPED entirely — the live main-site S3 content stays byte-identical\n  (truly untouched) during the review window; only the remote + host are published.\n- f2 remote: yarn vite build --base=https://wc.<root>/remote/ -> wc. bucket /remote/\n  (yarn install moved here).\n- f3 host: build apps/wc-host --base=/portal/ -> wc. bucket /portal/ -> invalidate /portal/*.\n- Same-origin => the /remote/* CORS policy + portal-origin api CORS are moot but harmless (left).\n\nterraform fmt/validate/tflint + actionlint clean.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"913638d822969f28832c2b3f71e864ed810951c2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/trees/913638d822969f28832c2b3f71e864ed810951c2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/commits/da6f29c5953d6550d09d4543257a008c9be0cde7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commit/da6f29c5953d6550d09d4543257a008c9be0cde7","node_id":"C_kwDOSxKwgtoAKGRhNmYyOWM1OTUzZDY1NTBkMDlkNDU0MzI1N2EwMDhjOWJlMGNkZTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commit/5da4d6b02724da20fe6bc3db2ef15b62d86ac379","sha":"5da4d6b02724da20fe6bc3db2ef15b62d86ac379","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/5da4d6b02724da20fe6bc3db2ef15b62d86ac379"}],"sha":"da6f29c5953d6550d09d4543257a008c9be0cde7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/da6f29c5953d6550d09d4543257a008c9be0cde7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/5da4d6b02724da20fe6bc3db2ef15b62d86ac379/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-06T20:41:54Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-06T20:41:54Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"message":"feat(wc-host): serve the portal under a base path (Option B, same-origin /portal/)\n\nDeploy-2 pivoted to same-origin federation — the portal is served from a PATH\non the existing wc. CloudFront (wc.st6weeklycommit.com/portal/) instead of a new\nportal.* distribution (AWS account-verification gate blocked new distributions).\nAdapt the host to run under a base path, driven by import.meta.env.BASE_URL so\nit auto-adapts (dev base=/ → /callback; prod --base=/portal/ → /portal/callback):\n\n- App.tsx: <BrowserRouter basename> derived from BASE_URL (''/portal'' under\n  /portal/, ''/'' in dev) so routes, deep links, and the callback resolve correctly.\n- authConfig.ts: redirectUri = <origin><BASE_URL>callback → <origin>/portal/callback.\n- Portal.tsx: post-logout returnTo = <origin><BASE_URL> → <origin>/portal/.\n\nBuild with `vite build --base=/portal/`. Same-origin means NO CORS needed (remote\nchunks load from the same wc. origin; the wc. origin is already in Auth0 + wc-api\nCORS from Deploy 1). The remote is unchanged (its absolute /remote/assets/ chunk\nURLs resolve same-origin). Verified: tsc clean, base=/portal/ baked (assets +\nBASE_URL injection), remote URL baked, prettier clean.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0a5ed4e10a698367d764b368a3a7c9e16e870e8a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/trees/0a5ed4e10a698367d764b368a3a7c9e16e870e8a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/commits/5da4d6b02724da20fe6bc3db2ef15b62d86ac379","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commit/5da4d6b02724da20fe6bc3db2ef15b62d86ac379","node_id":"C_kwDOSxKwgtoAKDVkYTRkNmIwMjcyNGRhMjBmZTZiYzNkYjJlZjE1YjYyZDg2YWMzNzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commit/5bee05ebac1e9eb1777e2338b5834aa71373bea9","sha":"5bee05ebac1e9eb1777e2338b5834aa71373bea9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/5bee05ebac1e9eb1777e2338b5834aa71373bea9"}],"sha":"5da4d6b02724da20fe6bc3db2ef15b62d86ac379","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/5da4d6b02724da20fe6bc3db2ef15b62d86ac379"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/5bee05ebac1e9eb1777e2338b5834aa71373bea9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-06T20:12:12Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-06T20:12:12Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"message":"ci(infra): deploy.yml Deploy-2 federation steps — standalone main site + MF remote + portal host\n\nWires the cross-origin federation publish into the deploy job (Deploy 2):\n- (f) wc-web standalone main site: VITE_BUILD_TARGET=standalone (the vite.config\n  default build emits the MF remote) + sync --exclude \"remote/*\" so --delete never\n  wipes the federation remote published in (f2).\n- (f2) MF remote: yarn vite build --base=https://wc.${ROOT_DOMAIN}/remote/ (bakes\n  absolute cross-origin chunk URLs into remoteEntry.js) -> s3://<wc-bucket>/remote/\n  -> invalidate /remote/*.\n- (f3) federation host (apps/wc-host) -> portal bucket via the s3_portal_bucket_name\n  + portal_cloudfront_distribution_id outputs -> invalidate /*.\n\nAdditive; only the Deploy-2 ref (main) carries portal.tf to back the portal outputs.\nactionlint clean.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2f4af8d8578b33d89ce294cd15f2504c3e26f318","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/trees/2f4af8d8578b33d89ce294cd15f2504c3e26f318"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/commits/5bee05ebac1e9eb1777e2338b5834aa71373bea9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{