n"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-06T08:47:03Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"message":"fix(wc-web): week indicator reads as static, not a live dropdown\n\nThe standalone-shell week affordance was a disabled <button> with a chevron,\nwhich reads as an interactive dropdown even though this is a single-week demo\nwith no week navigation. Convert it to a non-interactive labeled <span> chip:\ndrop the chevron + button semantics, add a \"Single demo week\" tooltip +\naria-label. Behavior is unchanged (it was already disabled) — this purely\nremoves the misleading interactive cue for the recorded demo.\n\nStandalone-shell-only (PrimaryNav.tsx); tree-shaken from the MF remote\n(REQ-I-008). Full wc-web suite 310/310 green; standalone build clean.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"42086986d1302f6f1c96c550ca03c6b04a7be9af","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/trees/42086986d1302f6f1c96c550ca03c6b04a7be9af"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/commits/f9157b05c0c4cafcedc86a836e3106bfbc9fc8d8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commit/f9157b05c0c4cafcedc86a836e3106bfbc9fc8d8","node_id":"C_kwDOSxKwgtoAKGY5MTU3YjA1YzBjNGNhZmNlZGM4NmE4MzZlMzEwNmJmYmM5ZmM4ZDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commit/4af6ea4e998f65589cda96b384061bf99e65b8b5","sha":"4af6ea4e998f65589cda96b384061bf99e65b8b5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/4af6ea4e998f65589cda96b384061bf99e65b8b5"}],"sha":"f9157b05c0c4cafcedc86a836e3106bfbc9fc8d8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/f9157b05c0c4cafcedc86a836e3106bfbc9fc8d8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/4af6ea4e998f65589cda96b384061bf99e65b8b5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-06T08:44:52Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-06T08:44:52Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"message":"feat(wc-api): demo-seed 7-persona matrix + temporal + projections + idempotency (107b)\n\nExtends DemoSeeder.run into the full reset-then-seed: ensures the 7 demo\npersonas + 6 relationships (idempotent), then direct-inserts the V6-parameterized\nlifecycle matrix for the target week (+ Grace/Dana at W-7) -- Priya LOCKED-SYNCED,\nMarco LOCKED-FAILED-overdue, Aisha LOCKED-OPEN-dispute, Tomas LOCKED-RESOLVED,\nGrace RECONCILING(+carry-forward), Sam DRAFT(unlinked), Dana RECONCILED + manager\nroll-up -- recomputes projections per plan via ProjectionRefresher.recomputeForPlan,\nand writes one SYSTEM (null-actor) DEMO_SEEDED audit row. The two NOT_REVIEWED\nreview due-dates anchor to the injected Clock (Marco prev-business-day-before-now\n-> OVERDUE, Priya next-business-day-after-now -> not), so the OVERDUE split derives\nat any view time within the week; all other timestamps sit on the week grid.\nOVERDUE is derived, never stored.\n\nBuilt by direct row insertion, never the lifecycle services, so no real Outlook\nsyncs fire for the seeded personas (rule #4). Idempotent (reset-then-seed) and\nportable across weeks (proven for the Jun 8-14 review week). The runner depends on\na new DemoSeeding interface (EI2 convention); the reset is a package-private seam\nproven in isolation.\n\nUnblocks: the per-week demo seed is now runnable end-to-end (Jun 1-7 recording +\nJun 8-14 review) once the job-seed-demo.yaml infra companion lands.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"29469237d56a4b94b2e3f204adc7caf23be90607","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/trees/29469237d56a4b94b2e3f204adc7caf23be90607"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/commits/4af6ea4e998f65589cda96b384061bf99e65b8b5","verifi