url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/dd51072e2dc797bec7c3b132d777e86dd52760e1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-06T08:05:49Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-06T08:05:49Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"message":"feat(wc-api): week-parameterized demo-seed Job — runner + FK-safe reset (107a)\n\nAdds the one-shot DemoSeedRunner (gated on --app.job=seed-demo) + the\nDemoSeeder reset half: parses/normalizes --week to its Monday (current week\nfrom the injected Clock when absent) and FK-safe-clears the 7 demo personas''\nderived rows across the two-week footprint {W, W-7}\n(disputes->reviews->projections->sync->commitments->plans), leaving identity\n+ RCDO reference data untouched. Reset-then-seed''s first half; the 7-persona\nmatrix re-insert + temporal correctness + projection recompute + idempotency\nlands in 107b. The seeder drives no lifecycle services (avoids real Outlook\nsyncs); reset via scoped SQL through NamedParameterJdbcOperations (interface,\nEI2 convention).\n\nUnblocks: the per-week demo seed (run for Jun 1-7 recording + Jun 8-14\nreview) once 107b + the job-seed-demo.yaml infra companion land.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>"