b.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/62a062de797ffc712251ff67e94a6272223e1463/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-06T07:32:00Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-06T07:32:00Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"message":"feat(infra): wc-api CORS allow-list + portal origin for the Deploy-2 embedded WC (manifest)\n\nThe WC embedded AT the portal host (portal.st6weeklycommit.com) makes API calls to\napi.wc.<ROOT_DOMAIN>, so the api CORS allow-list must accept the portal origin.\nThis is the wc-api `CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS` env in deployment-api.yaml (a k8s manifest,\ninfra-owned — NOT a backend code change): comma-separated, the app binds it as\nString[] (application.yml `app.cors.allowed-origins`).\n\n  value: \"https://wc.${ROOT_DOMAIN}\" -> \"https://wc.${ROOT_DOMAIN},https://portal.${ROOT_DOMAIN}\"\n\nDISTINCT from the federation-remote CORS (the CloudFront ACAO on wc./remote/ in\n795ffdc) — that lets the host LOAD the remote; this lets the embedded app CALL the\nAPI. Harmless if applied before Deploy 2 (just pre-allows an unused origin). NOT\npushed — Deploy 2 (lead-assembled); applies wait for the user''s return.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a70d0187052004888aec42a5c9d27e3a95e61384","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/trees/a70d0187052004888aec42a5c9d27e3a95e61384"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/commits/62a062de797ffc712251ff67e94a6272223e1463","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commit/62a062de797ffc712251ff67e94a6272223e1463","node_id":"C_kwDOSxKwgtoAKDYyYTA2MmRlNzk3ZmZjNzEyMjUxZmY2N2U5NGE2MjcyMjIzZTE0NjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commit/795ffdcaae5975131cfe506b2ebf77c1cf0805bc","sha":"795ffdcaae5975131cfe506b2ebf77c1cf0805bc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/795ffdcaae5975131c