IN>,\n  GET/HEAD/OPTIONS, origin_override).\n- an ordered_cache_behavior for /remote/* on the wc. distribution attaching that\n  policy (+ OPTIONS preflight).\n\nPURELY ADDITIVE + reversible (the lead''s load-bearing safety requirement, the wc.\nsite being the live demo + next-week review target): `git diff` = 41 insertions,\nZERO deletions — the default_cache_behavior, SPA fallback (403/404->index.html),\naliases, and viewer_certificate are byte-identical. /remote/* is a more-specific\npath so it can''t shadow the default/SPA routes; revert = drop the block + policy.\nSame-origin fallback documented inline (publish remote into the portal bucket\ninstead). Agent-gate green (fmt/validate/tflint rc=0).\n\nDEPLOY 2 ONLY — keep OUT of the polish deploy / the core wc. recording window\n(applied at Deploy 2''s terraform apply, after the recording). NOT pushed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f9802dfbfd758e878ba666432403401d1c6ed1ea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/trees/f9802dfbfd758e878ba666432403401d1c6ed1ea"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/commits/795ffdcaae5975131cfe506b2ebf77c1cf0805bc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://ap