l":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/672e09dbb7cb9d51fade25826cc26eaf89e2ad49/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-06T06:55:55Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-06T06:58:01Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"message":"docs(wc-api): 106 round seal — human Graph subject + §10 deep-link body (§45-addendum)\n\nRound-seal the hot-routing for 106 (the impl''s event-content polish landed as\n0451d9f). The live sync is PROVEN — the 340d7e3b re-drive through the deployed\n104 worker created the first real Graph event on sam.carter''s Outlook; the user\nthen flagged the event content as bare, which 106 fixes. Captures:\n- LESSONS §45-addendum: the §10 deep-link body realized (ARCH:1012\n  WC_FRONTEND_BASE_URL was spec''d-but-unimplemented + net-new) + the human\n  subject; rule-#7 boundary preserved/re-pinned (generic + URL + planId UUID,\n  no owner/commitment/OKR text; owner email is the call ADDRESS not content;\n  worker stays thin); the rejected commitment-listing tier; the sentinel leak\n  test; the §48 nested default; spec-gap-fix-not-gold-plating.\n- MVP_TASKS: the 106 Log entry (incl. the proven-live-sync milestone) +\n  brief-lane next-free = 107.\n- docs/briefs/106.\n\nCompanion infra (WC_FRONTEND_BASE_URL on the worker Deployment) pending — routes\nat polish-deploy assembly. Local commit only (lead pushes).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","