or":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/0451d9f8b8751fdf4845544a4d1453ea6bb28dba/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-06T06:51:34Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-06T06:51:34Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"message":"feat(wc-api): human Graph event subject + §10 deep-link body (ARCH:1012, brief 106)\n\nThe proven live sync produced a bare event — a technical subject (IC_PLANNING — week of\n2026-06-01) and an EMPTY body. The empty body was a spec gap: ARCHITECTURE.md:1012 specs a\ndeep-link in the Graph event body (app.outlook.frontend-base-url / WC_FRONTEND_BASE_URL) that the\nevent-builder never wrote. This closes it.\n\n- Human subject per eventKind: \"Weekly Commit — Week of Jun 1–7\" (IC_PLANNING), \"Weekly Commit —\n  Reconciliation — Week of …\" (IC_RECONCILIATION), \"Manager Review — Week of …\"\n  (MANAGER_REVIEW_BLOCK); the week range is a compact human format (same-month \"Jun 1–7\",\n  cross-month \"Jun 29 – Jul 5\").\n- HTML deep-link body (CalendarEventSpec gains a body field; MsGraphEventGateway sets an HTML\n  ItemBody): IC → {base}/weekly-commit/history/{planId}, review-block →\n  {base}/manager/command-center (frontend routes verified to exist; planId = the record''s\n  relatedId).\n- Net-new config app.outlook.frontend-base-url with a §48-resolvable nested default\n  ${WC_FRONTEND_BASE_URL:https://wc.${ROOT_DOMAIN:localhost}} (the worker has no ROOT_DOMAIN; the\n  nested :localhost keeps it boot-safe for the non-serving Jobs); consumed only by the real-mode\n  adapter.\n\nrule #7 holds — the subject + body carry ONLY a generic label + week + the {base} config URL + the\nplanId UUID; the owner email is the call ADDRESS (gateway userEmail), never event content; no\nplan/commitment/SO data loaded (the worker stays thin). Pinned by a leak test\n(subjectAndBody_neverCarryOwnerPii — sentinel name+email → doesNotContain). ./gradlew check green;\nadapter 5/5 + gateway 1/1, deterministic.\n\nInfra companion: WC_FRONTEND_BASE_URL on the worker Deployment env (rides the polish deploy; the\nyaml default boots local/CI until then). New worker DTO field; no Appendix-B contract change.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e827200a92cc7cb6b1afd484e856a50c13d7bc4b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/trees/e827200a92cc7cb6b1afd484e856a50c13d7bc4b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/commits/0451d9f8b8751fdf4845544a4d1453ea6bb28dba","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gist