":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/8648a6ae809b4b990fed5c21d517609a63f574ac/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-06T05:30:40Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-06T05:30:40Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"message":"docs(wc-api): 104b round seal — stale-SYNCING reaper + Graph idempotency (§49-addendum) + infra brief 105\n\nRound-seal the hot-routing for 104b (the impl''s folded reaper+idempotency\nlanded as 1952762). Captures:\n- LESSONS §49-addendum: the reaper realized — re-enqueues via SqsTemplate (NOT\n  the api-only SnsLifecyclePublisher — REQ-O-016; adds the worker sqs:SendMessage\n  infra dep); the Graph idempotency it forces (transactionId=syncRecordId +\n  early-persist graphEventId) or re-processing duplicates; the saveAndFlush-\n  reassign trap (a naive save()+save() re-stales — caught by the real-PG tests,\n  not the mock); the whole-tick-swallow trap (a @Scheduled poller must swallow\n  the finder read too — security-reviewer medium, fixed).\n- MVP_TASKS: the 104b Log entry + the 104b/104c Carry-forward resolved.\n- docs/briefs/104b + 105 (the infra companion — ea04616, wc-sync-only\n  sqs:SendMessage + 90s visibility-timeout; brief reflects the as-implemented\n  least-privilege scope).\n\n104b is off the critical path — inert until infra grants sqs:SendMessage AND it\ndeploys; rides a LATER deploy, NOT Deploy 1. Brief-lane next-free = 106. Local\ncommit only (lead pushes).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3db4aaf640de8e279ebcf8e1b7cd166b8b4e1235","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/trees/3db4aaf640de8e279ebcf8e1b7cd166b8b4e1235"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/commits/8648a6ae809b4b990fed5c21d517609a63f574ac","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commit/8648a6ae809b4b990fed5c21d517609a63f574ac","node_id":"C_kwDOSxKwgtoAKDg2NDhhNmFlODA5YjRiOTkwZmVkNWMyMWQ1MTc2MDlhNjNmNTc0YWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commit/1952762b465f61a47c8f0e88dabec932685a8371","sha":"1952762b465f61a47c8f0e88dabec932685a8371","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/1952762b465f61a47c8f0e88dabec932685a8371"}],"sha":"8648a6ae809b4b990fed5c21d517609a63f574ac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/8648a6ae809b4b990fed5c21d517609a63f574ac"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/1952762b465f61a47c8f0e88dabec932685a8371/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-06T05:27:29Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-06T05:27:29Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"message":"fix(wc-api): @Scheduled reaper + transactionId idempotency for safe stuck-SYNCING recovery (104b)\n\n104''s lease clause makes a stranded in-flight SYNCING row reclaimable by a redelivery, but the\nlistener''s no-op path ACK-deletes the SQS message — so a claimer that crashes mid-Graph (its sole\nmessage already deleted) has nothing left to re-fire the reclaim. This adds the re-trigger + the\nidempotency that makes re-processing safe.\n\nReaper: a worker @Scheduled StaleSyncReaper (aws-gated via app.sqs.queue-url; @EnableScheduling on\nWorkerSharedConfig) finds stale-SYNCING rows (lastAttemptAt < now − lease) via a bounded finder\n(findByStatusAndLastAttemptAtBefore + Pageable, batch 100) and re-enqueues the bare SyncJobPointer\nonto the wc-sync queue via SqsTemplate → the listener''s lease clause reclaims the row → reprocesses.\nNOT the §28 SnsLifecyclePublisher — that''s an api-module bean the :shared-only worker can''t reach\n(REQ-O-016) and it flips PENDING_PUBLISH→QUEUED (wrong for a SYNCING reclaim); the worker re-enqueues\nonto its own queue (raw SNS→SQS delivery makes the bare pointer wire-compatible). The whole reap() is\nswallow-guarded (a finder OR send RuntimeException logs ids-only + the next tick still fires) so the\npoller never blocks (rule #4). Reuses the listener''s app.sqs.sync-claim-lease (single source);\ninterval app.sqs.reaper-interval (default PT1M). Inert benign no-op until infra grants the worker\nsqs:SendMessage on wc-sync.\n\nIdempotency (makes re-processing crash-safe — required before the reaper can re-process):\n- MsGraphEventGateway sets event.transactionId = syncRecordId (a UUID, rule #7 clean) — MS Graph''s\n  server-side dedup key, so a redundant create returns the existing event instead of duplicating\n  (Context7-verified; bounded retention).\n- SyncMessageListener early-persists graphEventId in its OWN saveAndFlush right after createEvent,\n  reassigning to the flushed (version-bumped) instance, BEFORE the SYNCED flip — so a crash after the\n  create leaves graphEventId durable → reprocess reconciles to SYNCED, no re-create. The reassign is\n  load-bearing: a naive save()+save() re-introduces the brief-104 two-save stale-@Version bug — caught\n  here by the Testcontainers tests, not the mock.\n\nrule #7 (bare pointer, ids-only logs, UUID transactionId, graphEventId not PII) + rule #4\n(non-blocking swallow-guarded poller) preserved. Ad-hoc security-reviewer CLEAN (0 critical / 0 high;\n1 medium — finder-outside-swallow — fixed in this slice). Deterministic + real-PG tests: reaper unit\n+ integration (bounded finder, crashed-claimer→reclaim→SYNCED e2e, finder-throws swallow), gateway\ntransactionId deep-stub capture (§45 live-only deviation, noted), listener early-persist order. New\nrepo finder + reaper + gateway transactionId; no model field change.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7d2bf6083ef78cbec6d0b6b8464e30696d33ffcd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/trees/7d2bf6083ef78cbec6d0b6b8464e30696d33ffcd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/commits/1952762b465f61a47c8f0e88dabec932685a8371","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commit/1952762b465f61a47c8f0e88dabec932685a8371","node_id":"C_kwDOSxKwgtoAKDE5NTI3NjJiNDY1ZjYxYTQ3YzhmMGU4OGRhYmVjOTMyNjg1YTgzNzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commit/5822dea7af097f11e1d912f891e117b1b734f102","sha":"5822dea7af097f11e1d912f891e117b1b734f102","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/5822dea7af097f11e1d912f891e117b1b734f102"}],"sha":"1952762b465f61a47c8f0e88dabec932685a8371","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/1952762b465f61a47c8f0e88dabec932685a8371"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/5822dea7af097f11e1d912f891e117b1b734f102/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-06T05:04:49Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-06T05:04:49Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"message":"test(wc-api): single-thread stale-entity regression proving brief-104 fixes the line-98 two-save bug\n\nThe live 340d7e3b StaleObjectStateException was single-thread stale-entity-reuse, not the\nconcurrency race: the old flow loaded a record once, save()d it SYNCING (a merge → the DB version\ngoes 0→1 but the detached reference stays version 0), then mutated + save()d the SAME stale\nreference again on the terminal transition (the old line-98 FAILED save) → optimistic-lock conflict.\n\nBrief 104 (c45a7a6) already fixes this structurally — the SYNCING transition is now a @Modifying\nbulk UPDATE (claimForSync, not an entity save), then findById reloads a fresh entity at the\npost-claim version, so the single terminal save matches the DB version and never throws stale. But\nthe mocked SyncMessageListenerTest can''t exercise real Hibernate @Version semantics, so add a\nsingle-thread Testcontainers regression over real PG16:\n\n  (a) reproduce the OLD bug — two saves on one reused detached reference → assert\n      ObjectOptimisticLockingFailureException (pins why the reload matters);\n  (b) prove 104 — drive the REAL onMessage once (single delivery): a throwing GraphPort lands the\n      record FAILED with a sanitized SyncProcessingException rethrow (NOT a stale exception), and a\n      succeeding GraphPort lands SYNCED — both over the claim→reload→single-save path.\n\nTest-only; no production change.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"84cd7b99a4567814bbdd4eeec824f279c8de2da1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/trees/84cd7b99a4567814bbdd4eeec824f279c8de2da1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/commits/5822dea7af097f11e1d912f891e117b1b734f102","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commit/5822dea7af097f11e1d912f891e117b1b734f102","node_id":"C_kwDOSxKwgtoAKDU4MjJkZWE3YWYwOTdmMTFlMWQ5MTJmODkxZTExN2IxYjczNGYxMDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commit/ea046164e046db7661a86b238c01682aee4437c6","sha":"ea046164e046db7661a86b238c01682aee4437c6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/ea046164e046db7661a86b238c01682aee4437c6"}],"sha":"5822dea7af097f11e1d912f891e117b1b734f102","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/5822dea7af097f11e1d912f891e117b1b734f102"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/ea046164e046db7661a86b238c01682aee4437c6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-06T04:56:45Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-06T04:59:56Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"message":"fix(infra): explicit wc-sync SQS visibility timeout (90s) + worker IRSA sqs:SendMessage (wc-sync only) for the 104b reaper (brief 105)\n\nCompanion to the backend worker-concurrency fix (104 c45a7a6 atomic-claim / 104b\nreaper), part of the demo-critical Deploy 1.\n\n1. wc-sync visibility_timeout_seconds = 90 (was the implicit AWS 30s default).\n   The live Sam re-test (syncRecord 340d7e3b) redelivered the message ~28s into a\n   slow Graph createEvent — right at the 30s default — driving the concurrent-\n   delivery race. 90s holds the load-bearing invariant\n   30s_default < graph_time < 90s < 300s (app.sqs.sync-claim-lease=PT5M): above the\n   max createEvent round-trip, well under the backend claim lease so a slow-but-\n   active claimer is never lease-reclaimed mid-flight (wc-api LESSONS §49). In-place\n   attribute update (SetQueueAttributes) — NOT a queue replacement.\n\n2. worker IRSA +sqs:SendMessage as a DEDICATED statement scoped to wc-sync ONLY\n   (NOT the DLQ — tighter least-privilege; the reaper never produces to the DLQ).\n   The 104b reaper re-enqueues stale-SYNCING pointers to wc-sync via SqsTemplate;\n   the worker can''t reach the api-side SNS publisher (no api<->worker edge,\n   REQ-O-016). The existing ConsumeSync statement (Receive/Delete/GetQueueAttributes\n   on [wc-sync, wc-sync-dlq]) is untouched. Inert until 104b ships (no producer yet).\n\nVerify: terraform fmt -check + init -backend=false + validate + tflint all rc=0.\nReal plan/apply (the EXACTLY-2-diffs / no-replacement confirmation) runs HITL in\nDeploy 1 (LESSONS §2). raw_message_delivery=true untouched. NOT pushed — lead bundles.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a0c606b3e757c77874f7fba09214c43f95c871ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/trees/a0c606b3e757c77874f7fba09214c43f95c871ab"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/commits/ea046164e046db7661a86b238c01682aee4437c6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commit/ea046164e046db7661a86b238c01682aee4437c6","node_id":"C_kwDOSxKwgtoAKGVhMDQ2MTY0ZTA0NmRiNzY2MWE4NmIyMzhjMDE2ODJhZWU0NDM3YzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commit/cae9ea1e2e494a182bd33b39bbb91e43554089d2","sha":"cae9ea1e2e494a182bd33b39bbb91e43554089d2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/cae9ea1e2e494a182bd33b39bbb91e43554089d2"}],"sha":"ea046164e046db7661a86b238c01682aee4437c6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/ea046164e046db7661a86b238c01682aee4437c6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/cae9ea1e2e494a182bd33b39bbb91e43554089d2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-06T04:38:31Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-06T04:38:31Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"message":"docs(wc-api): brief 104 round seal — worker atomic-claim concurrency fix (§49) + 104b reaper carry-forward\n\nRound-seal the hot-routing for brief 104 (the impl''s atomic-claim fix landed\nas c45a7a6). Captures:\n- LESSONS §49 (new lesson): at-least-once SQS consumer concurrency — CLAIM the\n  row atomically (a @Modifying conditional UPDATE CAS), don''t read-then-write\n  status (a TOCTOU that collides on @Version under concurrent redelivery +\n  risks duplicate side-effects); reconcile already-done rows to terminal (don''t\n  skip-and-loop); lease-reclaim stale in-flight rows (lease > the SQS visibility\n  timeout) AND pair it with a re-trigger (a @Scheduled reaper) since a no-op ACK\n  deletes the message; prove with a deterministic DB-CAS state-matrix test, not\n  a thread race. Composes §44 + §098-addendum.\n- CLAUDE.md §49 lessons-index row.\n- MVP_TASKS: the brief-104 Log entry + the 104b reaper Carry-forward (the\n  crashed-claimer re-trigger recovery, lead-approved as its own slice) + the\n  held SQS visibility-timeout infra companion.\n- docs/briefs/104.\n\nBrief-lane next-free = 105 (104b = the reaper). Local commit only (lead pushes).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a4d3ea5443986262924138010085c841c6d1a02d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/trees/a4d3ea5443986262924138010085c841c6d1a02d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/commits/cae9ea1e2e494a182bd33b39bbb91e43554089d2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commit/cae9ea1e2e494a182bd33b39bbb91e43554089d2","node_id":"C_kwDOSxKwgtoAKGNhZTllYTFlMmU0OTRhMTgyYmQzM2IzOWJiYjkxZTQzNTU0MDg5ZDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commit/c45a7a604d4735061bb662dbeb41fbdc2559c1f5","sha":"c45a7a604d4735061bb662dbeb41fbdc2559c1f5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/c45a7a604d4735061bb662dbeb41fbdc2559c1f5"}],"sha":"cae9ea1e2e494a182bd33b39bbb91e43554089d2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/cae9ea1e2e494a182bd33b39bbb91e43554089d2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/c45a7a604d4735061bb662dbeb41fbdc2559c1f5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-06T04:36:28Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-06T04:36:28Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"message":"fix(wc-api): atomic claim for the worker SQS consumer — concurrent-delivery race + lease-reclaim clause\n\nThe worker''s onMessage read status (the §098 guard) then separately setStatus(SYNCING)+save —\na TOCTOU window. Under concurrent at-least-once redelivery (a slow Graph call exceeding the SQS\nvisibility timeout, redelivered mid-flight) two threads both passed the guard, collided on the\n@Version save (ObjectOptimisticLockingFailureException), stranded the record at SYNCING (the\n§098 guard then skipped it forever), and risked duplicate Graph events on a success race (live\nMarco dry-run finding).\n\nReplace read-then-write with an atomic claim: a @Modifying conditional UPDATE (claimForSync)\ntransitions QUEUED/RETRY_REQUESTED — or a stale-lease SYNCING — to SYNCING with version+1 in one\nstatement, returning the affected-row count. The DB serializes concurrent deliveries, so exactly\none claims (claimed==1 → reload → Graph); the rest no-op ACK (claimed==0). No optimistic-lock\nrace, at most one Graph call. The claim runs in its own short txn that commits before the\n(non-transactional) Graph call (§44 no-txn-across-network preserved); the sole claimer owns the\nrow, so the FAILED save no longer races. A claimed record already in Graph reconciles to SYNCED\n(no double-create; avoids a SYNCING↔lease-reclaim loop).\n\nLease-reclaim clause: a SYNCING row idle longer than app.sqs.sync-claim-lease (default PT5M, env\nSYNC_CLAIM_LEASE; MUST exceed the SQS visibility timeout) is claimable again by a redelivery — so\na redelivered message re-claims a stale in-flight row instead of no-op-skipping it forever — while\na recent active claimer is not reclaimed. (A crashed claimer whose sole message was already\nACK-deleted needs an external re-trigger to reprocess; the @Scheduled reaper that republishes\nstale-SYNCING rows is the 104b follow-up.)\n\n§44/rule-#7 unchanged (ids-only claim + log; fixed non-PII code/message; cause-less sanitized\nrethrow → DLQ). rule #4 (sync never blocks the core lifecycle) preserved. Deterministic tests: a\nTestcontainers repo CAS test (the row-state matrix incl. the lease split) + adapted mocked\nlistener tests (no thread-race flake; brief-102 exact-message rethrow kept). New repo method\nclaimForSync; no model change.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"43e838276d740e896adfcb1493c8f5ad58a75da9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/trees/43e838276d740e896adfcb1493c8f5ad58a75da9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/commits/c45a7a604d4735061bb662dbeb41fbdc2559c1f5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commit/c45a7a604d4735061bb662dbeb41fbdc2559c1f5","node_id":"C_kwDOSxKwgtoAKGM0NWE3YTYwNGQ0NzM1MDYxYmI2NjJkYmViNDFmYmRjMjU1OWMxZjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commit/14cdb392a87d156b20d7773c1becd339e57666dc","sha":"14cdb392a87d156b20d7773c1becd339e57666dc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/14cdb392a87d156b20d7773c1becd339e57666dc"}],"sha":"c45a7a604d4735061bb662dbeb41fbdc2559c1f5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/c45a7a604d4735061bb662dbeb41fbdc2559c1f5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/14cdb392a87d156b20d7773c1becd339e57666dc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-06T03:13:29Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-06T03:13:29Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"message":"feat(wc-host): Module Federation HOST shell that embeds the wc_web remote\n\nAdds apps/wc-host — a Vite + React 18 + TS host (\"Acme Portal\") that loads the\nwc_web remote (remoteEntry.js) and mounts the exposed ./WeeklyCommitApp inside a\nparent portal chrome, gated behind a real Auth0 login against the SAME deployed\ntenant (so the embedded remote calls the live API). Proves REQ-I-007/REQ-I-013\n(§7): wc-web is a federation remote that plugs into a host.\n\nHost wiring (the §7 host-integration contract):\n- <BrowserRouter> the remote consumes (renders <AppRoutes/> inside it).\n- import(''wc_web/store'') → <Provider store={store}> so the remote dispatches\n  against its OWN baseApi singleton (a host-built store would be a 2nd RTK Query\n  instance whose queries never resolve).\n- @auth0/auth0-react → getAccessTokenSilently({audience}) passed as getAccessToken.\n\nTwo additive, test-safe changes to apps/wc-web/vite.config.ts (required by any\nreal host; all 310 wc-web Vitest + boundary/host-integration contract tests green):\n- expose ./store (src/app/store.ts; demo-free, no REQ-I-008 surface).\n- share react-router-dom@^6.28.0 (router context is module-identity-based; host +\n  remote must resolve to ONE instance or the remote''s route hooks throw).\nREADME (wc-web host-integration contract) updated to match the realized surface.\n\nVerified: remote + host build with correct federation chunks (remoteEntry +\n__federation_expose_{WeeklyCommitApp,Store} + shared react/react-dom/react-redux/\n@reduxjs/toolkit/react-router-dom); remote served with JS content-type + CORS;\nhost typechecks; live-API URL + auth0 mode baked into the remote.\nRuntime login→mount→live-data QA still pending (browser harnesses occupied +\nwc-api CORS rejects the localhost host origin — see apps/wc-host/README.md).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"dd6943436bcf87a099ce261c68431c17813fce08","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/trees/dd6943436bcf87a099ce261c68431c17813fce08"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/commits/14cdb392a87d156b20d7773c1becd339e57666dc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commit/14cdb392a87d156b20d7773c1becd339e57666dc","node_id":"C_kwDOSxKwgtoAKDE0Y2RiMzkyYTg3ZDE1NmIyMGQ3NzczYzFiZWNkMzM5ZTU3NjY2ZGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commit/9c04cd73b3d83fdf9c287965fe8b7bb08f639748","sha":"9c04cd73b3d83fdf9c287965fe8b7bb08f639748","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/9c04cd73b3d83fdf9c287965fe8b7bb08f639748"}],"sha":"14cdb392a87d156b20d7773c1becd339e57666dc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/14cdb392a87d156b20d7773c1becd339e57666dc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/9c04cd73b3d83fdf9c287965fe8b7bb08f639748/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-06T03:10:21Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-06T03:10:21Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"message":"docs(wc-api): brief 103 round seal — awssdk:sts IRSA fix + Gate-7 un-vacuum (§48-addendum)\n\nRound-seal the deploy-support hot-routing for brief 103 (the impl''s\nbuild-wiring fix landed as 6996318). Captures:\n- LESSONS §48-addendum: (a) AWS SDK v2 IRSA needs software.amazon.awssdk:sts\n  on the runtime classpath — the spring-cloud-aws starters don''t pull it\n  transitively (3rd prod-runtime-classpath gap after pg-driver + flyway;\n  the rule-#4 swallow masked it as \"sync does nothing\"); (b) the meta-lesson:\n  verify-gradle Gate 7 was itself vacuous — `unzip -l <big.jar> | grep -q`\n  under set -o pipefail SIGPIPEs unzip → false-negatives → \"a green gate can\n  be a hollow gate\"; check PIPESTATUS[1].\n- MVP_TASKS deploy-support Log entry (the sts/IRSA root cause + the in-slice\n  Gate-7-vacuity Finding).\n- docs/briefs/103.\n\nBrief-lane next-free = 104. Local commit only (lead pushes).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"52a962bfae73ca7c68f97bbce6ae72a5965ab046","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/trees/52a962bfae73ca7c68f97bbce6ae72a5965ab046"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/commits/9c04cd73b3d83fdf9c287965fe8b7bb08f639748","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commit/9c04cd73b3d83fdf9c287965fe8b7bb08f639748","node_id":"C_kwDOSxKwgtoAKDljMDRjZDczYjNkODNmZGY5YzI4Nzk2NWZlOGI3YmIwOGY2Mzk3NDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commit/69963180ac413998d824dcc869867309c1815552","sha":"69963180ac413998d824dcc869867309c1815552","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/69963180ac413998d824dcc869867309c1815552"}],"sha":"9c04cd73b3d83fdf9c287965fe8b7bb08f639748","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/9c04cd73b3d83fdf9c287965fe8b7bb08f639748"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/69963180ac413998d824dcc869867309c1815552/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-06T03:08:46Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-06T03:08:46Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"message":"fix(wc-api): ship awssdk:sts in the api+worker runtime classpath for IRSA + un-vacuum Gate 7 (deploy #sts)\n\nAWS SDK v2 IRSA auth (WebIdentityTokenCredentialsProvider → AssumeRoleWithWebIdentity)\nneeds software.amazon.awssdk:sts on the runtime classpath, but the spring-cloud-aws\nsns/sqs starters don''t pull it transitively — so on the cluster the api''s lock-time\nsns:Publish and the worker''s SQS consume both fail to assume the IRSA role. The worker\nlogged \"the ''sts'' service module must be on the class path\" every ~11s (never consumed);\nthe api''s §28 rule-#4 swallow masked it as records stuck at PENDING_PUBLISH. Third §48\nprod-runtime-classpath gap (after the pg driver + flyway). Add runtimeOnly\n''software.amazon.awssdk:sts'' to both build.gradle (BOM-versioned via the spring-cloud-aws-\ndependencies → AWS SDK v2 BOM, resolves 2.25.70) and extend verify-gradle Gate 7 to assert\nsts-*.jar in both bootJars.\n\nAlso fix Gate 7''s jar_has_lib: under set -o pipefail, `unzip -l <big.jar> | grep -q`\nSIGPIPEs unzip (141) on a match, so the pipeline reported PRESENT libs as missing —\nGate 7 was racy-vacuous (false-failed present libs under the SIGPIPE race, pinning\nnothing in practice) since #6. Read grep''s own status via PIPESTATUS[1], ignoring\nunzip''s SIGPIPE. Gate 7 now actually pins the prod-runtime deps.\n\nBuild-wiring + gate only; no production/test .java touched.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a1eccf0a574d63b7464f0d11e83031506cb429cd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/trees/a1eccf0a574d63b7464f0d11e83031506cb429cd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/commits/69963180ac413998d824dcc869867309c1815552","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commit/69963180ac413998d824dcc869867309c1815552","node_id":"C_kwDOSxKwgtoAKDY5OTYzMTgwYWM0MTM5OThkODI0ZGNjODY5ODY3MzA5YzE4MTU1NTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commit/ff13c254cb8eea8bc56f01121ea48e15db00d826","sha":"ff13c254cb8eea8bc56f01121ea48e15db00d826","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/ff13c254cb8eea8bc56f01121ea48e15db00d826"}],"sha":"69963180ac413998d824dcc869867309c1815552","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/69963180ac413998d824dcc869867309c1815552"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/ff13c254cb8eea8bc56f01121ea48e15db00d826/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-06T02:53:09Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-06T02:53:09Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"message":"fix(infra): worker GRAPH_MODE demo-success -> real for live Outlook sync (deploy #graph-mode-real)\n\nThe deployed worker ran GRAPH_MODE=demo-success (the no-op stub: marks the\nsync record SYNCED but creates NO real calendar event), so the \"lock a plan ->\nreal Outlook event\" demo could never have produced an event. Flip to \"real\" so\nthe worker uses the real MS Graph createEvent adapter.\n\nSafe to engage: the graph secret (wc/aws/graph) is HITL-populated — its\nAWSCURRENT version (fa351106-…, 2026-06-04 17:17) supersedes the terraform\nplaceholder (now AWSPREVIOUS), confirmed via describe-secret without reading the\nvalue. The §45/D.6 fail-safe would degrade to safe-FAILED at startup if any\nGRAPH_* cred were blank; with creds present, real mode engages.\n\nNOTE: this alone does NOT make the sync flow — it pairs with the backend\n`runtimeOnly software.amazon.awssdk:sts` fix (api+worker bootJars currently lack\nsts, so IRSA AssumeRoleWithWebIdentity fails -> the worker can''t poll SQS + the\napi can''t sns:Publish; the §48 packaging-gap class). Both land in one redeploy.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"93cdbaba8a6077a671cdc70cf636367de42f9e56","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/trees/93cdbaba8a6077a671cdc70cf636367de42f9e56"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/commits/ff13c254cb8eea8bc56f01121ea48e15db00d826","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commit/ff13c254cb8eea8bc56f01121ea48e15db00d826","node_id":"C_kwDOSxKwgtoAKGZmMTNjMjU0Y2I4ZWVhOGJjNTZmMDExMjFlYTQ4ZTE1ZGIwMGQ4MjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commit/e75dd516b566b1c9e7b3b157ece41429949df41c","sha":"e75dd516b566b1c9e7b3b157ece41429949df41c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/e75dd516b566b1c9e7b3b157ece41429949df41c"}],"sha":"ff13c254cb8eea8bc56f01121ea48e15db00d826","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/ff13c254cb8eea8bc56f01121ea48e15db00d826"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/e75dd516b566b1c9e7b3b157ece41429949df41c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-05T03:51:58Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-05T03:51:58Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"message":"ci(deploy): harden REQ-E-006 smoke against first-deploy DNS negative-cache (deploy #smoke-dns)\n\nThe first full deploy (#11) rolled out cleanly but the in-pipeline smoke failed\nwith `curl: (6) Could not resolve host: api.wc.<domain>`. Root cause = a\nfirst-deploy DNS race, NOT a broken app: external-dns writes the api.wc ALIAS\n~1-2 min after the Ingress comes up, and an early NXDOMAIN gets negatively cached\nby the runner''s recursive resolver for up to the zone''s SOA negative-cache TTL\n(<=900s). The old smoke retried only ~90s (5x15s), so it kept returning the stale\nNXDOMAIN even though the record was live the whole time.\n\nDeterministic fix (bypass the poisoned cache, not wait it out):\n- A wait-gate resolves each host on a PUBLIC resolver (1.1.1.1 -> 8.8.8.8) until\n  it returns an answer (<= ~7 min budget) — proves real global propagation,\n  independent of the runner''s local cache.\n- The readiness/SPA curls pin those IPs via `--resolve`, so the assertion never\n  consults the runner''s local resolver; SNI still presents the hostname, so the\n  ACM cert matches.\n\nAssertions are unchanged (API readiness 200 + SPA 200 over real ACM TLS). A\ngenuinely-missing record (wait-gate exits 1) or a real outage (curl -f on any\nnon-2xx) still fails the smoke — this hardens timing without masking a fault.\nactionlint clean (incl. shellcheck on the run block).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"93566f226c3331c51f97c4ffb116415fca39423c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/trees/93566f226c3331c51f97c4ffb116415fca39423c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/commits/e75dd516b566b1c9e7b3b157ece41429949df41c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commit/e75dd516b566b1c9e7b3b157ece41429949df41c","node_id":"C_kwDOSxKwgtoAKGU3NWRkNTE2YjU2NmIxYzllN2IzYjE1N2VjZTQxNDI5OTQ5ZGY0MWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commit/e3a420c508352f87f12a075bd366f0571bc3c634","sha":"e3a420c508352f87f12a075bd366f0571bc3c634","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/e3a420c508352f87f12a075bd366f0571bc3c634"}],"sha":"e75dd516b566b1c9e7b3b157ece41429949df41c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/e75dd516b566b1c9e7b3b157ece41429949df41c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/e3a420c508352f87f12a075bd366f0571bc3c634/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-05T03:47:00Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-05T03:47:00Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"message":"docs(wc-api): brief 102 round seal — deterministic worker PII-sanitization assertions (§44-addendum)\n\nRound-seal the deploy-support hot-routing for brief 102 (the impl''s test-only\nfix landed as a8cd336). Captures:\n- LESSONS §44-addendum: the \"pin with teeth\" recipe has a hex-collision\n  footgun — a notContaining(<token>) assertion against an ids-only message\n  embedding a random UUID flakes when the token is pure hex (e.g. \"403\");\n  assert the EXACT ids-only message instead (stronger + collision-proof),\n  audit the whole class (§48).\n- MVP_TASKS deploy-support Log entry (brief 102; the UUID/hex-collision\n  diagnosis + the corrected-from-parallelism Finding + the 3-site fix).\n- docs/briefs/102.\n\nBrief-lane next-free = 103. Local commit only (lead pushes).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6da2026e3448a318bbed874833e91f66e240f86a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/trees/6da2026e3448a318bbed874833e91f66e240f86a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/commits/e3a420c508352f87f12a075bd366f0571bc3c634","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commit/e3a420c508352f87f12a075bd366f0571bc3c634","node_id":"C_kwDOSxKwgtoAKGUzYTQyMGM1MDgzNTJmODdmMTJhMDc1YmQzNjZmMDU3MWJjM2M2MzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commit/a8cd336316bb68b55a12a92e6fb1d34eb0125ede","sha":"a8cd336316bb68b55a12a92e6fb1d34eb0125ede","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/a8cd336316bb68b55a12a92e6fb1d34eb0125ede"}],"sha":"e3a420c508352f87f12a075bd366f0571bc3c634","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/e3a420c508352f87f12a075bd366f0571bc3c634"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/a8cd336316bb68b55a12a92e6fb1d34eb0125ede/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-05T03:45:18Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-05T03:45:18Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"message":"test(wc-api): deterministic worker PII-sanitization assertions (flaky \"403\"/random-UUID hex collision)\n\nThe two rule-#7/§44 sanitized-rethrow tests asserted .hasMessageNotContaining(\"403\")\nagainst an ids-only exception message embedding the record''s random UUID. \"403\" is pure\nhex, so it appears by chance in ~0.5% of random UUIDs — GraphCalendarAdapterTest\n.graphError_isSanitizedToCleanNonPiiException flaked deploy #10''s gate; SyncMessageListenerTest\n.graphFailure_recordsFailedAndThrows was latent-identical. Replace the three notContaining\nchecks at each site with one exact-message assertion (.hasMessage(\"…syncRecord=\" + r.getId())) —\nstrictly stronger (the message is EXACTLY the ids-only string, nothing from the raw Graph\nerror) and deterministic for any id. Also converted the 098 retry-failure site for consistency\n(§48). isInstanceOf + hasNoCause kept; seeds stay UUID.randomUUID() (now id-agnostic).\nTest-only; no production change.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5e3735ff6835f91e3800b05ac77996ad61f6106d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/trees/5e3735ff6835f91e3800b05ac77996ad61f6106d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/commits/a8cd336316bb68b55a12a92e6fb1d34eb0125ede","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commit/a8cd336316bb68b55a12a92e6fb1d34eb0125ede","node_id":"C_kwDOSxKwgtoAKGE4Y2QzMzYzMTZiYjY4YjU1YTEyYTkyZTZmYjFkMzRlYjAxMjVlZGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commit/17327db967d6cd9b4aa91812daff118ba5445787","sha":"17327db967d6cd9b4aa91812daff118ba5445787","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/17327db967d6cd9b4aa91812daff118ba5445787"}],"sha":"a8cd336316bb68b55a12a92e6fb1d34eb0125ede","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/a8cd336316bb68b55a12a92e6fb1d34eb0125ede"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/17327db967d6cd9b4aa91812daff118ba5445787/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-05T03:28:12Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-05T03:28:12Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"message":"docs(wc-api): first-live-deploy boot-domino chain (#5b → #9) round seal\n\nRound-seal the deploy-support hot-routing for the first live deploy. The\nproduction artifacts ran against real AWS for the first time, surfacing a\nchain of boot/config crashes the test suite structurally can''t catch\n(test classpath + MOCK/servlet context hide them). Backend fixes #5b/#6/#7/#9\nalready shipped (8e593f0/1910cbe/57c1d1e/fac73c8); this commit lands the\ndocs + lessons that trail them.\n\nLESSONS:\n- §43-addendum (#5b): empty-default ${SNS_TOPIC_ARN:} + length-expression\n  gateway selection — no-default placeholder in an always-evaluated condition\n  crashes non-serving Jobs.\n- §48 (#6/#7): the first-deploy config/packaging gap class — bootJar\n  runtime deps (testImplementation-only driver/flyway absent from the jar)\n  + non-serving-Job boot-placeholder defaults; audit the whole class, not\n  whack-a-mole.\n- §19-addendum (#9): web-gate SecurityConfig + the eager JwtConfig +\n  Auth0ClaimMapper on @ConditionalOnWebApplication(SERVLET) — @EnableWebSecurity\n  forces the chain to build regardless of web=none; §12''s autoconfig-vs-\n  component-scan trap manifest at deploy.\n\nAlso: CLAUDE.md §48 lessons-index row; MVP_TASKS ORCH-CONTINUITY block +\nKMS-pin carry-forward + the #5b→#9 deploy-support Log entry; .gitignore\ndocs/demo.md; briefs 099/100/101.\n\nBrief-lane next-free = 102. Local commit only (lead pushes).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bf0f3ce77a82a6c02d41f27eab46709a0bdc92fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/trees/bf0f3ce77a82a6c02d41f27eab46709a0bdc92fb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/commits/17327db967d6cd9b4aa91812daff118ba5445787","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commit/17327db967d6cd9b4aa91812daff118ba5445787","node_id":"C_kwDOSxKwgtoAKDE3MzI3ZGI5NjdkNmNkOWI0YWE5MTgxMmRhZmYxMThiYTU0NDU3ODc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commit/fac73c817e0f416ae2f6d25b6a248ca155910f47","sha":"fac73c817e0f416ae2f6d25b6a248ca155910f47","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/fac73c817e0f416ae2f6d25b6a248ca155910f47"}],"sha":"17327db967d6cd9b4aa91812daff118ba5445787","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/17327db967d6cd9b4aa91812daff118ba5445787"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/fac73c817e0f416ae2f6d25b6a248ca155910f47/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-05T03:15:26Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-05T03:15:26Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"message":"fix(wc-api): web-gate SecurityConfig/JwtConfig/Auth0ClaimMapper for non-serving batch jobs (deploy #9)\n\n@EnableWebSecurity forces SecurityConfig''s SecurityFilterChain beans to\nbuild regardless of web-application-type, and JwtConfig.jwtDecoder is an\neager singleton gated only on demo-auth -- so a one-shot batch job sharing\nthe serving image (web=none via infra #8, aws profile, no Auth0 issuer/\naudience) still builds the real chain + decoder -> IllegalStateException on\nthe migration/rebuild/cronjob boot (infra #8''s web=none alone can''t stop\n@EnableWebSecurity).\n\nGate SecurityConfig + JwtConfig on @ConditionalOnWebApplication(SERVLET):\nthe serving api is always servlet-web (full security + the §12/§19 Auth0\nfail-fast intact); the non-serving batch jobs exclude both -> no jwtDecoder,\nno chains -> clean boot -> Flyway runs. Gating JwtConfig orphaned the\nAuth0Properties it registered, which the @Component Auth0ClaimMapper\n(JWT-claim mapper, HTTP-request-path only) depends on, so gate it too --\nweb-path-only, removes nothing a batch job uses.\n\nNo serving path loses security (the conditional is always TRUE on the\nservlet api); DomainAuthorizationService (rule #3) is a separate ungated\n@Service. Tests: a webEnvironment=NONE batch-context boot proves the clean\nload + absent security beans; JwtDecoderConfigTest/CustomJwtDecoderWinsTest\nmove to WebApplicationContextRunner (the web-gated JwtConfig is web-only),\nthe serving-path missing-issuer fail-fast still proven. Keep infra #8.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"84d182aeb1f86b93bbcd409fe472a545e36449f6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/trees/84d182aeb1f86b93bbcd409fe472a545e36449f6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/commits/fac73c817e0f416ae2f6d25b6a248ca155910f47","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commit/fac73c817e0f416ae2f6d25b6a248ca155910f47","node_id":"C_kwDOSxKwgtoAKGZhYzczYzgxN2UwZjQxNmFlMmY2ZDI1YjZhMjQ4Y2ExNTU5MTBmNDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commit/b74461219df249663904019b076bc3c088c8869a","sha":"b74461219df249663904019b076bc3c088c8869a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/b74461219df249663904019b076bc3c088c8869a"}],"sha":"fac73c817e0f416ae2f6d25b6a248ca155910f47","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/fac73c817e0f416ae2f6d25b6a248ca155910f47"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/b74461219df249663904019b076bc3c088c8869a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-05T02:38:48Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-05T02:38:48Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"message":"fix(infra): migration Job boots non-web (web-application-type=none) — deploy #8\n\nThe deployed wc-migration Job had no `args` block, so it booted a FULL servlet\nweb app → the real-mode OAuth2 security chain instantiated (SecurityConfig.\nrealModeChain → JwtConfig) and demanded the Auth0 issuer-uri the DB-secret-only\nmigration pod (correctly) does not mount → fail-boot:\n  IllegalStateException: Real-mode Auth0 config ''...jwt.issuer-uri'' is required\n  but missing/blank.\n\nAdd args: [\"--spring.main.web-application-type=none\"] to the migration container,\nmirroring the sibling batch Jobs (cronjob-generation + job-rebuild-projections).\nBooting non-web means the servlet security autoconfig never activates; Flyway\n(V1-V6 + the db/demo-seed personas) runs at context-init regardless of web type.\nThe flyway-migrate profile also sets web-application-type=none, but a profile-file\nsetting is not reliably honored for spring.main.* -- the CLI arg (highest\nprecedence) is the proven mechanism. All 3 batch Jobs now carry it (commented).\n\nkubeconform -strict green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4ac2b19ba0f887b2687decd743a2a86411aba9a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/trees/4ac2b19ba0f887b2687decd743a2a86411aba9a9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/commits/b74461219df249663904019b076bc3c088c8869a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commit/b74461219df249663904019b076bc3c088c8869a","node_id":"C_kwDOSxKwgtoAKGI3NDQ2MTIxOWRmMjQ5NjYzOTA0MDE5YjA3NmJjM2MwODhjODg2OWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commit/57c1d1ec15b9a61eaa84f3e9339e2279e2eb2ddb","sha":"57c1d1ec15b9a61eaa84f3e9339e2279e2eb2ddb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/57c1d1ec15b9a61eaa84f3e9339e2279e2eb2ddb"}],"sha":"b74461219df249663904019b076bc3c088c8869a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/b74461219df249663904019b076bc3c088c8869a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/57c1d1ec15b9a61eaa84f3e9339e2279e2eb2ddb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-05T02:20:46Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-05T02:20:46Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"message":"fix(wc-api): resolvable ROOT_DOMAIN default in the aws profile for non-serving Jobs (deploy #7)\n\nThe aws-profile Jobs (migration / generate-plan-shells / rebuild-\nprojections) run SPRING_PROFILES_ACTIVE=aws but never set ROOT_DOMAIN\n(only the api/worker Deployments do -- Jobs don''t serve HTTP). Base\napplication.yml uses ${ROOT_DOMAIN:localhost}, but application-aws.yml\ndropped the default on the auth0 audience (line 30) and the nested\n${ROOT_DOMAIN} of the CORS allow-list (line 50) -> the Job context\nfail-boots: \"Could not resolve placeholder ''ROOT_DOMAIN''\".\n\nRestore the :localhost default (base mirror) on both. Production is\nunchanged -- the api/worker Deployments inject the real ROOT_DOMAIN, which\nwins; :localhost only applies in the non-serving Jobs where CORS/audience\nare unused. A systemic audit confirmed these 2 nested ${ROOT_DOMAIN} are\nthe ONLY no-default placeholders a Job context hits (the @Value usages are\nall defaulted or condition-gated). An aws-profile property-resolution test\n(real yaml, no env) pins the always-resolvable invariant. Unblocks the\nlive deploy''s non-API Jobs.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4f7dfbab453798323708c5a57318c4842b7cef3d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/trees/4f7dfbab453798323708c5a57318c4842b7cef3d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/commits/57c1d1ec15b9a61eaa84f3e9339e2279e2eb2ddb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commit/57c1d1ec15b9a61eaa84f3e9339e2279e2eb2ddb","node_id":"C_kwDOSxKwgtoAKDU3YzFkMWVjMTViOWE2MWVhYTg0ZjNlOTMzOWUyMjc5ZTJlYjJkZGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commit/1910cbe4cb77bcefbea2fd04703bd67100dd2091","sha":"1910cbe4cb77bcefbea2fd04703bd67100dd2091","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/1910cbe4cb77bcefbea2fd04703bd67100dd2091"}],"sha":"57c1d1ec15b9a61eaa84f3e9339e2279e2eb2ddb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/57c1d1ec15b9a61eaa84f3e9339e2279e2eb2ddb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/1910cbe4cb77bcefbea2fd04703bd67100dd2091/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-05T01:50:22Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-05T01:50:22Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"message":"fix(wc-api): ship the postgres JDBC driver + flyway (core+pg) in the production runtime classpath (deploy #6)\n\norg.postgresql:postgresql, org.flywaydb:flyway-core, and\norg.flywaydb:flyway-database-postgresql were testImplementation-only\n(Testcontainers) -> absent from the api/worker bootJars. The first real-PG\ndatasource run (migration pod, outside Testcontainers) fails: \"Failed to\nload driver class org.postgresql.Driver\". Add runtimeOnly for the driver\nto both api + worker, and runtimeOnly flyway-core + flyway-database-\npostgresql to api (the migration runs Flyway 10 against PG). An audit\nfound flyway-core itself was ALSO test-only -- not just the split-out PG\nmodule -- so the migration engine is folded in too. testImplementation\nstays for the test classpath; flyway stays disabled outside the\nflyway-migrate profile (autoconfig inert).\n\nVerified each bootJar''s BOOT-INF/lib now carries the driver (api +\nworker), and the api the flyway-core + flyway-pg modules; a verify-gradle\n.sh Gate 7 pins it (no unit test catches a production-scope gap).\nUnblocks the live deploy''s datasource init.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9b65eeea93f35802eadc5fdbbd4b4f8501d28522","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/trees/9b65eeea93f35802eadc5fdbbd4b4f8501d28522"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/commits/1910cbe4cb77bcefbea2fd04703bd67100dd2091","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commit/1910cbe4cb77bcefbea2fd04703bd67100dd2091","node_id":"C_kwDOSxKwgtoAKDE5MTBjYmU0Y2I3N2JjZWZiZWEyZmQwNDcwM2JkNjcxMDBkZDIwOTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commit/8e593f016e15074529d4aba2d95531036286fb59","sha":"8e593f016e15074529d4aba2d95531036286fb59","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/8e593f016e15074529d4aba2d95531036286fb59"}],"sha":"1910cbe4cb77bcefbea2fd04703bd67100dd2091","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/1910cbe4cb77bcefbea2fd04703bd67100dd2091"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/8e593f016e15074529d4aba2d95531036286fb59/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-05T01:17:25Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-05T01:17:25Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"message":"fix(wc-api): empty-default SNS topic-arn + length-expression gateway selection (deploy #5b)\n\nThe aws-profile Jobs (migration / generate-plan-shells / rebuild-\nprojections) run SPRING_PROFILES_ACTIVE=aws but are never given\nSNS_TOPIC_ARN (API-Deployment-only). application-aws.yml bound\napp.sns.topic-arn to a no-default ${SNS_TOPIC_ARN}, and\n@ConditionalOnProperty is evaluated for EVERY aws context at boot, so the\nunresolvable placeholder crashed every non-API aws Job at condition-eval.\n\nGive the property an empty default (${SNS_TOPIC_ARN:}) and switch BOTH\ngateway beans to the exact-inverse length expression: the real\nAwsSnsLifecycleGateway on ''${app.sns.topic-arn:}''.length() > 0, the no-op\nLoggingLifecycleSnsGateway on length() == 0. Both MUST change -- with the\nempty default the property is always present (as \"\"), so the stub''s old\nmatchIfMissing / havingValue=\"false\" would stop firing -> no-bean crash.\nEmpty/absent -> stub (clean boot); non-empty (the API) -> real gateway,\nunchanged. Rule #4 publish semantics untouched -- only the activation\ncondition moves. A marker test pins the empty default so a future dropped\n'':'' is caught.\n\nUnblocks the live deploy''s non-API Jobs.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a922f64c8c07f39a73853f781307cd6b5f07559e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/trees/a922f64c8c07f39a73853f781307cd6b5f07559e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/commits/8e593f016e15074529d4aba2d95531036286fb59","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commit/8e593f016e15074529d4aba2d95531036286fb59","node_id":"C_kwDOSxKwgtoAKDhlNTkzZjAxNmUxNTA3NDUyOWQ0YWJhMmQ5NTUzMTAzNjI4NmZiNTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commit/cdee04fe6b794db2fc9f39e32a296d5f5c68e56f","sha":"cdee04fe6b794db2fc9f39e32a296d5f5c68e56f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/cdee04fe6b794db2fc9f39e32a296d5f5c68e56f"}],"sha":"8e593f016e15074529d4aba2d95531036286fb59","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/8e593f016e15074529d4aba2d95531036286fb59"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/cdee04fe6b794db2fc9f39e32a296d5f5c68e56f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-05T01:01:11Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-05T01:01:11Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"message":"fix(infra): CSIDriver tokenRequests for IRSA secret mounts (deploy-issue #5)\n\nThe deployed migration pod hung in ContainerCreating; the Secrets Store CSI\nmount failed: \"CSI token error: serviceAccount.tokens not provided - ensure\ntokenRequests is configured in CSIDriver spec\". The secrets-store-csi-driver\nhelm_release set syncSecret/rotation but NOT tokenRequests, so the\nsecrets-store.csi.k8s.io CSIDriver lacked spec.tokenRequests -- the kubelet\nnever projected the pod SA''s bound token (aud=sts.amazonaws.com) into the\ndriver, so the AWS provider (ASCP) couldn''t AssumeRoleWithWebIdentity (IRSA)\nto fetch the secret.\n\nAdd tokenRequests=[{audience: sts.amazonaws.com}] to the driver''s helm values.\nApplied (targeted helm upgrade; tokenRequests is mutable -> patched in-place)\nand verified: the live CSIDriver now carries it and the migration pod mounts\nthe db secret cleanly (gets past ContainerCreating to container start).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fe2f68172990cc63e52c183d4f9757d78ad48c54","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/trees/fe2f68172990cc63e52c183d4f9757d78ad48c54"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/commits/cdee04fe6b794db2fc9f39e32a296d5f5c68e56f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commit/cdee04fe6b794db2fc9f39e32a296d5f5c68e56f","node_id":"C_kwDOSxKwgtoAKGNkZWUwNGZlNmI3OTRkYjJmYzlmMzllMzJhMjk2ZDVmNWM2OGU1NmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commit/8f8bf603b1b2f58d0b23fe7bd8c23eddf7aab536","sha":"8f8bf603b1b2f58d0b23fe7bd8c23eddf7aab536","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/8f8bf603b1b2f58d0b23fe7bd8c23eddf7aab536"}],"sha":"cdee04fe6b794db2fc9f39e32a296d5f5c68e56f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/cdee04fe6b794db2fc9f39e32a296d5f5c68e56f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/8f8bf603b1b2f58d0b23fe7bd8c23eddf7aab536/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-05T00:13:06Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-05T00:13:06Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"message":"fix(infra): CI-role ssm grant + identity-stable EKS access entries (deploy-issue #4)\n\nThe deploy job''s `terraform apply` (as wc-aws-ci-deploy) failed at the EKS\nnode-group''s AMI SSM data-read, and the cluster-admin access churned with the\napply identity. Fixes:\n\n- iam_ci.tf: grant the CI role ssm:GetParameter/GetParameters scoped to the\n  AWS-public EKS AMI params (arn:aws:ssm:*::parameter/aws/service/eks/*) -- the\n  managed-node-group module reads the optimized-AMI release version at plan time.\n- eks.tf: enable_cluster_creator_admin_permissions=false (the module''s\n  caller-derived cluster_creator entry churned/replaced between the human-admin\n  and CI-role applies, and also flipped the KMS key policy). Replace it with an\n  explicit, identity-STABLE cluster-admin entry for the human admin\n  (aws_eks_access_entry.admin, var.admin_principal_arn) + common_tags. The CI\n  role keeps its own standalone entry (iam_ci.tf aws_eks_access_entry.ci).\n- variables.tf: new required var admin_principal_arn (the human break-glass admin).\n- deploy.yml + runbook (b): wire TF_VAR_admin_principal_arn (GitHub var\n  ADMIN_PRINCIPAL_ARN) so CI''s applies maintain the admin entry; + the Step-3\n  local export + the Step-4 var-table row.\n\nApplied locally as the human admin (issue4-clean.tfplan: 0 add / 1 change /\n0 destroy = the ssm grant; the cluster_creator->admin transition done via\n`terraform state mv` for zero access disruption). Re-plan: \"No changes.\"\nfmt/validate/tflint/actionlint green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0000121fbdcac1988a30b334c1eec5d3b8aeeaf5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/trees/0000121fbdcac1988a30b334c1eec5d3b8aeeaf5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/commits/8f8bf603b1b2f58d0b23fe7bd8c23eddf7aab536","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commit/8f8bf603b1b2f58d0b23fe7bd8c23eddf7aab536","node_id":"C_kwDOSxKwgtoAKDhmOGJmNjAzYjFiMmY1OGQwYjIzZmU3YmQ4YzIzZWRkZjdhYWI1MzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commit/412f199d4af5e85c230279738f5ee935a6fecf9a","sha":"412f199d4af5e85c230279738f5ee935a6fecf9a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/412f199d4af5e85c230279738f5ee935a6fecf9a"}],"sha":"8f8bf603b1b2f58d0b23fe7bd8c23eddf7aab536","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/8f8bf603b1b2f58d0b23fe7bd8c23eddf7aab536"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/412f199d4af5e85c230279738f5ee935a6fecf9a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-04T23:39:02Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-04T23:39:02Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"message":"fix(ci): enable corepack so CI uses the pinned yarn 4.5.3\n\nThe GitHub runner ships global Yarn 1.x with Corepack disabled, but the repo\npins `packageManager: yarn@4.5.3` -- so every `yarn` step errored (\"current\nglobal version of Yarn is 1.22.22 ... Corepack must ... be enabled\") and the\ngates job failed at \"Frontend install\". Add `corepack enable` right after\n\"Set up Node 20\" in BOTH jobs: the gates job (before the frontend steps) and\nthe deploy job (before the post-approval wc-web build, so it doesn''t hit the\nsame error after burning the deploy approval + partial AWS work).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"57beb1179f44fadd47b9f38a247ce25eca15389e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/trees/57beb1179f44fadd47b9f38a247ce25eca15389e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/commits/412f199d4af5e85c230279738f5ee935a6fecf9a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.githu