//api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/a5d7433b8f0415e17feceeabcf123b50371bc9a9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-04T23:18:11Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-04T23:18:11Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"message":"style(wc-web): prettier --write (24 files the broken gate masked)\n\nThe deploy.yml prettier gate had been erroring at the root (see the fix(ci)\ncommit) rather than checking, so 24 wc-web files had drifted from the\nproject''s own prettier config. Apply `yarn workspace wc-web prettier --write .`\n-- formatting-only (no logic); ESLint + Vitest stay green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"dd6fcd22320c25ab78567848d8fbcdfcec4eb54e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/trees/dd6fcd22320c25ab78567848d8fbcdfcec4eb54e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/commits/a5d7433b8f0415e17feceeabcf123b50371bc9a9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizati