com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/46e7205fec7669c63c2b28f4742199a75f903304/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-04T23:18:11Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-04T23:18:11Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"message":"fix(ci): scope prettier gate to wc-web workspace\n\n`yarn prettier --check .` at the repo root errored in Yarn Berry 4\n(\"couldn''t find a script named prettier\") because prettier is a wc-web-only\ndevDependency, not a root binary -- so the gates job would fail before\nchecking anything. Use the existing Berry-correct, frontend-scoped script\n`yarn workspace wc-web format:check` instead.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ff0bbb4aa70cece82f0384e7e2897f38258d4531","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/trees/ff0bbb4aa70cece82f0384e7e2897f38258d4531"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/commits/46e7205fec7669c63c2b28f4742199a75f903304","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"star