4T23:13:48Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-04T23:13:48Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"message":"docs(tasks): deploy-blocking drift-fix arc COMPLETE (096-098 + re-seed) — round seal\n\nRound-of-record for the 4-commit backend drift-fix arc that closed the 3\nconfirmed-HIGH \"built-but-dead-surface\" findings before the first deploy:\n096 comments E20/E21 (c62fcce), 097 Outlook sync read+retry E22/E23\n(a9ca31b), 098 worker §10 status guard (639044b), + the V5 persona-email\nre-seed to the M365 tenant (87daf80). Reachability throughout — dead\nauthorizers / enum / affordances wired to their first prod callers.\n\nReconciles: the Log entry (orchestrator framing); the re-seed Carry-forward\nitem marked RESOLVED; hot-routed cross-doc (LESSONS §46/§47/§44-addendum +\nindex rows; ARCH §15 COMMENT_CREATED / §5+B.21 SYNC_NOT_RETRYABLE /\nAppendix E persona emails; CLAUDE cross-doc B.9/B.10 rows); briefs 096-098;\norchestrator session doc 022.\n\n096/097 security-reviewed CLEAN (0/0/0); 098 light pass clean. E22\nowner-only / E23 manager-inclusive (catalog asymmetry). 099 perf-seed HELD\n(lead — off-path, post-deploy/defer). Deploy gate 096+097+098+re-seed MET;\nimpl persists for deploy-support. Local commit only (lead pushes).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7aa1fa2c2e24084a892eaaadb70bfd5cd1663028","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/trees/7aa1fa2c2e24084a892eaaadb70bfd5cd1663028"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/commits/a1ec5ff85233e0b3c93522bf15064dd91af5b813","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.co