github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/87daf80d0e809ef8eb41f403a4089ef01f66ba84/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-04T22:59:11Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-04T22:59:11Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"message":"chore(wc-api): point V5 persona emails at the dreddy817.onmicrosoft.com M365 tenant\n\nThe worker Graph adapter writes calendar events to each persona''s\nEmployee.email (the mailbox address). For the live-Outlook demo those must\nbe real licensed mailboxes on the user''s M365 E3 tenant, so swap the 7 V5\npersona email-column values @st6demo.com -> @dreddy817.onmicrosoft.com\n(local parts + external_subject unchanged). Auth-inert: identity resolves\non external_subject (JWT) / id (demo), never email (no findByEmail); the\nAuth0 login emails stay @st6demo.com (cosmetic). A hard pre-first-deploy\nitem -- edit-in-place couples to Flyway''s checksum once V5 is applied.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"23650f36e6b819b5d874b42cffaca2e4c5c9e0cf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/trees/23650f36e6b819b5d874b42cffaca2e4c5c9e0cf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/commits/87daf80d0e809ef8eb41f403a4089ef01f66ba84","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commit/87daf80d0e809ef8eb41f403a4089ef01f66ba84","node_id":"C_kwDOSxKwgtoAKDg3ZGFmODBkMGU4MDllZjhlYjQxZjQwM2E0MDg5ZWYwMWY2NmJhODQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commit/639044b15f1e24950a178968cd8869c47c6c8c63","sha":"639044b15f1e24950a178968cd8869c47c6c8c63","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/639044b15f1e24950a178968cd8869c47c6c8c63"}],"sha":"87daf80d0e809ef8eb41f403a4089ef01f66ba84","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/87daf80d0e809ef8eb41f403a4089ef01f66ba84"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/639044b15f1e24950a178968cd8869c47c6c8c63/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-04T22:50:36Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-04T22:50:36Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"message":"fix(wc-api): worker §10 redelivery status guard (Wave-2 098)\n\nThe s8 SyncMessageListener skipped only on graphEventId != null; it did\nNOT gate on status, so a redelivered in-flight SYNCING duplicate (or a\nFAILED/PENDING_PUBLISH record) would be re-attempted. Add the §10\nworker-trigger guard: (re)attempt Graph ONLY when the reloaded record''s\nstatus in {QUEUED, RETRY_REQUESTED}; SYNCED/SYNCING/FAILED/PENDING_PUBLISH\nare a no-op (return acks/deletes the message -- a legitimately-skipped\nstate is not a failure, so it never redrives). The graphEventId guard is\nretained as secondary defense.\n\nCompletes the 097 retry e2e (a republished RETRY_REQUESTED/QUEUED record\nis re-attempted -> SYNCING -> Graph -> SYNCED) and hardens at-least-once\nidempotency (closes the in-flight-SYNCING-duplicate gap). S44 preserved\nbyte-for-byte: the retry failure path keeps the cause-less, ids-only\nSyncProcessingException -> PII-free DLQ. The skip log is ids-only.\n\nLast deploy-blocking slice -- the 096+097+098 code prerequisites for the\nfirst deploy are now met.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"30d130878a32112926ce97cb832be128336c87bc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/trees/30d130878a32112926ce97cb832be128336c87bc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/commits/639044b15f1e24950a178968cd8869c47c6c8c63","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commit/639044b15f1e24950a178968cd8869c47c6c8c63","node_id":"C_kwDOSxKwgtoAKDYzOTA0NGIxNWYxZTI0OTUwYTE3ODk2OGNkODg2OWM0N2M2YzhjNjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commit/a9ca31b8cdbbaf6c8c35c9dedb4ae313b774a370","sha":"a9ca31b8cdbbaf6c8c35c9dedb4ae313b774a370","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/a9ca31b8cdbbaf6c8c35c9dedb4ae313b774a370"}],"sha":"639044b15f1e24950a178968cd8869c47c6c8c63","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/639044b15f1e24950a178968cd8869c47c6c8c63"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/a9ca31b8cdbbaf6c8c35c9dedb4ae313b774a370/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-04T22:35:03Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-04T22:35:03Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"message":"feat(wc-api): Outlook sync read + retry — E22 list + E23 retry (§10)\n\nWire the dead RETRY_REQUESTED status / authorizeSyncRecordAccess /\nRETRY_SYNC surface into a reachable GET /api/outlook-sync?planId= (bare\nOutlookSyncRecordDto[]) + POST /api/outlook-sync/{id}/retry, serving the\n9.12 frontend contract. The first production caller of\nauthorizeSyncRecordAccess (E23) + a new owner-only authorizeSyncListAccess\n(E22).\n\nE22 is OWNER-ONLY (the catalog \"IC own\" + the frontend''s IC-only usage):\na manager-of-owner gets a codeless 404 + denial audit (the sync list is\nthe IC''s private view) -- the deliberate asymmetry with the\nmanager-inclusive E23 retry. E23 retry flips FAILED -> RETRY_REQUESTED in\nthe core txn and REUSES the s7 SnsLifecyclePublisher afterCommit to\nrepublish the bare pointer (trigger-agnostic: QUEUED on success,\nswallow+retain on failure -- rule #4 never throws to the caller). The\nresponse shows RETRY_REQUESTED (core-txn snapshot); the async publish\nadvances the DB to QUEUED. A non-FAILED retry -> 409 SYNC_NOT_RETRYABLE.\n\nrule #7: the bare 4-field SyncJobPointer is reused verbatim (no new\npayload). canRetrySync(status==FAILED) is the single source for both the\nRETRY_SYNC affordance and the retry enforcement (S31). Unblocks the\nfrontend sync retry UI + the V6 Marco FAILED-record demo. The worker\nRETRY_REQUESTED handling is the separate 098.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a79439932d6ed76c0aa9a771a07bd9915f1b3431","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/trees/a79439932d6ed76c0aa9a771a07bd9915f1b3431"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/commits/a9ca31b8cdbbaf6c8c35c9dedb4ae313b774a370","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commit/a9ca31b8cdbbaf6c8c35c9dedb4ae313b774a370","node_id":"C_kwDOSxKwgtoAKGE5Y2EzMWI4Y2RiYmFmNmM4YzM1YzlkZWRiNGFlMzEzYjc3NGEzNzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commit/b08f466b587df56d042d1133fab9dfac2630fa97","sha":"b08f466b587df56d042d1133fab9dfac2630fa97","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/b08f466b587df56d042d1133fab9dfac2630fa97"}],"sha":"a9ca31b8cdbbaf6c8c35c9dedb4ae313b774a370","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/a9ca31b8cdbbaf6c8c35c9dedb4ae313b774a370"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/b08f466b587df56d042d1133fab9dfac2630fa97/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-04T22:33:41Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-04T22:33:41Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"message":"fix(ci): replace broken `nx e2e wc-e2e` gate with the e2e typecheck\n\nThe gates job ran `yarn nx e2e wc-e2e`, but wc-e2e has no `e2e` nx target\n(only cypress:open/cypress:run/typecheck) -> \"target not found\" fails the\ngates job -> the deploy job (needs: gates) never runs. The Cypress/Cucumber\ngreen run (compose-up + the ~24 data-cy selector reconciliations) is deferred\nto Phase-12/11.9 by design, so gate on `wc-e2e:typecheck` (tsc --noEmit)\ninstead -- a real, passing check that the suite compiles.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"70da825aee40d9e2b35690881c441c99ebc3bd98","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/trees/70da825aee40d9e2b35690881c441c99ebc3bd98"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/commits/b08f466b587df56d042d1133fab9dfac2630fa97","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commit/b08f466b587df56d042d1133fab9dfac2630fa97","node_id":"C_kwDOSxKwgtoAKGIwOGY0NjZiNTg3ZGY1NmQwNDJkMTEzM2ZhYjlkZmFjMjYzMGZhOTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commit/c62fcce8f5fe9c68c34794c2ac1a3934a741a5ac","sha":"c62fcce8f5fe9c68c34794c2ac1a3934a741a5ac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/c62fcce8f5fe9c68c34794c2ac1a3934a741a5ac"}],"sha":"b08f466b587df56d042d1133fab9dfac2630fa97","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/b08f466b587df56d042d1133fab9dfac2630fa97"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/c62fcce8f5fe9c68c34794c2ac1a3934a741a5ac/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-04T21:56:04Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-04T21:56:04Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"message":"feat(wc-api): comments REST surface — E20 list + E21 create (§11)\n\nWire the already-built-but-dead Comment entity / repo /\nauthorizeCommentTargetAccess / CommentTargetType / COMMENT surface into a\nreachable GET /api/comments (B.20 paged, createdAt ASC, id ASC) + POST\n/api/comments (flat, depth 0, parent null, 201) serving the 9.11b\nfrontend contract verbatim. The FIRST production caller of\nauthorizeCommentTargetAccess (dead since it was authored).\n\nRule #3 IDOR: the authorizer chokepoint is the first statement on both\npaths (cross-owner/unseeable -> codeless 404 + denial audit; missing ->\n404 no-audit). REQ-F-014: a non-owner manager may comment on a\ndirect-report target only when the owning plan is LOCKED+ -- a manager on\na DRAFT target -> 409 ILLEGAL_STATE_TRANSITION, no audit (uniform on read\n+ write, the 5.6 posture); the owning IC comments in any state.\n\ncreatedAt stamped via the injected Clock (the @CreatedDate is unwired);\nauthorDisplayName batch-resolved (one WHERE id IN); body normalized once,\nstored RAW (S16), never logged/audited; a body-free COMMENT_CREATED audit\n(S15). Unblocks the frontend comments UI on the deployed backend.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ad95b7341eadd8b2694cc34c31d398b74bee470f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/trees/ad95b7341eadd8b2694cc34c31d398b74bee470f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/commits/c62fcce8f5fe9c68c34794c2ac1a3934a741a5ac","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.co