user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commit/3b919a9fec2ec96fc0eaaff1e21b0cd1eab5c65d","node_id":"C_kwDOSxKwgtoAKDNiOTE5YTlmZWMyZWM5NmZjMGVhYWZmMWUyMWIwY2QxZWFiNWM2NWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commit/94257e3dd961e0cd19bbfaf06348d8317497e85b","sha":"94257e3dd961e0cd19bbfaf06348d8317497e85b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/94257e3dd961e0cd19bbfaf06348d8317497e85b"}],"sha":"3b919a9fec2ec96fc0eaaff1e21b0cd1eab5c65d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/3b919a9fec2ec96fc0eaaff1e21b0cd1eab5c65d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/94257e3dd961e0cd19bbfaf06348d8317497e85b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-04T19:35:59Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-04T19:35:59Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"message":"docs(tasks): Wave-2 live-sync COMPLETE + infra deploy-docs — round seal (092→s7→s8→s9)\n\nRound terminal commit for the fresh backend+infra orch round. The deployed-backend\ndemo''s live Outlook-sync pipeline is end-to-end:\n- 092 worker boots DB-less in aws; s7 real SNS gateway; s8 worker SQS consumer\n  (+ datasource re-add); s9 real MS Graph adapter (+ §10 startup fail-safe to\n  safe-FAILED). All ad-hoc security-reviewed clean. Slice commits 9e5a5d9 / 82fd2ab\n  / a9cb841 / becc22a.\n- Cross-doc: wc-api LESSONS §43/§44/§45 (SNS-gateway / SQS-consumer / Graph-adapter\n  patterns) + §9/§42 addenda + index rows; §12 worker-secret scope graph->db+graph\n  (the adfa639 invariant, ARCHITECTURE x3 + infra LESSONS x2); plan 025 Wave-2\n  scoping; briefs 092-095; apps/wc-api/README; orchestrator session doc 021.\n- Decisions: s9 fail-safe = safe-FAILED per the binding ARCHITECTURE D.6 (brief\n  095''s RED#3 wording was the drift, resolved by conforming to the architecture);\n  the §12 worker-secret expansion is justified least-privilege, not a relaxation.\n- Carry-forward triaged: the SNS-gateway item discharged (s7); 3 s9 low TODOs +\n  the worker-DB-least-privilege role added (all non-acceptance-blocking).\n\nBackend build queue EMPTY -> next is the HITL first-deploy / deploy-support QA.\nReference: docs/sessions/021-2026-06-04-backend-wave2-live-sync.md.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cfa29b1c8d81e70a5804b98b9209fef4848aa17c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/trees/cfa29b1c8d81e70a5804b98b9209fef4848aa17c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/commits/94257e3dd961e0cd19bbfaf06348d8317497e85b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commit/94257e3dd961e0cd19bbfaf06348d8317497e85b","node_id":"C_kwDOSxKwgtoAKDk0MjU3ZTNkZDk2MWUwY2QxOWJiZmFmMDYzNDhkODMxNzQ5N2U4NWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commit/becc22a45d449406f10e674c12ca4d083f397ac1","sha":"becc22a45d449406f10e674c12ca4d083f397ac1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/becc22a45d449406f10e674c12ca4d083f397ac1"}],"sha":"94257e3dd961e0cd19bbfaf06348d8317497e85b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/94257e3dd961e0cd19bbfaf06348d8317497e85b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/becc22a45d449406f10e674c12ca4d083f397ac1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-04T19:21:44Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-04T19:21:44Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"message":"feat(wc-api): real MS Graph calendar adapter + §10 fail-safe (Wave-2 s9)\n\nThe real GRAPH_MODE=real GraphCalendarPort behind the s8 seam: app-only\nclient-credentials auth (azure-identity ClientSecretCredential) + a v6\nGraphServiceClient calendar-event create, owner mailbox resolved from\nEmployee.email. A mockable GraphEventGateway seam isolates the lone\nSDK-touching class (no live Graph in tests, LESSONS §43); a non-PII\nCalendarEventSpec keeps Kiota types + PII out of the adapter.\n\n§10/REQ-I-004/REQ-E-007 fail-safe (degrade at startup): real mode with\nany blank GRAPH_* cred wires a DegradedGraphCalendarPort that records a\nsafe failure (clean cause-less GraphCalendarException -> s8 FAILED +\nsafe_message + manual-retry) -- never builds a live client, never\ncrashes the worker, never logs a secret (Appendix D.6). Mutually-\nexclusive vs the s8 demo stub, pinned exactly-one across all modes.\n\nrule #7: GRAPH_* creds + raw Graph errors never logged/persisted/chained.\nCompletes the Wave-2 live Outlook-sync pipeline.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c86bdbfd9bd7f7f055d0b33fd2c3600618b04789","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/trees/c86bdbfd9bd7f7f055d0b33fd2c3600618b04789"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/commits/becc22a45d449406f10e674c12ca4d083f397ac1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commit/becc22a45d449406f10e674c12ca4d083f397ac1","node_id":"C_kwDOSxKwgtoAKGJlY2MyMmE0NWQ0NDk0MDZmMTBlNjc0YzEyY2E0ZDA4M2YzOTdhYzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commit/a9cb841e10d1c73498e1a9d0702f494ce7441bfd","sha":"a9cb841e10d1c73498e1a9d0702f494ce7441bfd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/a9cb841e10d1c73498e1a9d0702f494ce7441bfd"}],"sha":"becc22a45d449406f10e674c12ca4d083f397ac1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/becc22a45d449406f10e674c12ca4d083f397ac1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/a9cb841e10d1c73498e1a9d0702f494ce7441bfd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-04T16:10:33Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-04T16:10:33Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"message":"feat(wc-api): worker SQS consumer + Graph port seam + datasource re-add (Wave-2 s8)\n\nThe wc-sync-worker consumes the wc-sync queue: an @SqsListener deserializes\nthe pointer-only SyncJobPointer, reloads the OutlookCalendarSyncRecord by\nsyncRecordId, and drives the calendar op through a GraphCalendarPort seam\n(a GRAPH_MODE=demo-success stub returning a synthetic graphEventId; the real\nMS Graph adapter is s9, behind the same port — LESSONS §43).\n\nPipeline: idempotent skip when already created in Graph (graphEventId != null,\nat-least-once safe) -> QUEUED->SYNCING (+lastAttemptAt) -> port -> SYNCED\n(+graphEventId +processedAt); on failure -> FAILED (+ a fixed non-PII\nfailureCode/safeMessage + retryCount++) then a sanitized SyncProcessingException\n(ids-only, no cause-chain) -> SQS redrive -> DLQ. Rule #7: only the pointer\ncrosses the wire; the persisted failure fields + logs are non-PII (never the raw\nGraph error); the cause-less rethrow keeps the framework''s redrive logging\nPII-free. No @Transactional wraps the Graph call (each save its own txn).\n\nReverses the 092 JPA exclude — the worker now reads the DB: WcSyncWorkerApplication\ndrops the DataSource/HibernateJpa auto-config exclude; WorkerSharedConfig adds\n@EntityScan(com.st6.wc) + @EnableJpaRepositories(com.st6.wc.sync.repo) (the\nshared entity/repo sit outside the worker''s scan); application-aws.yml gains the\nconfigtree:/mnt/secrets/ datasource import + app.sqs.queue-url (gates the\nlistener, aws-only); base config gains ddl-auto=validate + the §43 region\nfallback + app.graph.mode. The 092 bean-absence boot test inverts to\nbean-presence; both worker boot tests gain a Testcontainers PG harness (real\nPG16, never H2 — §17).\n\nAdds spring-cloud-aws-starter-sqs + spring-boot-starter-data-jpa to the worker\n(reusing the springCloudAws 3.2.x pin from s7). Unblocks s9 (the real Graph\nadapter behind GraphCalendarPort). The SNS->SQS raw-message-delivery + the\nwc-sync->wc-sync-dlq redrive policy + the worker db IRSA/SPC are the paired\ninfra seam (all in place: adfa639 + already-present).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6a552e2f0aa6598920edd556e44abd7274acb6f3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/trees/6a552e2f0aa6598920edd556e44abd7274acb6f3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/commits/a9cb841e10d1c73498e1a9d0702f494ce7441bfd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commit/a9cb841e10d1c73498e1a9d0702f494ce7441bfd","node_id":"C_kwDOSxKwgtoAKGE5Y2I4NDFlMTBkMWM3MzQ5OGUxYTlkMDcwMmY0OTRjZTc0NDFiZmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commit/adfa6397b9e0ac344861bf8dacd8aad8c5c14db5","sha":"adfa6397b9e0ac344861bf8dacd8aad8c5c14db5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/adfa6397b9e0ac344861bf8dacd8aad8c5c14db5"}],"sha":"a9cb841e10d1c73498e1a9d0702f494ce7441bfd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/a9cb841e10d1c73498e1a9d0702f494ce7441bfd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/adfa6397b9e0ac344861bf8dacd8aad8c5c14db5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-04T15:52:28Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-04T15:52:28Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"message":"feat(infra): worker db secret access (IRSA + SPC) for the s8 SQS consumer\n\nThe Wave-2 worker regains its datasource (it reloads OutlookCalendarSyncRecord\nby id), so it needs db-secret read access:\n- iam_irsa.tf: the worker IRSA GetSecretValue widens from graph-only to\n  [db, graph] (Sid ReadWorkerSecrets, mirroring the api''s ReadApiSecrets list).\n  Least-privilege preserved -- db + graph ONLY (NOT auth0/demo, NOT *).\n- secretproviderclass.yaml: the wc-worker-secrets SPC gains the db object (the\n  3 spring.datasource.* keys, byte-copied from wc-api-secrets) so the worker''s\n  configtree:/mnt/secrets/ binds the datasource. No new envsubst token\n  (DB_SECRET_ARN already allowlisted, same rendered file).\n\nConfirmed already-present (no gaps): the DLQ redrive policy (sns_sqs.tf,\nmaxReceiveCount=5) + the api sns:Publish grant. The worker-specific\nleast-privilege DB role is a tracked deferred-hardening item, not this slice.\n\nInfra slice (no red-green): fmt/init-backend=false/validate/tflint rc=0;\nkubeconform 13 valid/0 invalid; worker-SPC db block byte-matches the api;\nworker IRSA scope = db+graph only. Real apply/mount is HITL.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"60ce77ccb3802bc816aba08698594d7a5f1b988f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/trees/60ce77ccb3802bc816aba08698594d7a5f1b988f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/commits/adfa6397b9e0ac344861bf8dacd8aad8c5c14db5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commit/adfa6397b9e0ac344861bf8dacd8aad8c5c14db5","node_id":"C_kwDOSxKwgtoAKGFkZmE2Mzk3YjllMGFjMzQ0ODYxYmY4ZGFjZDhhYWQ4YzVjMTRkYjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commit/82fd2abf426b6ef38b0bb59bf0fbdeca4a5539a1","sha":"82fd2abf426b6ef38b0bb59bf0fbdeca4a5539a1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/82fd2abf426b6ef38b0bb59bf0fbdeca4a5539a1"}],"sha":"adfa6397b9e0ac344861bf8dacd8aad8c5c14db5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/adfa6397b9e0ac344861bf8dacd8aad8c5c14db5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/82fd2abf426b6ef38b0bb59bf0fbdeca4a5539a1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-04T15:40:57Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-04T15:40:57Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"message":"feat(wc-api): real SNS lifecycle gateway — publish the pointer in aws (Wave-2 s7)\n\nReplace the no-op LoggingLifecycleSnsGateway with a real AwsSnsLifecycleGateway\nthat publishes the pointer-only SyncJobPointer to the configured SNS topic\n(spring-cloud-aws SnsOperations.sendNotification -> the wc-api-secrets topic ARN)\nin the deployed aws profile; the logging stub stays for local/demo/test.\n\nBean selection is property-driven + mutually exclusive: the real gateway is\nactive iff app.sns.topic-arn is set, the stub iff it is not (havingValue=false,\nmatchIfMissing=true) — order-independent, unlike @ConditionalOnMissingBean on a\ncomponent. The gateway injects the SnsOperations interface (not the concrete\nSnsTemplate — cleaner DI + avoids SpotBugs EI_EXPOSE_REP2).\n\nSafety: the gateway PROPAGATES on failure (no internal catch) — SnsLifecyclePublisher\nstays the single rule-#4 swallow point (a publish failure leaves the record\nPENDING_PUBLISH, retryable; never blocks/rolls back the committed lock). The\npayload is pointer-only (rule #7) — the SyncJobPointer 4 fields + a fixed non-PII\nsubject, no enrichment. The publisher orchestration (afterCommit + REQUIRES_NEW +\nsingle swallow, built at 3.5) is reused untouched.\n\nAdds the spring-cloud-aws 3.2.x BOM + starter-sns (api/build.gradle +\nlibs.versions.toml). Binds app.sns.topic-arn=${SNS_TOPIC_ARN} + app.env=aws in\napplication-aws.yml (the pointer env field is now correct end-to-end). Adds a\nspring.cloud.aws.region.static fallback in base config so a clean CI runner boots\n(the SNS auto-config needs a resolvable region; aws gets it from AWS_REGION).\n\nDischarges the 3.5 carry-forward (real SNS gateway). Unblocks s8 (the worker SQS\nconsumer reads the published pointer).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2bdf779dd3a08bc44819ed6843a11694d6b9e8dc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/trees/2bdf779dd3a08bc44819ed6843a11694d6b9e8dc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/commits/82fd2abf426b6ef38b0bb59bf0fbdeca4a5539a1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commit/82fd2abf426b6ef38b0bb59bf0fbdeca4a5539a1","node_id":"C_kwDOSxKwgtoAKDgyZmQyYWJmNDI2YjZlZjM4YjBiYjU5YmYwZmJkZWNhNGE1NTM5YTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commit/770bd835ed8220057051f6474a9077c7b111ef28","sha":"770bd835ed8220057051f6474a9077c7b111ef28","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/770bd835ed8220057051f6474a9077c7b111ef28"}],"sha":"82fd2abf426b6ef38b0bb59bf0fbdeca4a5539a1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/82fd2abf426b6ef38b0bb59bf0fbdeca4a5539a1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/770bd835ed8220057051f6474a9077c7b111ef28/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-04T15:35:35Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-04T15:35:35Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"message":"docs(runbooks): concretize the deploy repo to SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit\n\nThe user created the GitHub deploy repo; runbook (b) Step 0 + the OIDC trust\nsubject + TF_VAR_github_repo + the gh Environment/variable commands now name\nSiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit verbatim (0 <owner>/<repo> placeholders left). The\nother user-specific values (ROOT_DOMAIN, account/region, tenant/client-id, the\nstate bucket/lock-table names) stay placeholders.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3981c91b95f864a3a9c6b2fd1ae11d7d11fc222a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/trees/3981c91b95f864a3a9c6b2fd1ae11d7d11fc222a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/commits/770bd835ed8220057051f6474a9077c7b111ef28","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commit/770bd835ed8220057051f6474a9077c7b111ef28","node_id":"C_kwDOSxKwgtoAKDc3MGJkODM1ZWQ4MjIwMDU3MDUxZjY0NzRhOTA3N2M3YjExMWVmMjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commit/302079d35b5f462f213cfed1abd4130a9ba84a78","sha":"302079d35b5f462f213cfed1abd4130a9ba84a78","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/302079d35b5f462f213cfed1abd4130a9ba84a78"}],"sha":"770bd835ed8220057051f6474a9077c7b111ef28","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/770bd835ed8220057051f6474a9077c7b111ef28"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/302079d35b5f462f213cfed1abd4130a9ba84a78/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-04T15:32:19Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-04T15:32:19Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"message":"docs: finalize deploy runbooks (a/b/c) + remote/push posture\n\nCodify the user-finalized remote topology: origin = gitlab (submission/code\nremote, user-pushed) + a separate github remote driving the deploy CI (GitHub\nActions, release-tag / workflow_dispatch). Pushes are USER-controlled —\nteammates commit locally and never auto-push (root CLAUDE.md + the orchestrator\nbriefing).\n\nRunbooks (the irreducible-HITL deploy set):\n- (a) auth0-tenant-setup: full external-tenant setup (Auth0 + M365/Entra Graph);\n  dual-scope H1; the §1.2 Domain/Client-ID -> AUTH0_* GitHub vars -> VITE_AUTH0_*\n  SPA build env + the apps/wc-web/README \"Deploying to AWS\" cross-link.\n- (b) fresh-aws-account-to-deploy-ready: bootstrap -> OIDC -> state -> domain ->\n  GitHub production Environment (7 vars incl. the 2 AUTH0_*). Step 0 adds the\n  github-remote sequence (add github remote, keep origin=gitlab; <owner>/<repo>\n  threads TF_VAR_github_repo -> the OIDC trust subject, parameterized in\n  iam_ci.tf -> no TF code edit; deploy triggers on release-tag/workflow_dispatch).\n- (c) deploy-and-smoke: run the pipeline + populate secrets + smoke.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bbcb5674480b7c11e82e789772b365c585463f20","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/trees/bbcb5674480b7c11e82e789772b365c585463f20"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/commits/302079d35b5f462f213cfed1abd4130a9ba84a78","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users