SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/dc445442d0b3d71b6ff9c94cbd0250f3cbb7e5e7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-04T15:06:41Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-04T15:06:41Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"message":"fix(ci): inject VITE_AUTH0_* into the wc-web build step\n\nThe deployed auth0-mode SPA build supplied only VITE_AUTH_MODE +\nVITE_API_BASE_URL, but standalone/auth0Config.ts requireVar-fails on\nVITE_AUTH0_DOMAIN/CLIENT_ID/AUDIENCE — so the deployed login never\nbooted. Inject all three (DOMAIN/CLIENT_ID from new GitHub vars,\nAUDIENCE derived from ROOT_DOMAIN), matching the existing\nVITE_API_BASE_URL-from-vars pattern.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5e2fc312ebbbf09a7404a38196a21a073427d5a4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/trees/5e2fc312ebbbf09a7404a38196a21a073427d5a4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/commits/dc445442d0b3d71b6ff9c94cbd0250f3cbb7e5e7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/use