 OAuth flow + env + runbook\n  cross-links); anti-drift host-integration.test green\n- ARCHITECTURE §7 \"Realized (9.16/9.17)\" note (dual identity providers feed one\n  accessor seam; REQ-I-008 now asserts auth0-SDK-absence in the exposed remote)\n- brief 085 + the orchestrator-authored session doc 020 (impl retired without\n  /session-end)\n\nNo cross-doc invariant change. Sealed on top of backend round 8984d26 (disjoint\nfrontend regions). Reference: docs/sessions/020-2026-06-04-frontend-deploy-demo-oauth.md.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2ce8606c5e1c5679d34341e6607da7a4532334dd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/trees/2ce8606c5e1c5679d34341e6607da7a4532334dd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/commits/e54ee567555ff61a05d3e6c8e8ffb8de65f7b3ad","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-c