e for the deploy-demo Wave-1 (7 backend+infra slices): V5 demo\npersona seed + OAuth external_subject in db/demo-seed (65cc255), 12.12\nterraform-bootstrap cold-start root (aef32bf), V6 fixture state matrix source-\nonly (101ee1d), 12.13 populate-secrets.sh no-leak helper (48a9fec), 090\ndatasource configtree + the application-prod->application-aws profile-bug fix\n(6870a4f), 12.14 rebuild-projections Job + generation-cronjob web-type=none fix\n(9004def), 091 wc-api+worker Dockerfiles (bee7626). The deployed-backend demo\n(real Auth0/OAuth on EKS+RDS) is Wave-1 code-complete; first apply+deploy is\nHITL-gated.\n\nReconciled: ARCHITECTURE (Appendix-E external_subject + db/demo-seed split +\nprojections rebuild-on-deploy + the D.2 file:->configtree: reconciliation),\nMVP_TASKS (Phase-10 ticks + the Phase-12 deploy-demo extension 12.12-12.14 +\nbackend deploy-config section + the deploy-demo Currently-in-progress + Log\nentry), LESSONS (wc-api 41/42, infra 20/21/22), briefs 086-091, planning 025.\n\nFindings: the aws-profile bug (fixed 090) + the generation-cronjob hang (fixed\n12.14) caught + fixed; 13.3 actuator corrected to satisfied-by-prior; the\nworker-boot crashloop -> handed to the fresh orch as 092.\n\nOrch-only cycle at ~65% (implementers persist + hold). Handoff:\n015-2026-06-04-st6-main-backend-orch-cycle-wave1-complete.md. Next: 092\nworker-boot fix + the Wave-2 live-sync pipeline + infra runbooks/READMEs.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6a395065ba1d667e3de4cf4c72d6aebe63c06a08","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/trees/6a395065ba1d667e3de4cf4c72d6aebe63c06a08"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/commits/8984d260d2412b0ddd100609ba2aa59a6a5a7031","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_