"organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/bee76267437f8d137a8ba6ef2fee4d22e62dc1ba/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-04T14:36:50Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-04T14:36:50Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"message":"build(wc-api): multi-stage Dockerfiles for the wc-api + wc-sync-worker images (Wave-1 s4)\n\nAdd the two container images the deploy pipeline + k8s manifests reference\nbut that didn''t exist — the standing build blocker. apps/wc-api/Dockerfile\nbuilds :api:bootJar into the single wc-api image (reused by the api\nDeployment + migration Job + generation CronJob + rebuild Job via\nprofile/arg — forbidden-#5; entrypoint is a bare java -jar, env from the\nmanifests). apps/wc-api/worker/Dockerfile builds :worker:bootJar into the\nwc-sync-worker image.\n\nBoth are multi-stage (eclipse-temurin:21-jdk-jammy build -> 21-jre-jammy\nruntime), run as a non-root app user, EXPOSE 8080, and bake in no profile\nor secret (rule #7 — the manifests set env + the CSI mount). The build runs\ninside the image (deploy.yml does a standalone docker build with the repo\nroot as context); it selects the non-plain Spring Boot bootJar. A repo-root\n.dockerignore trims the context to backend source.\n\nVerified: both images build clean and boot to Spring config-loading (then\nfail at datasource without a mount — expected; proves the jar + entrypoint).\nUnblocks the deploy.yml image build -> push -> the first deploy.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d55be6e66986725228d9fd4f025991a984f022be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/trees/d55be6e66986725228d9fd4f025991a984f022be"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/commits/bee76267437f8d137a8ba6ef2fee4d22e62dc1ba","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commit/bee76267437f8d137a8ba6ef2fee4d22e62dc1ba","node_id":"C_kwDOSxKwgtoAKGJlZTc2MjY3NDM3ZjhkMTM3YThiYTZlZjJmZWU0ZDIyZTYyZGMxYmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commit/9004deffb8eec5d74b6ab57175420b04ba909086","sha":"9004deffb8eec5d74b6ab57175420b04ba909086","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/9004deffb8eec5d74b6ab57175420b04ba909086"}],"sha":"bee76267437f8d137a8ba6ef2fee4d22e62dc1ba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/bee76267437f8d137a8ba6ef2fee4d22e62dc1ba"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/9004deffb8eec5d74b6ab57175420b04ba909086/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-04T14:29:52Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-04T14:29:52Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"message":"feat(infra): rebuild-projections Job + deploy step; fix generation-cronjob exit (12.14)\n\nA one-shot Job + deploy.yml step that populates the manager read-model\nprojections (manager_plan_summary / manager_heatmap_cell) from the V6-seeded\nsource on deploy — so the command-center/heatmap show data on first load (the\n10.6 reframe: rebuild-on-deploy, not hand-seeded literals).\n\n- infra/k8s/job-rebuild-projections.yaml — reuses the wc-api image with\n  --app.job=rebuild-projections (the 6.7 ProjectionRebuildRunner; idempotent\n  truncate-then-recompute), SPRING_PROFILES_ACTIVE=aws, SPRING_FLYWAY_ENABLED=\n  false (forbidden-#3), db-only wc-cronjob SA + wc-cronjob-secrets SPC. One-shot\n  exit via --spring.main.web-application-type=none (the runner does not self-\n  exit) + activeDeadlineSeconds backstop; Never / backoffLimit 2.\n- deploy.yml — new step after the migration wait-gate, before the Deployment\n  roll (migrate seeds source -> rebuild populates -> roll; unreachable out-of-\n  order). Same delete-before-apply (immutable Job template) + fail-fast poll as\n  the migration step; a non-complete rebuild fails the deploy. Added the manifest\n  to the allowlisted-envsubst render list (no new token — reuses ECR_API_IMAGE +\n  AWS_REGION).\n- fix(cronjob-generation): add the same --spring.main.web-application-type=none\n  (+ activeDeadlineSeconds) — it was missing, so its Jobs would start a web\n  server and never terminate (no application-generation.yml sets web-type=none).\n  Same runner-job termination contract as the rebuild Job.\n\nInfra slice (no red-green): kubeconform -strict (manifests + full tree) +\nactionlint rc=0; migrate->rebuild->roll ordering + single-Flyway-owner +\nno-third-image + no-new-token audits green. Real apply/pipeline is HITL\n(runbook c). Read-model population — no request-path/secret surface.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d12858b0a91e4d478e284fa03c34a42120d501ba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/trees/d12858b0a91e4d478e284fa03c34a42120d501ba"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/commits/9004deffb8eec5d74b6ab57175420b04ba909086","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commit/9004deffb8eec5d74b6ab57175420b04ba909086","node_id":"C_kwDOSxKwgtoAKDkwMDRkZWZmYjhlZWM1ZDc0YjZhYjU3MTc1NDIwYjA0YmE5MDkwODY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commit/6870a4fa47a275a6146b0794e9600228a069d400","sha":"6870a4fa47a275a6146b0794e9600228a069d400","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/6870a4fa47a275a6146b0794e9600228a069d400"}],"sha":"9004deffb8eec5d74b6ab57175420b04ba909086","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/9004deffb8eec5d74b6ab57175420b04ba909086"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/6870a4fa47a275a6146b0794e9600228a069d400/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-04T14:17:58Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-04T14:17:58Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"message":"fix(wc-api): load deploy config under the aws profile + wire the RDS datasource (Wave-1 s3)\n\nEvery k8s workload runs SPRING_PROFILES_ACTIVE=aws, but the deploy config\nlived in application-prod.yml (profile prod) — so it never loaded on the\ndeployed stack (the api booted with a blank auth0.audience + no datasource).\nRename application-prod.yml -> application-aws.yml so it loads under the\nprofile the workloads actually use.\n\nWire the datasource for the deployed api: spring.config.import=optional:\nconfigtree:/mnt/secrets/ binds spring.datasource.{url,username,password}\n(+ the auth0 issuer-uri/audience) directly from the wc-api-secrets CSI mount\n(each key mounted as a file named by the property key); HikariDataSource\nauto-configures (pool size 10). ddl-auto=validate — the migration Job owns\nthe schema; the app fails fast on entity-schema drift. optional: keeps\nlocal/demo (no mount) booting. The auth0.audience literal stays a sane\ndefault that the mount overrides via configtree precedence.\n\nUnblocks the deployed api booting against RDS. Sibling prerequisite (not\nthis slice): actuator liveness/readiness probes (13.3).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"62a1ad05e07ae6437de5de1b1a1d7998dd34759b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/trees/62a1ad05e07ae6437de5de1b1a1d7998dd34759b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/commits/6870a4fa47a275a6146b0794e9600228a069d400","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commit/6870a4fa47a275a6146b0794e9600228a069d400","node_id":"C_kwDOSxKwgtoAKDY4NzBhNGZhNDdhMjc1YTYxNDZiMDc5NGU5NjAwMjI4YTA2OWQ0MDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commit/48a9fec69c488db25fe89a09083a4c2585d10437","sha":"48a9fec69c488db25fe89a09083a4c2585d10437","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/48a9fec69c488db25fe89a09083a4c2585d10437"}],"sha":"6870a4fa47a275a6146b0794e9600228a069d400","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/6870a4fa47a275a6146b0794e9600228a069d400"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/48a9fec69c488db25fe89a09083a4c2585d10437/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-04T14:11:47Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-04T14:11:47Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"message":"feat(infra): populate-secrets.sh — no-leak Auth0+Graph secret-population helper (12.13)\n\nThe post-`terraform apply` HITL fill-in-the-blanks: writes operator-supplied\nAuth0 + MS Graph credential VALUES into the TF-created Secrets Manager\nplaceholder containers (wc/<env>/{auth0,graph}); db is TF-populated and demo is\na prod no-op, both skipped.\n\nrule #7 (secrets never leak) — no value ever touches argv, disk, or a log:\n- JSON built by `jq -n` reading env.X (NOT --arg → secret stays out of jq''s\n  argv), piped to `aws put-secret-value --secret-string file:///dev/stdin`\n  (stdin; no temp file). mktemp+chmod600+trap-shred is the portable fallback.\n- GRAPH_CLIENT_SECRET via `read -s` (the only true secret; the 4 OAuth/tenant\n  values are public, visible read); success signal = VersionId/ARN only.\n- env-or-prompt input (never a values file / CLI arg); `--dry-run` redacts to\n  *** with zero AWS calls; `--only auth0|graph` + skip-absent for the two-wave\n  rollout; jq+aws + describe-secret preflights.\n\nInfra slice (no red-green): shellcheck rc=0; --dry-run/--help need no creds;\ngrep self-audit (no set -x, no value echo, no secret in argv, no-leak path\npresent). Real put-secret-value is HITL (runbook c).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c62dc2d8e78ddc4b975a7dc8ceffc4afaf177e17","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/trees/c62dc2d8e78ddc4b975a7dc8ceffc4afaf177e17"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/commits/48a9fec69c488db25fe89a09083a4c2585d10437","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commit/48a9fec69c488db25fe89a09083a4c2585d10437","node_id":"C_kwDOSxKwgtoAKDQ4YTlmZWM2OWM0ODhkYjI1ZmU4OWEwOTA4M2E0YzI1ODVkMTA0Mzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commit/101ee1d9f1b86d602a1e72c9fb63664218b9a6a4","sha":"101ee1d9f1b86d602a1e72c9fb63664218b9a6a4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/101ee1d9f1b86d602a1e72c9fb63664218b9a6a4"}],"sha":"48a9fec69c488db25fe89a09083a4c2585d10437","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/48a9fec69c488db25fe89a09083a4c2585d10437"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/101ee1d9f1b86d602a1e72c9fb63664218b9a6a4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-04T14:00:25Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-04T14:00:25Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"message":"feat(wc-api): V6 demo fixture plans + lifecycle state matrix (10.3-10.5)\n\nSeed the deterministic SOURCE fixtures for the demo''s lifecycle-state\nmatrix — one plan per persona across every state (R1-R4 LOCKED, R5\nRECONCILING + a prior-week RECONCILED carry-forward source, R6 DRAFT,\nDana prior-week RECONCILED), their commitments (linked + R6''s deliberately\nunlinked), Dana-as-manager reviews, R3''s OPEN MISALIGNED dispute + R4''s\nfully-RESOLVED dispute, the R5 two-week carry-forward chain, and the\nFAILED / SYNCED / MANAGER_REVIEW_BLOCK Outlook sync records — in\ndb/demo-seed/V6 (rides V5''s migrate-profile locations; no yml change).\n\nReviews store what the lifecycle services produce, so the derived reads\nmatch the matrix: R3 stores REVIEWED_WITH_DISPUTES (the deriver''s stored\nstatus given an open dispute), R4/R5 REVIEWED, R1/R2 NOT_REVIEWED. OVERDUE\nis never stored (rule #6) — R2 stores NOT_REVIEWED + a past review_due_at\nso the read-time isReviewOverdue predicate yields OVERDUE at the demo Clock\nanchor (2026-06-02 morning CT).\n\nNo projection rows are hand-seeded — manager_plan_summary /\nmanager_heatmap_cell populate on deploy via the rebuild Job (truncate +\nrecompute from source, §9/§17). Fixed UUID literals (per-entity hex prefix),\nON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING (idempotent), parent-first insert (the\ncarry-forward source precedes its referrer).\n\nUnblocks the deployed demo''s manager surface (after the rebuild Job) + the\ntest-track persona-UUID reconciliation.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"13b7fcac958f7a997ca3a1537f6f343e823f1162","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/trees/13b7fcac958f7a997ca3a1537f6f343e823f1162"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/commits/101ee1d9f1b86d602a1e72c9fb63664218b9a6a4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commit/101ee1d9f1b86d602a1e72c9fb63664218b9a6a4","node_id":"C_kwDOSxKwgtoAKDEwMWVlMWQ5ZjFiODZkNjAyYTFlNzJjOWZiNjM2NjQyMThiOWE2YTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commit/aef32bf4ce20510b49e63ef169985bb12c344614","sha":"aef32bf4ce20510b49e63ef169985bb12c344614","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/aef32bf4ce20510b49e63ef169985bb12c344614"}],"sha":"101ee1d9f1b86d602a1e72c9fb63664218b9a6a4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/101ee1d9f1b86d602a1e72c9fb63664218b9a6a4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/aef32bf4ce20510b49e63ef169985bb12c344614/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-04T13:28:18Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-04T13:28:18Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"message":"feat(infra): terraform-bootstrap cold-start root — TF state bucket + DynamoDB lock (12.12)\n\nResolves the backend.tf chicken-and-egg: a standalone sibling TF root that\nprovisions the two resources the main root''s S3 backend assumes already exist,\nso a fresh AWS account can `terraform init` infra/terraform.\n\n- S3 state bucket: wc-${env}-tfstate-${account_id} (deterministic/idempotent),\n  versioning Enabled + AES256 SSE + public-access-block (4x) + force_destroy=false\n- DynamoDB lock table: LockID/S, PAY_PER_REQUEST (the S3-backend lock contract)\n- prevent_destroy on both (the state store is fail-closed against accidental destroy)\n- local backend (gitignored state); outputs incl. a paste-ready backend_config_hint\n- backend.tf: comment pointer to terraform-bootstrap (inert)\n\nInfra slice (no red-green): fmt/init-backend=false/validate/tflint rc=0 on the\nmini-root; main-root validate+tflint green (comment inert). Real init/apply is\nHITL (runbook b). rule #7: outputs are non-secret names; bucket encrypted at rest.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e14bcff9fbb2838c255a303156a770357c8a203e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/trees/e14bcff9fbb2838c255a303156a770