"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/531000d274438285ea91807a6c115f28ca01c1be/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-04T13:27:03Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-04T13:27:03Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"message":"feat(wc-web): Auth0 OAuth login for the deployed real-backend demo (9.17)\n\nAdd the standalone-only Auth0 PKCE SPA login producer so the deployed demo\nauthenticates against real OAuth (not the demo-auth header):\n- Auth0IdentityProvider (mirrors DemoIdentityProvider): <Auth0Provider>\n  (WithNavigate) + a child that feeds getAccessTokenSilently into the existing\n  setAccessTokenProvider seam (prepareHeaders'' auth0 Bearer-send then just works)\n  and resets the RTK cache on user.sub change (§16). The seam is wired\n  synchronously (useState init) BEFORE WeeklyCommitApp reads hasAccessTokenProvider().\n- Auth0LoginGate (loading -> branded LoginScreen -> app) on /*; CallbackRoute on\n  /callback renders OUTSIDE the gate so the SDK code-exchange isn''t shadowed (a\n  standalone <Routes> in StandaloneShell, NOT remote AppRoutes -> REQ-I-008).\n- Auth0IdentitySlot (\"signed in as X\" + logout) injected into AppBar via a new\n  identitySlot prop (PersonaSwitcher retired in auth0 mode); AppShell forwards it.\n- auth0Config: fail-fast resolver over VITE_AUTH0_* (audience required) +\n  vite-env.d.ts types + the .env.example contract block.\n- StandaloneShell branches on VITE_AUTH_MODE (the demo/MSW path unchanged).\n\n310 Vitest green (16 new); typecheck + lint clean. REQ-I-008 holds: the auth0 SDK\nis standalone-only - boundary.test.ts extended (fail-closed) + the federation-\nexposed remote chunk build-verified auth0-free. Auth-mode-agnostic; the Auth0\ntenant setup is the HITL runbook.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f89e10fa4e6106a0e3e78cd684a667f027faf194","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/trees/f89e10fa4e6106a0e3e78cd684a667f027faf194"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/commits/531000d274438285ea91807a6c115f28ca01c1be","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commit/531000d274438285ea91807a6c115f28ca01c1be","node_id":"C_kwDOSxKwgtoAKDUzMTAwMGQyNzQ0MzgyODVlYTkxODA3YTZjMTE1ZjI4Y2EwMWMxYmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commit/65cc255d5262c67992ef98811ae8cf62516f1a9d","sha":"65cc255d5262c67992ef98811ae8cf62516f1a9d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/65cc255d5262c67992ef98811ae8cf62516f1a9d"}],"sha":"531000d274438285ea91807a6c115f28ca01c1be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/531000d274438285ea91807a6c115f28ca01c1be"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/65cc255d5262c67992ef98811ae8cf62516f1a9d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-04T13:15:48Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-04T13:15:48Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"message":"feat(wc-api): V5 demo persona seed + OAuth external_subject mapping (10.2)\n\nSeed the deterministic demo dataset — Dana Okafor (MANAGER) + 6 IC direct\nreports + 6 active (Dana→report) manager_relationships — as a Flyway\nmigration in a dedicated classpath:db/demo-seed location. Each employee\ncarries a deterministic app-owned external_subject literal (st6|<first>-<last>)\nso a real Auth0 JWT resolves to a seeded persona via\nPrincipalResolver.resolve(Auth0Identity) -> findByExternalSubject; the\ndeployed demo uses real OAuth, not the X-Demo-Employee-Id header.\n\nThe demo seed lives outside db/migration so the deploy migration Job\n(flyway-migrate profile, now loading both locations) seeds it while the\nshared integration-test harness — re-enabling Flyway on the default\ndb/migration only — never does; the read-only V4 RCDO reference seed stays\nin db/migration (tests depend on it). Fixed UUID literals, 2026-06-02\nanchor, ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING (idempotent), parent-first insert.\n\nUnblocks V6 (fixture plans/state) + the deployed demo. external_subject\nuniqueness is seed-distinct for MVP (a unique index is a deferred follow-up).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"09aee225f840e31caf51e0d4e383243484a803bc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/trees/09aee225f840e31caf51e0d4e383243484a803bc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/commits/65cc255d5262c67992ef98811ae8cf62516f1a9d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https: