Warlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/1c04e3c3d64bec7e13f0dc490d542a18edeb15b9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-04T12:38:42Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-04T12:38:42Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"message":"build(wc-web): standalone static-SPA build target (deployable demo artifact)\n\nAdd a build:standalone mode so the demo app builds as a deployable static SPA\n(index.html + hashed assets), distinct from the production Module Federation\nremote:\n- vite.buildTarget.ts: a pure env-injected resolver (resolveBuildTarget /\n  shouldEnableFederation(process.env)) gating the federation plugin in\n  vite.config.ts. Fail-safe-to-remote: only VITE_BUILD_TARGET=standalone opts\n  out; any unknown/unset value keeps the production remote (federation ON).\n- package.json: build = build:remote (unchanged remote default) + build:standalone\n  (VITE_BUILD_TARGET=standalone vite build → index.html SPA, no remoteEntry).\n- .env.example: VITE_USE_MOCKS + a standalone/real-backend build env block\n  (VITE_AUTH_MODE / VITE_USE_MOCKS=false / VITE_API_BASE_URL; one-build-per-URL).\n\n294 Vitest green; typecheck + lint clean; REQ-I-008 boundary.test.ts green (the\nremote artifact stays demo-free). Build-verified both targets. Auth-mode-agnostic\n— the real-OAuth login wiring is a separate follow-on.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ae6bf94b3bda3015ff8f96d7003309b14884d844","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/trees/ae6bf94b3bda3015ff8f96d7003309b14884d844"},"url":"https://api.g