ebuild + the plan-read affordance).\n\nReconciled: drained the MARK_REVIEWED carry-forward (resolved 6.8); appended\nthe 6.8 close-out Log entry; apps/wc-api/CLAUDE.md B.7 ManagerReviewDto-row\ncaveat-resolved note. No LESSONS/ARCHITECTURE (textbook §35+§31; B.7 fields\npre-exist).\n\nBackend impl closed out at 74% WARN (queue empty): /session-end skipped (the\n016/017 confabulation-edge precedent), impl retired, continuity captured in the\norchestrator session doc 019 (the full 6.5a-2 -> 6.8 arc). Backend PAUSES\npending user prioritization (the §9-summary field / V5-V6 Phase-10 seed / the\nweb-orch''s incoming B.11 follow-ups). Push deferred (no remote configured).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"76fb1b16bf690778091f1c1d02927908c042661f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/trees/76fb1b16bf690778091f1c1d02927908c042661f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/commits/5b3bbcf36a9793d53f7e0d7ce47c5ab146b99cce","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarloc