email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"message":"feat(plan): MARK_REVIEWED plan-read affordance + real unresolvedDisputeCount (6.8)\n\nClose the two manager plan-read (E3/E4) gaps, reusing PlanMapper machinery\n(no new query/authz/endpoint):\n\n- Emit MARK_REVIEWED on ManagerReviewDto.allowedActions iff the viewer is the\n  plan owner''s active direct manager AND the review is NOT_REVIEWED — a §31\n  UX-narrowed subset of E16''s enforcement (markReviewed authorizes\n  manager-of-owner + guards != DRAFT; the affordance hides the button once\n  reviewed). The predicate is AllowedActionResolver.canMarkReviewed (mirrors —\n  never calls — authorizeReviewMutation, §24/§31).\n- Replace the hardcoded unresolvedDisputeCount=0 with the count derived from the\n  already-loaded nested disputes (OPEN/IC_RESPONDED, 5.3b) — no extra query, no\n  N+1 (§35); parity with the §9 projection unresolved_dispute_count.\n\n§35 leak guard: the IC owner (and any non-direct-manager) sees empty\nallowedActions — the 4 PlanMapper callers traced (lifecycle responses pass the\nowning IC → viewerIsDirectManager=false → no leak). Closes the last open\nPhase-6 manager-read carry-forward (origin: 5.2).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f8745784e341be71bd797080cd34ded033f1be13","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/trees/f8745784e341be71bd797080cd34ded033f1be13"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/commits/fea91b2c7bbb5b285bece97bcac7b49ab3ae20af","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.