":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/6ec8c8aed641f78947c19817e4b578feb1d53447/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-04T08:39:22Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-04T08:39:22Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"message":"docs(tasks): Phase 6 COMPLETE — manager reads (E13/E14/E15) + IDOR matrix + projection rebuild\n\nRound close-out for the Phase-6 manager-projection arc (4 backend slices,\nall ./gradlew check green; same impl, no cycle):\n- 6.5a-2 (2ba8283) E13 cross-table EXISTS filters\n- 6.5b  (cce700e) E14 heatmap + E15 own-cell drilldown\n- 6.6   (827538f) §6/§17 endpoint-level IDOR matrix completion (REQ-F-030)\n- 6.7   (ebb4d46) ProjectionRebuildRunner (REQ-D-013, rebuild==incremental)\n\nThe §9 manager-projection story is end-to-end (9 synchronous triggers + a\nfrom-source drift-correcting rebuild, one derivation); the E13/E14/E15 read\nsurface is built, IDOR-complete, and B.11/B.12 zero-drift with the frontend.\n6.5a-2/6.5b/6.6 each got an ad-hoc security-reviewer CLEAN PASS.\n\nReconciled: ticked 6.5-6.7 + the Phase-6 acceptance criteria; appended the\nround Log entry; ARCHITECTURE F.5 (E15 id tiebreaker); LESSONS §38-addendum\n(denial-endpoint audit-teardown) + §40 (rebuild-job pattern + corrupt-then-\nrebuild test teeth); apps/wc-api/CLAUDE.md B.12 heatmap-DTO row + §6/§17 +\n§9-complete notes + the 6.5a-2 filter row. Carry-forward triage: 6.5a-2\nresolved; rebuild==seed added (pends V5/V6, Phase 10); MARK_REVIEWED plan-read\nkept as the next backend slice. Briefs 073-076.\n\nrebuild==seed (Appendix-E R1-R6) deferred to the HELD V5/V6 demo seed (Phase\n10). Impl not cycled (64%, continues onto the plan-read slice). Push deferred\n(no remote configured).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9d3c32667605712438e989040f80e3a9538036ed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/trees/9d3c32667605712438e989040f80e3a9538036ed"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/commits/6ec8c8aed641f78947c19817e4b578feb1d53447","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commit/6ec8c8aed641f78947c19817e4b578feb1d53447","node_id":"C_kwDOSxKwgtoAKDZlYzhjOGFlZDY0MWY3ODk0N2MxOTgxN2U0YjU3OGZlYjFkNTM0NDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commit/92160506ba7f9e4ea33d4c2ff963cacb45b87fc3","sha":"92160506ba7f9e4ea33d4c2ff963cacb45b87fc3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/92160506ba7f9e4ea33d4c2ff963cacb45b87fc3"}],"sha":"6ec8c8aed641f78947c19817e4b578feb1d53447","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/6ec8c8aed641f78947c19817e4b578feb1d53447"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/92160506ba7f9e4ea33d4c2ff963cacb45b87fc3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-04T08:34:29Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-04T08:34:29Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"message":"feat(wc-web): IC page + commitment-card fidelity — header card, gold reconcile, description, chips-above-SO\n\nBring the IC \"My Weekly Commit\" page + commitment card to mockup fidelity (doc\n024 section C, render-only): the page title \"My Weekly Commit\"; PlanLifecycleBar\nreframed into a bordered plan-header card (top row: friendly week label + plan\nstatus pill + \"N planned · M unplanned\" + manager-review badge + owner avatar;\nbottom row: the 4-node stepper with done-checks + the primary actions). The\nStart-reconciliation button is GOLD (the warning tone token, not brand blue) and\nClose-week is success-toned, both still gated on the server allowedActions\n(LESSONS-11, no client re-derivation); \"Add unplanned\" sits left of the\ngold/success primary (canon order). The commitment card renders the existing\ndescription field as a plain React-escaped line below the title, with the chess\nchips moved above the RcdoBreadcrumb SO box (canon order), and the SO/objective\ntext is no longer monospace. Section captions added.\n\nThis moves the canonical plan status pill INTO the header card (the mockup''s\nplan-head top row), reversing the ST.7c in-bar-badge drop — NOT a regression: the\npill lives in the card now, not duplicated in the page header.\n\nRenders the existing B.5/B.6 contracts verbatim — no contract change. Pixel\nfidelity vs the mockup is the ST.8d gate.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7c0fc99ce2d0ffdfcfab599968509e8f2ca35860","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/trees/7c0fc99ce2d0ffdfcfab599968509e8f2ca35860"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/commits/92160506ba7f9e4ea33d4c2ff963cacb45b87fc3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commit/92160506ba7f9e4ea33d4c2ff963cacb45b87fc3","node_id":"C_kwDOSxKwgtoAKDkyMTYwNTA2YmE3ZjllNGVhMzNkNGMyZmY5NjNjYWNiNDViODdmYzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commit/ebb4d461ab3dc8061df341e9c7dcb08b25e9b68f","sha":"ebb4d461ab3dc8061df341e9c7dcb08b25e9b68f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/ebb4d461ab3dc8061df341e9c7dcb08b25e9b68f"}],"sha":"92160506ba7f9e4ea33d4c2ff963cacb45b87fc3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/92160506ba7f9e4ea33d4c2ff963cacb45b87fc3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/ebb4d461ab3dc8061df341e9c7dcb08b25e9b68f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-04T08:20:34Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-04T08:20:34Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"message":"feat(projection): from-source rebuild job — ProjectionRebuildRunner (6.7)\n\nAdd the internal one-shot --app.job=rebuild-projections runner (REQ-D-013):\nProjectionRebuilder truncates both manager projection tables and recomputes\nthem from source for every plan via the SAME ProjectionRefresher.recomputeForPlan\nthe 9 synchronous triggers use — so rebuild == incremental, and drift/orphan\ncells are corrected. One @Transactional run (no half-rebuilt read), the §28\nunmanaged/unreviewed skip, and one SYSTEM null-actor audit row per run.\n\nThe runner is a thin @ConditionalOnProperty(app.job=rebuild-projections)\nApplicationRunner mirroring PlanShellGenerationRunner (web-application-type=none\nexit, holds no context). Proven: corrupt-then-rebuild restores the\ncorrect-from-source state, orphan cells pruned, idempotent, SYSTEM-audited;\ngating via ApplicationContextRunner.\n\nrebuild==seed (Appendix-E R1–R6) is deferred to the HELD V5/V6 demo seed\n(Phase 10/11). Completes the Phase-6 §9 projection story.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"688190acf33f151639615e1390a259d5377cf58f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/trees/688190acf33f151639615e1390a259d5377cf58f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/commits/ebb4d461ab3dc8061df341e9c7dcb08b25e9b68f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commit/ebb4d461ab3dc8061df341e9c7dcb08b25e9b68f","node_id":"C_kwDOSxKwgtoAKGViYjRkNDYxYWIzZGM4MDYxZGYzNDFlOWM3ZGNiMDhiMjVlOWI2OGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commit/19303401c5860ad760e763ca640e8a7623b172e4","sha":"19303401c5860ad760e763ca640e8a7623b172e4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/19303401c5860ad760e763ca640e8a7623b172e4"}],"sha":"ebb4d461ab3dc8061df341e9c7dcb08b25e9b68f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/ebb4d461ab3dc8061df341e9c7dcb08b25e9b68f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/19303401c5860ad760e763ca640e8a7623b172e4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-04T08:15:58Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-04T08:15:58Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"message":"feat(wc-web): command-center filter rebuild — compact dropdown-chip row\n\nRebuild the command-center filter UI (doc 024 section B.2, presentation-only)\nfrom the 2-row labeled-select grid into the mockup''s compact dropdown-chip row:\na Filters label + a hand-rolled token-native FilterDropdown per filter (the\nST.8a PersonaSwitcher precedent), removable active-filter chips, Clear-all, and\na \"Showing N of M reports\" count (N=returned, M=page.totalElements). The Person\n+ Defining-objective dropdowns source options from the loaded reports + the\nexisting RCDO read; the rest are enum filters labeled via statusTaxonomy. The\nin-filter week-of control is dropped (the week affordance is the app-bar +\nST.8b pager). The filter param plumbing is preserved verbatim — same E13 query,\nno contract change. The 6-vs-7 (mockup omits Alignment status) is an ST.8d\ncanon-vs-functionality call; kept functional now. Pixel fidelity is the ST.8d gate.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f4e8bde4801c24b4096d2ba2eec153637652a2e1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/trees/f4e8bde4801c24b4096d2ba2eec153637652a2e1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/commits/19303401c5860ad760e763ca640e8a7623b172e4","verification":{"payload":null,"reaso