ew/Open action, and the \"Alignment Command\nCenter\" title/copy. Renders the existing B.11/B.20 contracts verbatim — no\ncontract change. The filter dropdown-chip rebuild is split to ST.8b-2;\nresolved/unlinked chips + reviewed-time sub-line + the production summary field\nare queued backend follow-ups. Pixel fidelity vs the mockup is the ST.8d gate.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4c22af198ef289a77a857484e0fa17b75449b423","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/trees/4c22af198ef289a77a857484e0fa17b75449b423"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/commits/825913185b7f4193bdb3b85140d163af086584cc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commit/825913185b7f4193bdb3b85140d163af086584cc","node_id":"C_kwDOSxKwgtoAKDgyNTkxMzE4NWI3ZjQxOTNiZGIzYjg1MTQwZDE2M2FmMDg2NTg0Y2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commit/cce700eb900ed8b6a94c73301877d74dc8022a9f","sha":"cce700eb900ed8b6a94c73301877d74dc8022a9f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/cce700eb900ed8b6a94c73301877d74dc8022a9f"}],"sha":"825913185b7f4193bdb3b85140d163af086584cc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/825913185b7f4193bdb3b85140d163af086584cc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTY5NTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/commits/cce700eb900ed8b6a94c73301877d74dc8022a9f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-04T07:39:06Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-04T07:39:06Z","email":"claytonjcody@gmail.com","name":"Cody Clayton"},"message":"feat(manager): E14 heatmap + E15 cell drilldown (6.5b)\n\nAdd the two manager heatmap read endpoints, completing the §9 manager\nread surface (E13/E14/E15):\n\nE14 GET /api/manager/heatmap -> HeatmapResponseDto{weekStart, cells[]} —\nthe direct-report x Defining-Objective grid (REQ-F-020/021), NOT paginated\n(bounded by reports x DOs). Coarse authorizeTeamHeatmapAccess + IDOR-safe\nquery-scoping (manager_employee_id = principal.employeeId(), never a request\nvalue); a Criteria join over employee + defining_objective for the display\nname + DO title, N+1-free (a fixed one statement). The supportingOutcomeId\nfilter resolves to its parent Defining Objective and narrows the DO-grained\ncells (count-honest).\n\nE15 GET /api/manager/heatmap/{cellId}/drilldown -> HeatmapDrilldownDto with\nper-Supporting-Outcome groups (REQ-F-022), each a B.20 PageEnvelope of\nWeeklyCommitmentDto (priority ASC, createdAt ASC, id ASC — id a deterministic\ntiebreaker while createdAt is unpopulated). Own-cell-only via the pre-existing\nauthorizeHeatmapCellAccess -> IDOR 404 (+denial audit; missing cell -> 404\nno-audit). Commitments use the context-free CommitmentMapper.toDto (empty\nallowedActions — dispute affordances are E3/E4-only, 5.5b). The report''s plan\nresolves from the authorized cell''s (employeeId, weekStartDate).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"95fdb6c869dd7ed59366395edabfec551e2f7e0d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/trees/95fdb6c869dd7ed59366395edabfec551e2f7e0d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SiWarlock/st6-weekly-commit/git/commits/cce700eb900ed8b6a94c73301877d74dc8022a9f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22569574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiWarlock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SiWarlock","id":22569574,"login":"SiWarlock","n