GYyYmVlYjA1MGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cdgutierrez6/fleetvision/commit/da3d08b080b7f08e6e31bdb84e80d1075a7fadb7","sha":"da3d08b080b7f08e6e31bdb84e80d1075a7fadb7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cdgutierrez6/fleetvision/commits/da3d08b080b7f08e6e31bdb84e80d1075a7fadb7"}],"sha":"f597a784bef2ede1a6a7397f64f260f2beeb050e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cdgutierrez6/fleetvision/commits/f597a784bef2ede1a6a7397f64f260f2beeb050e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1966339?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdgutierrez6/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdgutierrez6/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdgutierrez6/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdgutierrez6/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cdgutierrez6","id":1966339,"login":"cdgutierrez6","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NjYzMzk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdgutierrez6/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdgutierrez6/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdgutierrez6/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdgutierrez6/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdgutierrez6/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdgutierrez6","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cdgutierrez6/fleetvision/commits/da3d08b080b7f08e6e31bdb84e80d1075a7fadb7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T07:45:54Z","email":"cdgutierrez6@gmail.com","name":"Cristian Daniel Gutiérrez S."},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T07:45:54Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"test(ci): coverage for geofencing + tenant-management Application (Group B) (#9)\n\ngeofencing: 7 test files (61 methods) covering the uncovered Application handlers\n(UpdateGeofence, DeleteGeofence, GetGeofence, ListGeofences, ListViolations) and the\nDomain factories (GeofenceViolation, VehicleGeofenceState, GeofencingOutboxEvent).\n56.4% -> worst 74.2%.\ntenant-management: 6 test files covering ListTenants / GetTenantProfile / UpdateTenantPlan /\nSetTenantActiveStatus / SetPlanByBilling handlers + CreateTenantProfileCommandValidator.\n48.6% -> worst 80.9%. (Its earlier \"0%\" was the coverlet-6.0.3 bug, already fixed by the\nroot Directory.Build.props.)\n\n91 + 66 tests green. No production code changed. Reviewed via senior pipeline (llm-judge:\ngeofencing 3.85 / tenant-management 3.6 -- both observaciones, no blockers).\n\nFollow-ups (NOT this PR): geofencing UpdateGeofenceCommandValidator lacks the\nAllowedFrom/AllowedTo TimeOnly format validation that Create has (handler does\nTimeOnly.Parse -> 500 on bad input); PostGIS spatial + Postgres RLS isolation need\nintegration tests (EF InMemory can''t cover them). Tracked in #4.\n\nRefs #4.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cristian Gutierrez <efiziai.notificaciones@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2142ce29b48190d574a762852fa6c36cca395342","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cdgutierrez6/fleetvision/git/trees/2142ce29b48190d574a762852fa6c36cca395342"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cdgutierrez6/fleetvision/git/commits/da3d08b080b7f08e6e31bdb84e80d1075a7fadb7","verification":{"payload":"tree 2142ce29b48190d574a762852fa6c36cca395342\nparent 2ebd5ab3dedf79fd0b3998962146c51aaa079950\nauthor Cristian Daniel Gutiérrez S. <cdgutierrez6@gmail.com> 1789026354 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789026354 -0500\n\ntest(ci): coverage for geofencing + tenant-management Application (Group B) (#9)\n\ngeofencing: 7 test files (61 methods) covering the uncovered Application handlers\n(UpdateGeofence, DeleteGeofence, GetGeofence, ListGeofences, ListViolations) and the\nDomain factories (GeofenceViolation, VehicleGeofenceState, GeofencingOutboxEvent).\n56.4% -> worst 74.2%.\ntenant-management: 6 test files covering ListTenants / GetTenantProfile / UpdateTenantPlan /\nSetTenantActiveStatus / SetPlanByBilling handlers + CreateTenantProfileCommandValidator.\n48.6% -> worst 80.9%. (Its earlier \"0%\" was the coverlet-6.0.3 bug, already fixed by the\nroot Directory.Build.props.)\n\n91 + 66 tests green. No production code changed. Reviewed via senior pipeline (llm-judge:\ngeofencing 3.85 / tenant-management 3.6 -- both observaciones, no blockers).\n\nFollow-ups (NOT this PR): geofencing UpdateGeofenceCommandValidator lacks the\nAllowedFrom/AllowedTo TimeOnly format validation that Create has (handler does\nTimeOnly.Parse -> 500 on bad input); PostGIS spatial + Postgres RLS isolation need\nintegration tests (EF InMemory can''t cover them). Tracked in #4.\n\nRefs #4.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cristian Gutierrez <efiziai.notificaciones@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqomAyCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA84UQAGhXhIR3v85DvcG0EbGYTCzK\nEjm6JPT0KFKQquQ1hMOLMoiB62A2FIZnEEgkqFPbqjS3hSJ5ldcr/sm8zJsEO6Ue\nj526vKAY14PuwJl8i14FjUWoAcV7XYneG4fPRf6Xd4nWxmUmqMqtsc/3zrdU9s9l\nRwRGHtjJDQJZuBIGyKpGe0bzH/laoQKbjtj+n1b8ETllpsnFHbSxEWndkDFZHCCX\n+qiWBgV914v4c4q6pVHGn+8W96G9mgXTmYgA0boBJrKicatp9jsNoiPRHVnh+vxe\n4O1CC5vPx8nG2czRf5EQ8whTzm00g4Ii+Pi+GpTCsQWlRTpRf6lRJeXXoZ7PZG6p\nvGFn2hlpvDO6N7xnnz9h5O93/4ToQ1+svqg4yUkMvKEX92M5lz+LTbzS6JOLeiXj\n13BFzw8IHo0qt6MGjYvniw4uwXgjsmDgBfn0xSGFsQJaph6WypifvP/XE0uCN8Mb\nHciGrie2Qe93ckvbsmtzrfDHDkVKfbRklw6GPIgR4CF9uNtLeKFgS74OX47azkrO\nE6c5fqmo5OMASV6R+OtqxsbbC2nY9eFcaPZRSiw/teZT4Ikq+L55j/V6Fw/cOfvC\nDTgBTCMLoPqtHAfqgBV3/CmncDEeQSit5a47WKevbOxfZhlZiXVAv05LB0BIaCIk\nZ3L1PZb1MW2rXntWHAQ9\n=vmLV\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-10T07:45:54Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","f