e/adc-email-frontend/commits/ae1306836cbc8b1311d4b1b3614fcb2453b6737d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-07T22:00:47Z","email":"gpsmurfs@gmail.com","name":"Abbytec"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-07T22:00:47Z","email":"gpsmurfs@gmail.com","name":"Abbytec"},"message":"feat(adc-mail): layout mobile con lectura en modal a pantalla completa\n\nSobre `lg` la lista y la lectura siguen en paralelo; por debajo (mobile o\nventana angosta, `useIsCompact`) la lista ocupa el ancho completo y abrir\nun mensaje lo lleva a un `adc-modal size=\"full\"` con su propio botón de\nvolver, en vez de un panel lateral que no entra. El compositor y la\nprevisualización de adjuntos hacen lo mismo. El offset del contenido ya no\nes un valor fijo en rem: se mide el ancho real del aside (varía con el\nidioma) vía `ResizeObserver`. Objetivos táctiles de estrella/eliminar/back\npasan a 44px y la barra de cuota apila dirección y progreso en pantallas\nangostas.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b2d991288b6d307fc2fe41f4c243d3c96d91c119","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/adc-email-frontend/git/trees/b2d991288b6d307fc2fe41f4c243d3c96d91c119"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/adc-email-frontend/git/commits/ae1306836cbc8b1311d4b1b3614fcb2453b6737d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27163541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abbytec","id":27163541,"login":"abbytec","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MTYzNTQx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/A-Digital-Cafe/adc-email-frontend/commit/ae1306836cbc8b1311d4b1b3614fcb2453b6737d","node_id":"C_kwDOSxRJ6doAKGFlMTMwNjgzNmNiYzhiMTMxMWQ0YjFiMzYxNGZjYjI0NTNiNjczN2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/A-Digital-Cafe/adc-email-frontend/commit/8268c3b11b83e001a490a1cf4aacf4fbf564b1ef","sha":"8268c3b11b83e001a490a1cf4aacf4fbf564b1ef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/adc-email-frontend/commits/8268c3b11b83e001a490a1cf4aacf4fbf564b1ef"}],"sha":"ae1306836cbc8b1311d4b1b3614fcb2453b6737d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/adc-email-frontend/commits/ae1306836cbc8b1311d4b1b3614fcb2453b6737d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27163541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abbytec","id":27163541,"login":"abbytec","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MTYzNTQx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/adc-email-frontend/commits/8268c3b11b83e001a490a1cf4aacf4fbf564b1ef/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-04T22:27:15Z","email":"gpsmurfs@gmail.com","name":"Abbytec"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-04T22:27:15Z","email":"gpsmurfs@gmail.com","name":"Abbytec"},"message":"fix(mail): no calcular `credentials` en build (cookie perdida por IP de LAN)\n\n`process.env.NODE_ENV` lo resuelve rspack al compilar, así que un bundle de\nproducción abierto por IP de LAN pegaba al gateway `:3000` —cross-origin, porque\nahí `IS_DEV` sí es true— con `same-origin`, y el navegador descartaba la cookie\nde sesión. La política la decide ahora `createAdcApi` en runtime, con la misma\nseñal con la que elige el baseUrl.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7a1ffd614f239dd274163c2873a996b3d5b16c4e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/adc-email-frontend/git/trees/7a1ffd614f239dd274163c2873a996b3d5b16c4e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/adc-email-frontend/git/commits/8268c3b11b83e001a490a1cf4aacf4fbf564b1ef","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27163541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abbytec","id":27163541,"login":"abbytec","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MTYzNTQx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/starred{