no empiece con el token\n\"TODO\", que Sonar levantaba como comentario de tarea pendiente (S1135).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"db99727d67be7de800bee61b0fa4b61927cf71bc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/adc-email-frontend/git/trees/db99727d67be7de800bee61b0fa4b61927cf71bc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/adc-email-frontend/git/commits/352db65c7ee7ee13ad59803321fb5810de49bcfb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27163541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abbytec","id":27163541,"login":"abbytec","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MTYzNTQx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/A-Digital-Cafe/adc-email-frontend/commit/352db65c7ee7ee13ad59803321fb5810de49bcfb","node_id":"C_kwDOSxRJ6doAKDM1MmRiNjVjN2VlN2VlMTNhZDU5ODAzMzIxZmI1ODEwZGU0OWJjZmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/A-Digital-Cafe/adc-email-frontend/commit/98dedc7332ca2c30436fa667398af382d27389fe","sha":"98dedc7332ca2c30436fa667398af382d27389fe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/adc-email-frontend/commits/98dedc7332ca2c30436fa667398af382d27389fe"}],"sha":"352db65c7ee7ee13ad59803321fb5810de49bcfb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/adc-email-frontend/commits/352db65c7ee7ee13ad59803321fb5810de49bcfb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27163541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abbytec","id":27163541,"login":"abbytec","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MTYzNTQx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/adc-email-frontend/commits/98dedc7332ca2c30436fa667398af382d27389fe/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-29T14:13:05Z","email":"gpsmurfs@gmail.com","name":"Abbytec"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-29T14:13:05Z","email":"gpsmurfs@gmail.com","name":"Abbytec"},"message":"feat: preview de adjuntos, aviso de envío interno e idempotencia\n\n- **Preview de adjuntos**: `AttachmentPreviewModal` muestra imagen, video, audio,\n  PDF y texto con los visores de media-ui-library (nueva `uiDependency`). Los\n  adjuntos van cifrados por usuario, así que se bajan por el proxy descifrante a\n  un blob y el visor recibe el object URL — de ahí que la CSP sume `blob:` en\n  img/media/object/frame. Lo no previsualizable mantiene la descarga directa.\n- **Envío interno**: con `internalOnly` el compose marca los destinatarios fuera\n  del dominio y deshabilita el envío, en vez de dejar redactar el mensaje entero\n  para chocar recién al mandarlo. Sólo evalúa direcciones ya completas para no\n  pintar de rojo mientras se tipea; el backend valida igual.\n- **Idempotencia**: `createDraft` y `presign-upload` mandan clave única por\n  invocación (crear dos borradores o subir dos veces el mismo archivo es\n  legítimo), y `confirm-upload` una determinista, porque suma la cuota de\n  almacenamiento y un reintento debe replayear la respuesta cacheada.\n- `withAddresses` centraliza la conversión de destinatarios string → `{ address }`\n  que exige la API, en vez de repetirla en cada componente.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fc6f4357cc0e4a924005cc06cc81ce8489458d6d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/adc-email-frontend/git/trees/fc6f4357cc0e4a924005cc06cc81ce8489458d6d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/adc-email-frontend/git/commits/98dedc7332ca2c30436fa667398af382d27389fe","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27163541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abbytec","id":27163541,"login":"abbytec","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MTYzNTQx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/subscr