set_plan, section_plan,\ninteraction_plan, acceptance_checks. A new pure variableContract() builds them from\nthe resolution (classification/cluster/directive); spread additively into the emitted\nbrief (existing keys preserved).\n\nThis closes the taste hand-off gap: downstream build/ops now receive structured data,\nand cambium''s verifyOutput judges drift against the contract (a taste output missing a\ngroup drifts).\n\n- taste/scripts/lib/variable-contract.mjs (pure) + variable-contract.test.mjs (4/4)\n- taste/scripts/taste-resolve.mjs — import + additive spread\n\nPure lib = tested without NIM spend. Additive; no existing behaviour changed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"40b31861c0494e0cfeba510ffbf9b54ae9423321","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/git/trees/40b31861c0494e0cfeba510ffbf9b54ae9423321"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/git/commits/f6302bec88293599bf0e6046da40bfd2057c055e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7611727?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer","id":7611727,"login":"Sheshiyer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MTE3Mjc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/subscriptions","type":"User"