d":7611727,"login":"Sheshiyer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MTE3Mjc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commits/049e96958e8d57b352e799244bcbff86f4b9ab4e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-08T08:07:06Z","email":"sheshnarayan.iyer@gmail.com","name":"sheshiyer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-08T08:07:06Z","email":"sheshnarayan.iyer@gmail.com","name":"sheshiyer"},"message":"docs+schema: codify the lessons from the first brand genesis (Fitcheck run)\n\nFitcheck was the venture-OS tracer slice — a real brand run end-to-end (waves 0-8)\nthrough the brandmint engine. This bakes the lessons back into the engine + roadmap.\n\n- docs/LESSONS-FITCHECK-RUN.md — the retrospective: 8 lessons, each tagged SHIPPED\n  (mission-grounding #103, multi-backend #104, reuse-upstream, generate→look→keep)\n  or GAP (name-validation, semantic visual-QA, reference-anchored campaigns).\n- schema: formalize visual_tokens.logo_brief + visual_tokens.art_direction (the\n  grounding fields the run proved — Lesson 1).\n- ROADMAP: a \"Brandmint — lessons\" section + the three next-cycle gates (B1/B2/B3).\n- STATUS: next-no-spend = the three brandmint gates; link the retrospective.\n\nThe core finding: the misses were data-flow + missing-gate problems, not bad taste.\nThree are fixed in the engine; three are new gates it still needs.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d897cdd95aa55170e9c7bd68693830ea97d87ba5","url":"https://api.github.com