wMjVlY2NjN2RkZTEzNmNkM2QxMmVmODk2ZWIxNDI0MTk5N2ZiYTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commit/06f0ee30cd531b4ad45e9145092e05a334f526ee","sha":"06f0ee30cd531b4ad45e9145092e05a334f526ee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commits/06f0ee30cd531b4ad45e9145092e05a334f526ee"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commit/c506fc14996a58b1d2eb2c8b512fdd31d1655573","sha":"c506fc14996a58b1d2eb2c8b512fdd31d1655573","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commits/c506fc14996a58b1d2eb2c8b512fdd31d1655573"}],"sha":"6025eccc7dde136cd3d12ef896eb14241997fba3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commits/6025eccc7dde136cd3d12ef896eb14241997fba3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7611727?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer","id":7611727,"login":"Sheshiyer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MTE3Mjc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commits/c506fc14996a58b1d2eb2c8b512fdd31d1655573/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-08T07:58:25Z","email":"sheshnarayan.iyer@gmail.com","name":"sheshiyer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-08T07:58:25Z","email":"sheshnarayan.iyer@gmail.com","name":"sheshiyer"},"message":"feat(brandmint): Nano Banana Pro (Gemini) render backend, selectable via --backend\n\nAdd lib/nanobanana.mjs — the sibling of gpt-image.mjs — a bridge to the nanobanana\nskill''s generate.py (Gemini 3 Pro Image): pure buildNanoArgs + injected-runner\nmakeNanoBanana. Unlike gpt-image-2 it uses a real GEMINI_API_KEY (carried by the\nrunner''s env) and supports image-edit references (-i), 2K/4K (-s) and ratios (-r).\n\nWire it into the brandmint CLI: `--backend gpt-image|nanobanana` (default unchanged)\n+ `--nano-script <path>`. The nanobanana lane renders at 2K and guards on a missing\nGEMINI_API_KEY when images are requested. Default path (gpt-image-2) is byte-identical.\n\n14 new tests (11 adapter + 3 parseArgs); 319/319 taste suite green; additive.\nValidated live this session: the full Fitcheck identity (logo/board/hero/lifestyle/\non-model/before-after/social) was rendered through this backend.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ba801fc46a88f61586b0ac8336aa8c5d87ba2579","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/git/trees/ba801fc46a88f61586b0ac8336aa8c5d87ba2579"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/git/commits/c506fc14996a58b1d2eb2c8b512fdd31d1655573","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7611727?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer","id":7611727,"login":"Sheshiyer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MTE3Mjc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/