/commits/973e0eb9e784504658e4ad1463debf8f76ca8651/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-07T08:53:41Z","email":"sheshnarayan.iyer@gmail.com","name":"sheshiyer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-07T08:53:41Z","email":"sheshnarayan.iyer@gmail.com","name":"sheshiyer"},"message":"refactor(taste): idempotent re-registration (upsert) + shared spawnCli test helper\n\nTwo flagged follow-ups:\n\n- dedup: add an opt-in { upsert } option to noesis.add + design-memory.add — when\n  set, it replaces any existing same-id row before push. Default (append) is\n  byte-identical for every existing caller. registerKit opts in, so re-running\n  `kit-register --persist <dir>` with the same brand:version now leaves ONE row\n  on disk instead of duplicating.\n- spawnCli: extract test-helpers/spawn-cli.mjs (spawn `node <script> <args>` +\n  capture) and refactor kit-register-cli.test.mjs onto it — the reusable pattern\n  for every CLI''s subprocess tests.\n\n8 new tests (5 upsert + 2 spawnCli + 1 re-run dedup); 301/301 taste suite green;\nregisterKit''s stable id + meta-authority unchanged.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9a9186e8dd36f1341f16bf136eae2c4f99b85cd2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/git/trees/9a9186e8dd36f1341f16bf136eae2c4f99b85cd2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/git/commits/973e0eb9e784504658e4ad1463debf8f76ca8651","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7611727?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer","id"