thub.com/users/Sheshiyer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commits/8bbb0b96e69ba320cb14fbff8ba44cafeef0f3fb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-07T07:32:21Z","email":"sheshnarayan.iyer@gmail.com","name":"sheshiyer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-07T07:32:21Z","email":"sheshnarayan.iyer@gmail.com","name":"sheshiyer"},"message":"feat(brandmint): reroll on by default in the CLI (opt-out via --no-reroll)\n\nNow that the self-correcting flow is proven safe, the brandmint CLI self-corrects\nevery render by default; pass --no-reroll to disable. Extracted a pure, exported\nparseArgs(argv) so the default is unit-tested (8 tests) rather than buried inline.\n\nThe runBrandKit LIBRARY default stays reroll=null (it can''t self-score without an\ninjected scorer — that separation is correct); the default lives at the CLI layer\nwhere the real decodePng→scorePalette scorer exists. Scorer is built only when\nreroll && images, so --no-images stays generation-free.\n\n8 new tests; 280/280 taste suite green; runBrandKit + its tests untouched.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7feb1eec740a74d242f6b2f2a9430890decfcea7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/git/trees/7feb1eec740a74d242f6b2f2a9430890decfcea7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/git/commits/8bbb0b96e69ba320cb14fbff8ba44cafeef0f3fb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7611727?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://g