pi.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commits/726163e5aefff9e53c81142ff95256abda68f566/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-07T06:49:11Z","email":"sheshnarayan.iyer@gmail.com","name":"sheshiyer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-07T06:49:11Z","email":"sheshnarayan.iyer@gmail.com","name":"sheshiyer"},"message":"feat(brandmint): auto-reroll closed loop + persistent cortex\n\nTwo no-spend capabilities closing loops around the kit:\n\n- reroll: rerollImages() + brandmint-reroll.mjs CLI — generate → score (kit-qa)\n  → regenerate any render below an on-brand threshold, keep the best attempt,\n  stop early once it passes. Proven LIVE on Fitcheck: a brand-board scored 0.229\n  (below 0.25), rerolled, and the 2nd attempt scored 0.258 ✓; the logo passed\n  first try (0.505) with no wasted generation.\n- store-fs: makeFileStore(path) — a drop-in for makeMemoryStore that persists to\n  disk atomically, so the noesis + design-memory cortex survives a restart.\n\n34 new tests (TDD, 2 parallel background agents); 267/267 taste suite green; additive.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c6d6ba2e863f07dab5bcb24191ac702c1bf6e072","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/git/trees/c6d6ba2e863f07dab5bcb24191ac702c1bf6e072"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/git/commits/726163e5aefff9e53c81142ff95256abda68f566","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7611727?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiye