0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-06T22:59:49Z","email":"sheshnarayan.iyer@gmail.com","name":"sheshiyer"},"message":"taste pipeline: MMR rerank (#54) + prototype feedback (#57) + eval (#60)\n\nThree pure, zero-dep complements to the taste engine:\n- rerank.mjs — MMR second-stage rerank (relevance + diversity) so the top-K\n  aren''t near-duplicates. TDD 10/10.\n- prototype-feedback.mjs — updatePrototype(proto,{chosen,rejected,rate}) sharpens\n  the brand prototype toward chosen exemplars (L2-normalized, pure); applyFeedbackLog\n  folds events. Complements taste-feedback.mjs (untouched). TDD 10/10.\n- taste-eval.mjs — evalTaste(cases, resolveFn) → on-brand precision metric\n  (classification axis / suggested_cluster hit). TDD 9/9.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7cba806ccfad9f4cc9496b87b7abece91c2edbca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/git/trees/7cba806ccfad9f4cc9496b87b7abece91c2edbca"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/git/commits/ab1dfb799f5fd5adce364d1b17d589d3e34acdf8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7611727?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer","id":7611727,"login":"Sheshiyer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MTE3Mjc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subs