"sheshiyer"},"message":"skill-clusters: budget dashboard (#32) + ship-battery visual-qa gate (#34) + auto-tier (#38)\n\n- budget-report.mjs — pure budgetReport(spend,{caps,warnAt}) → per-venture\n  table (spent/cap/pct/status ok|warn|over|uncapped) + counts. CLI + --json. TDD 10/10.\n- ship-battery.mjs — NEW required, fail-closed `visual-qa` gate: when a web\n  build exists (dist/index.html), runs visual-qa; contrast failures → HOLD.\n  Additive (every prior gate unchanged). Verified: real landing SHIPs (0\n  failures), synthetic low-contrast HOLDs (exit 1).\n- auto-tier.mjs — pure suggestTiers(usage,{index,idleDefer}) → {activate, defer}\n  (suggests only; tier.mjs applies). Injected clock. TDD 11/11.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"416fa81c80e33d5f81de45a3edd319e003cc2115","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/git/trees/416fa81c80e33d5f81de45a3edd319e003cc2115"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/git/commits/e3d40027ff52418844ed4585c505c737f67e907f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7611727?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer","id":7611727,"login":"Sheshiyer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MTE3Mjc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://a