T22:36:51Z","email":"sheshnarayan.iyer@gmail.com","name":"sheshiyer"},"message":"brandmint: voice (#27) + positioning (#29) generators from the brand-spec\n\nTwo deterministic (no-AI, no-spend) Markdown generators completing the brandmint\ntext capabilities:\n- gen-voice.mjs — genVoiceGuide(spec) → a voice/tone guide (tone tokens, do/don''t,\n  vocabulary, \"writing for {persona}\", example rewrites). TDD 9/9.\n- gen-positioning.mjs — genPositioning(spec) → a positioning brief (the classic\n  \"For {target} who {pain}, {Name} is the {category} that {gain}…\" statement,\n  value props mapped from gains, key messages). TDD 8/8.\nBoth pure + isMain CLI, mirroring emit-brand-spec/gen-logo. Proven on HDILINT.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"090df694211cfedd26367349a23b7d21dd5c55d8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/git/trees/090df694211cfedd26367349a23b7d21dd5c55d8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/git/commits/32d2c3ed5ea6fe1c83923d687473fb603b374cb5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7611727?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer","id":7611727,"login":"Sheshiyer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MTE3Mjc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commit/32d2c3ed5ea6fe1c83923d687473fb603b374cb5","node_id":"C_kwDOSxWr3doAKDMyZDJjM2VkNWVhNmZlMWM4MzkyM2Q2ODc0NzNmYjYwM2IzNzRjYjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commit/15cabd4004937cfa79c8be725fd6cb9f9f182528","sha":"15cabd4004937cfa79c8be725fd6cb9f9f182528","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commits/15cabd4004937cfa79c8be725fd6cb9f9f182528"}],"sha":"32d2c3ed5ea6fe1c83923d687473fb603b374cb5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commits/32d2c3ed5ea6fe1c83923d687473fb603b374cb5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7611727?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer","id":7611727,"login":"Sheshiyer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MTE3Mjc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commits/15cabd4004937cfa79c8be725fd6cb9f9f182528/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-06T22:33:40Z","email":"sheshnarayan.iyer@gmail.com","name":"sheshiyer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-06T22:33:40Z","email":"sheshnarayan.iyer@gmail.com","name":"sheshiyer"},"message":"skill-clusters: provider session-keeper (#30) + cluster-health (#36)\n\nsession-keeper.mjs — probe-driven ok/degraded/expired tracker for the session-\nbased providers (gpt-image-2/arcplume); a 5-min grace window distinguishes a\ntransient blip (degraded, keep using) from a dead session (expired → refresh).\nneedsRefresh() returns only the expired. TDD 7/7.\n\ncluster-health.mjs — per-cluster lifetime successRate + trailing recentRate over\na window, flags `declining` when recent health drops below baseline (early\nwarning a long average would hide); loadEvents tolerates torn JSONL lines. TDD 9/9.\n\nBoth pure + injectable I/O (probe/now/readImpl). Full scripts/ suite 24/24.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8b90f173805f635d4d516b28249461f7e04373a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/git/trees/8b90f173805f635d4d516b28249461f7e04373a2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/git/commits/15cabd4004937cfa79c8be725fd6cb9f9f182528","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7611727?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer","id":7611727,"login":"Sheshiyer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MTE3Mjc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commit/15cabd4004937cfa79c8be725fd6cb9f9f182528","node_id":"C_kwDOSxWr3doAKDE1Y2FiZDQwMDQ5MzdjZmE3OWM4YmU3MjVmZDZjYjlmOWYxODI1Mjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commit/6a0de1160eff59db8031724b677410893a5a0dee","sha":"6a0de1160eff59db8031724b677410893a5a0dee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commits/6a0de1160eff59db8031724b677410893a5a0dee"}],"sha":"15cabd4004937cfa79c8be725fd6cb9f9f182528","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commits/15cabd4004937cfa79c8be725fd6cb9f9f182528"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7611727?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer","id":7611727,"login":"Sheshiyer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MTE3Mjc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commits/6a0de1160eff59db8031724b677410893a5a0dee/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-06T22:32:26Z","email":"sheshnarayan.iyer@gmail.com","name":"sheshiyer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-06T22:32:26Z","email":"sheshnarayan.iyer@gmail.com","name":"sheshiyer"},"message":"conductor: wire the four hard-gates (#89) + checkpoint/resume (#92)\n\n#89 — executePlan now detects irreversible tasks (publish/outbound/spend/brand)\nfrom the task description and HOLDS them by default (never auto-fires); an\ninjected gate(task,type) releases them on founder approval. On the real HDILINT\nplan: 18 build autonomously, the 2 deploy-gated tasks are held.\n#92 — optional checkpoint {load,save}: resume skips already-built tasks, saves\neach newly-built one — so a long venture build survives interruption.\nTDD 8/8.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1033a7db0eda42418cea9c1d998326b8f356d82a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/git/trees/1033a7db0eda42418cea9c1d998326b8f356d82a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/git/commits/6a0de1160eff59db8031724b677410893a5a0dee","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7611727?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer","id":7611727,"login":"Sheshiyer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MTE3Mjc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commit/6a0de1160eff59db8031724b677410893a5a0dee","node_id":"C_kwDOSxWr3doAKDZhMGRlMTE2MGVmZjU5ZGI4MDMxNzI0YjY3NzQxMDg5M2E1YTBkZWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commit/aba342c2359f152949945827ec4ecaddeb17dd1f","sha":"aba342c2359f152949945827ec4ecaddeb17dd1f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commits/aba342c2359f152949945827ec4ecaddeb17dd1f"}],"sha":"6a0de1160eff59db8031724b677410893a5a0dee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commits/6a0de1160eff59db8031724b677410893a5a0dee"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7611727?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer","id":7611727,"login":"Sheshiyer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MTE3Mjc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commits/aba342c2359f152949945827ec4ecaddeb17dd1f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-06T22:18:30Z","email":"sheshnarayan.iyer@gmail.com","name":"sheshiyer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-06T22:18:30Z","email":"sheshnarayan.iyer@gmail.com","name":"sheshiyer"},"message":"brandmint: logo / visual-identity generator from the brand-spec (#26)\n\ngen-logo.mjs — deterministic (no AI, no spend) SVG logo system from a canonical\nbrand-spec: a pure genLogo(spec) → { markSvg, logoSvg, logoDarkSvg } (monogram\nmark in a rounded square + wordmark lockup, light + dark), using the spec''s\npalette + name. isMain-guarded CLI: gen-logo.mjs <brand-spec.json> <out-dir>.\nTDD 9/9; renders on-brand from the real HDILINT spec. Fitcheck keeps its\nbespoke checkmark — this is the generic brandmint capability.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"17470a6851f04c7743b8949d7b51bf229f10a80e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/git/trees/17470a6851f04c7743b8949d7b51bf229f10a80e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/git/commits/aba342c2359f152949945827ec4ecaddeb17dd1f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7611727?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer","id":7611727,"login":"Sheshiyer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MTE3Mjc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commit/aba342c2359f152949945827ec4ecaddeb17dd1f","node_id":"C_kwDOSxWr3doAKGFiYTM0MmMyMzU5ZjE1Mjk0OTk0NTgyN2VjNGVjYWRkZWIxN2RkMWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commit/f04f05ba96960a98a1e6d1c59697540d5d115123","sha":"f04f05ba96960a98a1e6d1c59697540d5d115123","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commits/f04f05ba96960a98a1e6d1c59697540d5d115123"}],"sha":"aba342c2359f152949945827ec4ecaddeb17dd1f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commits/aba342c2359f152949945827ec4ecaddeb17dd1f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7611727?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer","id":7611727,"login":"Sheshiyer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MTE3Mjc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commits/f04f05ba96960a98a1e6d1c59697540d5d115123/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-06T22:12:15Z","email":"sheshnarayan.iyer@gmail.com","name":"sheshiyer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-06T22:12:15Z","email":"sheshnarayan.iyer@gmail.com","name":"sheshiyer"},"message":"conductor: generalize the execute loop beyond the HDILINT slice (#86)\n\nExtract the proven conductor-execute pattern into a venture-agnostic loop:\nexecutePlan({tasksPath, planPath, brand}) → resolve each task to a cluster\n(resolve-task) → inject the on-brand taste brief (taste-resolve --brand X) →\ndispatch the resolved <cluster>-orchestrator → record. All deps injected\n(resolveTask/tasteResolve/dispatch) so it''s pure + testable; defaults shell\nout to the real CLIs. Failures degrade, never abort: unresolved → flagged,\ntaste-down → null brief, dispatch fail → recorded + loop continues. Plus a\ndry-run CLI. TDD 5/5; verified end-to-end on the real HDILINT 20-task plan.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0f12f7ed84f233cf4555e282f2bc422b3970a37f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/git/trees/0f12f7ed84f233cf4555e282f2bc422b3970a37f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/git/commits/f04f05ba96960a98a1e6d1c59697540d5d115123","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7611727?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer","id":7611727,"login":"Sheshiyer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MTE3Mjc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commit/f04f05ba96960a98a1e6d1c59697540d5d115123","node_id":"C_kwDOSxWr3doAKGYwNGYwNWJhOTY5NjBhOThhMWU2ZDFjNTk2OTc1NDBkNWQxMTUxMjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commit/435674aa3e19fb5242cce11f10bde447ce8f20b0","sha":"435674aa3e19fb5242cce11f10bde447ce8f20b0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commits/435674aa3e19fb5242cce11f10bde447ce8f20b0"}],"sha":"f04f05ba96960a98a1e6d1c59697540d5d115123","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commits/f04f05ba96960a98a1e6d1c59697540d5d115123"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7611727?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer","id":7611727,"login":"Sheshiyer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MTE3Mjc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commits/435674aa3e19fb5242cce11f10bde447ce8f20b0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-06T21:55:43Z","email":"sheshnarayan.iyer@gmail.com","name":"sheshiyer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-06T21:55:43Z","email":"sheshnarayan.iyer@gmail.com","name":"sheshiyer"},"message":"je-ne-sais-quoi P4: ComfyUI Qwen-Edit try-on adapter + AWS deploy (#16)\n\nThe VTO render is a DEDICATED model, not generic image-edit: Qwen-Image-Edit +\nthe FoxBaze try-on LoRA via ComfyUI on a GPU box.\n\n- comfyui.mjs — ComfyUI API client (upload → inject workflow → /prompt → poll →\n  /view → image); pure injectWorkflow; fetch-injectable. TDD 3/3.\n- router.mjs — new `tryon` lane → `comfyui` provider (cost 8); the adapter is\n  GATED (throws until COMFYUI_URL + COMFYUI_TRYON_WORKFLOW set) so renderTryOn\n  degrades gracefully — no surprise GPU spend.\n- render.mjs — routes to `tryon` (not generic `image`). Full suite 38/38.\n- render-backend/ — setup-comfyui.sh (one-shot GPU provision: ComfyUI + the\n  fp8 Qwen-Image-Edit + LoRA + workflow + bearer-gated Caddy proxy) + DEPLOY.md\n  (instance options, cost, on-demand-vs-always-on, the spend gate).\n\nBackend launch is spend-gated — pending founder approval (instance + HF token).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"890f0928c7b70eab199dce1be701980d15700073","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/git/trees/890f0928c7b70eab199dce1be701980d15700073"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/git/commits/435674aa3e19fb5242cce11f10bde447ce8f20b0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7611727?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer","id":7611727,"login":"Sheshiyer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MTE3Mjc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commit/435674aa3e19fb5242cce11f10bde447ce8f20b0","node_id":"C_kwDOSxWr3doAKDQzNTY3NGFhM2UxOWZiNTI0MmNjZTExZjEwYmRlNDQ3Y2U4ZjIwYjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commit/250702c5778de3beaaca6613a307a22e8c1cd7aa","sha":"250702c5778de3beaaca6613a307a22e8c1cd7aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commits/250702c5778de3beaaca6613a307a22e8c1cd7aa"}],"sha":"435674aa3e19fb5242cce11f10bde447ce8f20b0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commits/435674aa3e19fb5242cce11f10bde447ce8f20b0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7611727?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer","id":7611727,"login":"Sheshiyer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MTE3Mjc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commits/250702c5778de3beaaca6613a307a22e8c1cd7aa/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-06T21:23:11Z","email":"sheshnarayan.iyer@gmail.com","name":"sheshiyer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-06T21:23:11Z","email":"sheshnarayan.iyer@gmail.com","name":"sheshiyer"},"message":"visual-qa: skip SVG graphic text (logos) in the contrast audit\n\nSVG <text> is painted by the `fill` attribute, not CSS `color`, so\ngetComputedStyle().color mis-reads it; logos are also WCAG-exempt (1.4.3).\nExclude any element inside an <svg> from the audit.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7ee4c16ec21a2edc9857b68f5026e63b639b337b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/git/trees/7ee4c16ec21a2edc9857b68f5026e63b639b337b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/git/commits/250702c5778de3beaaca6613a307a22e8c1cd7aa","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7611727?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer","id":7611727,"login":"Sheshiyer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MTE3Mjc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commit/250702c5778de3beaaca6613a307a22e8c1cd7aa","node_id":"C_kwDOSxWr3doAKDI1MDcwMmM1Nzc4ZGUzYmVhYWNhNjYxM2EzMDdhMjJlOGMxY2Q3YWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commit/88d15c20ddfca5e1e76ac3ad8a5faabcf55075fc","sha":"88d15c20ddfca5e1e76ac3ad8a5faabcf55075fc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commits/88d15c20ddfca5e1e76ac3ad8a5faabcf55075fc"}],"sha":"250702c5778de3beaaca6613a307a22e8c1cd7aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commits/250702c5778de3beaaca6613a307a22e8c1cd7aa"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7611727?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer","id":7611727,"login":"Sheshiyer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MTE3Mjc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commits/88d15c20ddfca5e1e76ac3ad8a5faabcf55075fc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-06T19:35:48Z","email":"sheshnarayan.iyer@gmail.com","name":"sheshiyer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-06T19:35:48Z","email":"sheshnarayan.iyer@gmail.com","name":"sheshiyer"},"message":"je-ne-sais-quoi: VTO render engine + reusable visual-QA tool\n\nrender.mjs — the media-gen render core, venture-agnostic. renderTryOn() reuses\nthe Phase-0 safety libs (not reinvented): actionKey/once (one identical request\n→ one generation), router.generate(''image'') (governor-metered dispatch with\nfailover), graceful fallback on provider failure (FR-004). LIVE SPEND IS GATED:\nthe image lane is a stub, so a real call degrades to fallback — firing a real\nrender needs a wired image adapter + founder spend approval. TDD: 5/5 with a\nmock adapter (no live spend); full taste suite 38/38.\n\nvisual-qa.mjs — reusable playwright QA: screenshots at N widths + a computed\nWCAG-AA contrast audit over rendered text (getComputedStyle + per-layer gradient\ncompositing). Run on the Fitcheck landing it CAUGHT a real regression my eyeball\nmissed — the hero eyebrow was dark-orange (#C2410C, 3.29:1) on the DARK hero\n(I''d wrongly assumed light in Task 9). Fixed in the landing (bright #FF6B35,\n6:1) + hardened the sticky header opacity; audit now 0/110 failures.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0f7bd2396ed255bdfef8770b9dc6b0ec2d21e945","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/git/trees/0f7bd2396ed255bdfef8770b9dc6b0ec2d21e945"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/git/commits/88d15c20ddfca5e1e76ac3ad8a5faabcf55075fc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7611727?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer","id":7611727,"login":"Sheshiyer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MTE3Mjc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.co