"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commits/df01db994bcca8bb77ed41123d18e4d539da87a8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-06T03:41:03Z","email":"sheshnarayan.iyer@gmail.com","name":"sheshiyer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-06T03:41:03Z","email":"sheshnarayan.iyer@gmail.com","name":"sheshiyer"},"message":"je-ne-sais-quoi P1: ground brand prototype in the canonical brand-spec\n\nbootstrap-brand.mjs predated the brand-spec contract — it composed brand-DNA\nfrom loose markdown + site stacks with a regex tone-scan, ignoring the\nvalidated spec. Wire --spec so the prototype is grounded in the contract:\n\n- Extract pure composeBrandDNA({brand,docText,techniques,spec}) → {brandText,\n  rules}; spec path leads with high-signal tokens (tagline, positioning, voice\n  tone, palette, type, motion, imagery, persona, taste_seed) so they dominate\n  the embedding centroid; no-spec path preserved byte-for-byte.\n- Add --spec flag (clear error + exit 2 on missing/invalid JSON).\n- Guard the CLI behind isMain so the module imports side-effect-free for tests.\n- New bootstrap-brand.test.mjs (4 cases, TDD); full taste suite 51/51 green.\n- Verified live: hdilint prototype (dim 1024, tone from voice_tokens =\n  \"direct, confident, pragmatic, fast-moving, proof-seeking\"); taste-resolve\n  returns 5 brand-biased exemplars, directive conforms to hdilint''s DNA.\n\nPrototype (taste/brands/hdilint.json) is gitignored; brand-spec lives in the\nseparate HDILINT repo — neither committed here.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3054c4d98bc89c6809454a5102c81aa182555173","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/git/trees/3054c4d98bc89c6809454a5102c81aa182555173"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/git/commits/df01db994bcca8bb77ed41123d18e4d539da87a8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"