ps://github.com/Sheshiyer","id":7611727,"login":"Sheshiyer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MTE3Mjc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commits/eef475f79464766f0557072374f2f8e948316056/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-06T03:26:45Z","email":"sheshnarayan.iyer@gmail.com","name":"sheshiyer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-06T03:26:45Z","email":"sheshnarayan.iyer@gmail.com","name":"sheshiyer"},"message":"je-ne-sais-quoi: route LLM lanes to Ollama (no Anthropic/fal keys)\n\nReplace the Anthropic/fal dependency in the model router with the local\nOllama daemon (proxying kimi-k2.6:cloud) as the LLM-reasoning lane:\n\n- ROUTES: creative-text/code/outreach → [ollama, nim]; structured-json\n  → [nim, ollama]. image/video keep their session primary with NO fal\n  fallback for now (no key).\n- ADAPTERS: live `ollama` adapter (OpenAI-compatible /chat/completions,\n  optional OLLAMA_API_KEY bearer, stream:false). kimi-k2.6 is a REASONING\n  model — defaults max_tokens:1024 so `content` isn''t starved by `reasoning`.\n- Tests updated (claude→ollama assertions + failover mocks); 30/30 pass.\n- Verified end-to-end: generate(''creative-text'') → live Ollama completion.\n- Provisioning checklist: text generation is live on Ollama+NIM today;\n  Anthropic/fal demoted to deferred nice-to-haves, not blockers.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"66ef5e92ad5e14813b848a3a56ca1a52aac3ba02","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshi