d-spec\nschema+validator. Phase 1 brand genesis (gate: brand). Phase 2 build on-brand via\nconductor+taste (gate: deploy). Phase 3 distribute via explee + Composio reply-loop\n(gates: spend+outbound). Phase 4 PostHog measure + Hermes close. Phase 5 live rails\n+ approval-deadline policy + the gated live launch. Risk register from the gap\nanalysis. Every irreversible action idempotency-keyed + behind its gate.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"46a17c0a6b9df88cca6b0dee3c8365ba2def9483","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/git/trees/46a17c0a6b9df88cca6b0dee3c8365ba2def9483"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/git/commits/c2b5eefc5ce8d39025380ee13d4b57d41c5eb2c5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7611727?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer","id":7611727,"login":"Sheshiyer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MTE3Mjc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commit/c2b5eefc5ce8d39025380ee13d4b57d41c5eb2c5","node_id":"C_kwDOSxWr3doAKGMyYjVlZWZjNWNlOGQzOTAyNTM4MGVlMTN