y; build the\nComposio reply loop (inbox -> demand signal + gated response drafts). G4 hybrid\nprovider resilience (session primary + API-key fallback). G5 per-venture budget+\nrate governor in the router. G6 federated memories for slice-1 (noesis = v2). G7\ncanonical brand-spec.json formalized from brandmint output. G8-15 mediums inline +\nfold rails/build-entry/approval-deadline into the slice plan.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d07a22718a8a1f436b3a5e8e14f28527fddbbd22","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/git/trees/d07a22718a8a1f436b3a5e8e14f28527fddbbd22"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/git/commits/c72b9f751c71675145aa7fa207ac787365336986","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7611727?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer","id":7611727,"login":"Sheshiyer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MTE3Mjc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commit/c72b9f751c71675145aa7fa207ac787365336986","node_id":"C_kwDOSxWr3doAKGM3MmI5Zjc1MWM3MTY3NTE0NWFhN2ZhMjA3YWM3ODcz