uted), G2 no idempotency on irreversible actions (retry could double-send\noutreach), G3 sending/deliverability+compliance not configured. HIGH: G4\nprovider fallback + fragile browser-session visual providers (gpt-image-2/\narcplume not autonomous-safe), G5 budget/rate governor on AI calls, G6 noesis\nunbuilt, G7 brand-spec schema undefined. + 8 MEDIUM. Config checklist in priority\norder. The gaps are all at the boundary where the autonomous system meets the\nreal world (generation, money, sending, sessions).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4331e61092e698b322826711f771dd0523e911ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/git/trees/4331e61092e698b322826711f771dd0523e911ae"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/git/commits/a37d2ca6d06651231bad363724e909d5ea555d7c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7611727?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer","id":7611727,"login":"Sheshiyer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MTE3Mjc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commit/a37d2ca6d06651231bad363724e909d5ea555d7c","node_id":"C_kwDOSxWr3doAKGEzN2QyY2E2ZDA2NjUxMjMxYmFkMzYzNzI0ZTkwOWQ1ZWE1NTVkN2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commit/0ba40974384f94e8840f6e0622961a71de76dbb7","sha":"0ba40974384f94e8840f6e0622961a71de76dbb7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commits/0ba40974384f94e8840f6e0622961a71de76dbb7"}],"sha":"a37d2ca6d06651231bad363724e909d5ea555d7c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commits/a37d2ca6d06651231bad363724e909d5ea555d7c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7611727?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer","id":7611727,"login":"Sheshiyer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MTE3Mjc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commits/0ba40974384f94e8840f6e0622961a71de76dbb7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-06T01:58:59Z","email":"sheshnarayan.iyer@gmail.com","name":"sheshiyer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-06T01:58:59Z","email":"sheshnarayan.iyer@gmail.com","name":"sheshiyer"},"message":"design: freeze the tapestry — 15 decisions locked, pilot = HDILINT\n\nFrozen via one-by-one design dialogue (brainstorming): the autonomous on-brand\nventure operator. 7 organs + noesis cortex; founder loop = Hermes ← Paperclip ←\nsnow-gloves. 15 decisions locked (vertical slice · risk-tiered autonomy · layered\norchestration · local-first · federated repos · canonical brand spec · composite\nfounder-tunable north-star · multi-channel distribution · 4 hard gates · PostHog\nanalytics organ · tiered failure/drift · fully-live slice-1). Pilot venture =\nHDILINT (Kimi virtual try-on plugin) which already has brand-config + wiki + GTM\nassets, so slice-1 resumes an in-flight venture to a live, founder-gated launch.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cf9b98f999c13cbc446a43d2dee74bcccc27cc78","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/git/trees/cf9b98f999c13cbc446a43d2dee74bcccc27cc78"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/git/commits/0ba40974384f94e8840f6e0622961a71de76dbb7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7611727?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer","id":7611727,"login":"Sheshiyer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MTE3Mjc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commit/0ba40974384f94e8840f6e0622961a71de76dbb7","node_id":"C_kwDOSxWr3doAKDBiYTQwOTc0Mzg0Zjk0ZTg4NDBmNmUwNjIyOTYxYTcxZGU3NmRiYjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commit/961b3dfac4409cca7e95218ee1fc6042b883f3e0","sha":"961b3dfac4409cca7e95218ee1fc6042b883f3e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commits/961b3dfac4409cca7e95218ee1fc6042b883f3e0"}],"sha":"0ba40974384f94e8840f6e0622961a71de76dbb7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commits/0ba40974384f94e8840f6e0622961a71de76dbb7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7611727?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer","id":7611727,"login":"Sheshiyer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MTE3Mjc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commits/961b3dfac4409cca7e95218ee1fc6042b883f3e0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-06T01:31:17Z","email":"sheshnarayan.iyer@gmail.com","name":"sheshiyer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-06T01:31:17Z","email":"sheshnarayan.iyer@gmail.com","name":"sheshiyer"},"message":"design: lock cortex decisions — name=noesis, store=Vectorize, build deferred\n\nDecisions locked: unified substrate named ''noesis'' (Cloudflare Worker generalized\nfrom taste-nim), Cloudflare Vectorize as the {tenant,collection} store, taste\nglobal / brand+knowledge per-tenant. Build deferred; Phase A (Worker + Vectorize +\n/upsert + /query) is the documented entry point when resumed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ec87dacd59cbc49df25261e7ba106ad971526fa4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/git/trees/ec87dacd59cbc49df25261e7ba106ad971526fa4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/git/commits/961b3dfac4409cca7e95218ee1fc6042b883f3e0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7611727?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer","id":7611727,"login":"Sheshiyer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MTE3Mjc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commit/961b3dfac4409cca7e95218ee1fc6042b883f3e0","node_id":"C_kwDOSxWr3doAKDk2MWIzZGZhYzQ0MDljY2E3ZTk1MjE4ZWUxZmM2MDQyYjg4M2YzZTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commit/419618cb02842e69e6f399dec446df84cff60fe8","sha":"419618cb02842e69e6f399dec446df84cff60fe8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commits/419618cb02842e69e6f399dec446df84cff60fe8"}],"sha":"961b3dfac4409cca7e95218ee1fc6042b883f3e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commits/961b3dfac4409cca7e95218ee1fc6042b883f3e0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7611727?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer","id":7611727,"login":"Sheshiyer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MTE3Mjc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commits/419618cb02842e69e6f399dec446df84cff60fe8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-06T01:28:33Z","email":"sheshnarayan.iyer@gmail.com","name":"sheshiyer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-06T01:28:33Z","email":"sheshnarayan.iyer@gmail.com","name":"sheshiyer"},"message":"design: unified cortex — one nervous system across taste/brandmint/snow-gloves\n\nThe three NVIDIA-NIM 1024-dim memories (je-ne-sais-quoi taste, brandmint\ndesign-memory, snow-gloves Knowledge Engine) are the same substrate. Map to\nunify into ONE Cloudflare Worker (generalize taste-nim → cortex) + ONE Vectorize\nstore partitioned by {tenant, collection}: taste (global), brand:<tenant>,\nknowledge:<tenant>. Common API: /embed /vlm /upsert /query. Four independent,\nreversible migration phases (A: generalize worker, B: taste corpus, C: brandmint,\nD: snow-gloves). One nervous system: every organ reads/writes one memory,\nmulti-tenant, governed in one place, with cross-collection retrieval.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"55573b018b62a0342d0d4c968c9e44a3185b9c4e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/git/trees/55573b018b62a0342d0d4c968c9e44a3185b9c4e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/git/commits/419618cb02842e69e6f399dec446df84cff60fe8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7611727?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer","id":7611727,"login":"Sheshiyer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MTE3Mjc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commit/419618cb02842e69e6f399dec446df84cff60fe8","node_id":"C_kwDOSxWr3doAKDQxOTYxOGNiMDI4NDJlNjllNmYzOTlkZWM0NDZkZjg0Y2ZmNjBmZTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commit/ca90be8b24a78e2af2067f4acfe60a209aee824e","sha":"ca90be8b24a78e2af2067f4acfe60a209aee824e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commits/ca90be8b24a78e2af2067f4acfe60a209aee824e"}],"sha":"419618cb02842e69e6f399dec446df84cff60fe8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commits/419618cb02842e69e6f399dec446df84cff60fe8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7611727?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer","id":7611727,"login":"Sheshiyer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MTE3Mjc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commits/ca90be8b24a78e2af2067f4acfe60a209aee824e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-06T01:03:26Z","email":"sheshnarayan.iyer@gmail.com","name":"sheshiyer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-06T01:03:26Z","email":"sheshnarayan.iyer@gmail.com","name":"sheshiyer"},"message":"je-ne-sais-quoi P4+P5: wire taste into the conductor loop + the feedback learning loop\n\nP4 — taste consultation in the conductor (conductor-orchestrator Execute step 5):\nfor visual/frontend clusters (creative-frontend · astro · react-native · expo ·\ndesign · electron · tauri UI), the conductor runs taste-resolve before the subagent\nbuilds and injects the taste brief (classification · on-brand Codrops exemplars +\ncode links · conformance directive · steerable axes) into its context. Left brain\npicks the technique; right brain says how it should feel, on-brand. After ship, the\nconductor records the cycle for taste learning.\n\nP5 — taste-feedback.mjs, the learning loop (mirrors loop-feedback.mjs):\n- --record pulls the brand prototype TOWARD used exemplars (good) / AWAY (bad),\n  harvests (anchor, positive, negative) triplets for a future contrastive/DPO\n  fine-tune, and logs the cycle. Brand DNA sharpens with use — no NIM needed.\n- --rollup aggregates: cycles/brand, prototype drift, triplets toward the 200\n  fine-tune threshold, ratings.\nValidated: 2 cycles drifted the tryambakam-noesis prototype (0.0086, 0.0042) toward\nthe used exemplars, harvested 15 triplets; rollup reports correctly.\n\nThe continuous loop is closed: taste brief → cluster builds on-brand → record →\nprototype sharpens → triplets accrue → (at 200) fine-tune + write-back into *-core.\nFeedback/eval data git-ignored. Health PASS.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ea7c264cf34c7109f81e897eb1321b12e7e4a2cc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/git/trees/ea7c264cf34c7109f81e897eb1321b12e7e4a2cc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/git/commits/ca90be8b24a78e2af2067f4acfe60a209aee824e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7611727?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer","id":7611727,"login":"Sheshiyer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MTE3Mjc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commit/ca90be8b24a78e2af2067f4acfe60a209aee824e","node_id":"C_kwDOSxWr3doAKGNhOTBiZThiMjRhNzhlMmFmMjA2N2Y0YWNmZTYwYTIwOWFlZTgyNGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commit/4fe3a35b15321c40542a58789a1de85ed0f20845","sha":"4fe3a35b15321c40542a58789a1de85ed0f20845","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commits/4fe3a35b15321c40542a58789a1de85ed0f20845"}],"sha":"ca90be8b24a78e2af2067f4acfe60a209aee824e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commits/ca90be8b24a78e2af2067f4acfe60a209aee824e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7611727?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer","id":7611727,"login":"Sheshiyer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MTE3Mjc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commits/4fe3a35b15321c40542a58789a1de85ed0f20845/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-06T01:00:43Z","email":"sheshnarayan.iyer@gmail.com","name":"sheshiyer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-06T01:00:43Z","email":"sheshnarayan.iyer@gmail.com","name":"sheshiyer"},"message":"je-ne-sais-quoi: Cloudflare KV + Worker secret proxy (not-dotenv prod path)\n\nProductionize the keys: hold them in Cloudflare KV behind a Worker so the\npublishable product never ships keys to a client.\n\n- KV namespace TASTE_SECRETS holds nvidia_nim_primary/secondary + proxy_token +\n  inference_sh. Loaded by taste/worker/put-secrets.mjs (reads keys from env via\n  temp files, never prints a value).\n- taste/worker/worker.js — bearer-gated proxy: POST /embed → NVIDIA /embeddings,\n  POST /vlm → /chat/completions, GET /health. Round-robin + failover over the\n  NVIDIA key pool, server-side. Deployed to taste-nim.sheshnarayan-iyer.workers.dev.\n- nim.mjs: routes through the Worker when NIM_PROXY_URL is set (keys stay in KV);\n  else direct NVIDIA pool. load-env reads taste/worker/.proxy.env (git-ignored,\n  holds NIM_PROXY_URL + NIM_PROXY_TOKEN).\n- Validated: /health 200 {nvidia_keys:2, inference_sh:true, gated:true}, 401 without\n  token, and a full taste brief runs end-to-end through the Worker with no local key.\n\nThe contract is stable: dev uses .env directly; prod points NIM_PROXY_URL at the\nWorker. inference.sh key is in KV, ready to wire as the LLM-reasoning lane.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"dd12f30464d8ceb2a322042a26fa1bf08574194c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/git/trees/dd12f30464d8ceb2a322042a26fa1bf08574194c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/git/commits/4fe3a35b15321c40542a58789a1de85ed0f20845","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7611727?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer","id":7611727,"login":"Sheshiyer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MTE3Mjc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commit/4fe3a35b15321c40542a58789a1de85ed0f20845","node_id":"C_kwDOSxWr3doAKDRmZTNhMzViMTUzMjFjNDA1NDJhNTg3ODlhMWRlODVlZDBmMjA4NDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commit/31df8dc4f92d383a6c8da322886b17212f6521a9","sha":"31df8dc4f92d383a6c8da322886b17212f6521a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commits/31df8dc4f92d383a6c8da322886b17212f6521a9"}],"sha":"4fe3a35b15321c40542a58789a1de85ed0f20845","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commits/4fe3a35b15321c40542a58789a1de85ed0f20845"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7611727?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer","id":7611727,"login":"Sheshiyer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MTE3Mjc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commits/31df8dc4f92d383a6c8da322886b17212f6521a9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-06T00:50:02Z","email":"sheshnarayan.iyer@gmail.com","name":"sheshiyer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-06T00:50:02Z","email":"sheshnarayan.iyer@gmail.com","name":"sheshiyer"},"message":"je-ne-sais-quoi: VLM model-fallback (90B 500s on some images, 11B handles)\n\nvlmAnnotate retries on NIM_VLM_FALLBACK (default llama-3.2-11b-vision) when the\nprimary model errors — a different resilience axis from post()''s key-failover\n(rate-limits). Fixes the 1 persistent holdout image that 500''d on the 90B across\nboth accounts; the 11B annotated it cleanly → corpus now 200/200 taste_schema +\n200/200 embeddings. PRODUCTION.md documents NIM_VLM_FALLBACK.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fd1eb1b81838e16d3930b54f8dddfcb2a6fe508c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/git/trees/fd1eb1b81838e16d3930b54f8dddfcb2a6fe508c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/git/commits/31df8dc4f92d383a6c8da322886b17212f6521a9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7611727?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer","id":7611727,"login":"Sheshiyer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MTE3Mjc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commit/31df8dc4f92d383a6c8da322886b17212f6521a9","node_id":"C_kwDOSxWr3doAKDMxZGY4ZGM0ZjkyZDM4M2E2YzhkYTMyMjg4NmIxNzIxMmY2NTIxYTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commit/b5214408c58d15d95370bf568ccb2b4f32b5692b","sha":"b5214408c58d15d95370bf568ccb2b4f32b5692b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commits/b5214408c58d15d95370bf568ccb2b4f32b5692b"}],"sha":"31df8dc4f92d383a6c8da322886b17212f6521a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commits/31df8dc4f92d383a6c8da322886b17212f6521a9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7611727?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer","id":7611727,"login":"Sheshiyer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MTE3Mjc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commits/b5214408c58d15d95370bf568ccb2b4f32b5692b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-06T00:31:59Z","email":"sheshnarayan.iyer@gmail.com","name":"sheshiyer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-06T00:31:59Z","email":"sheshnarayan.iyer@gmail.com","name":"sheshiyer"},"message":"je-ne-sais-quoi: multi-key NIM pool (new account primary) + KV production path\n\nMigrate the taste engine onto the new NVIDIA account and spread load across both\nkeys so neither gets rate-limited.\n\nProbe findings (taste/scripts/nim-probe.mjs — prints no secret values):\n- NVIDIA_NIM_API_KEY (new org) works at integrate.api.nvidia.com/v1 with the SAME\n  120 models (incl. llama-3.2-90b-vision + nv-embedqa-e5-v5) — the \"might not have\n  the model\" caveat is moot.\n- NVIDIA_NIM_API_URL=api.nvidia.com/nim/v1 in .env is NOT a real endpoint (fetch\n  fails); the client now ignores it and uses integrate.api.nvidia.com/v1.\n- inference.sh (INFERENCE_SH_API_KEY) is a different, non-OpenAI API (404 /models)\n  — loaded but not wired as a lane yet.\n\nnim.mjs → multi-key pool:\n- POOL = [NVIDIA_NIM_API_KEY (primary), NVIDIA_API_KEY, …] (NIM_KEYS overrides).\n- Round-robin per call + failover on 429/5xx → no single account overloaded.\n- Honors a configured base URL only if it''s an integrate host; else defaults safely.\n- load-env now reads the repo .env first (the new key) + the new var names.\n\nNo re-embedding needed: vectors are nv-embedqa-e5-v5, shared by both accounts, so\nexisting corpus embeddings stay valid — the key only decides who serves next call.\n\ntaste/PRODUCTION.md: the env contract + the Cloudflare KV + Worker handoff (store\nkeys as KV secrets, Worker injects them; client already reads from env, so no code\nchange for prod). Validated: pool=2 keys, fresh taste brief runs on the new primary.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4b4dab1f7fe72845800d22eaed689f20368d2e05","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/git/trees/4b4dab1f7fe72845800d22eaed689f20368d2e05"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/git/commits/b5214408c58d15d95370bf568ccb2b4f32b5692b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7611727?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer","id":7611727,"login":"Sheshiyer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MTE3Mjc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commit/b5214408c58d15d95370bf568ccb2b4f32b5692b","node_id":"C_kwDOSxWr3doAKGI1MjE0NDA4YzU4ZDE1ZDk1MzcwYmY1NjhjY2IyYjRmMzJiNTY5MmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commit/fbf0eb5cd434d7a99cced747ddebae7a9c93da4f","sha":"fbf0eb5cd434d7a99cced747ddebae7a9c93da4f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commits/fbf0eb5cd434d7a99cced747ddebae7a9c93da4f"}],"sha":"b5214408c58d15d95370bf568ccb2b4f32b5692b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commits/b5214408c58d15d95370bf568ccb2b4f32b5692b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7611727?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer","id":7611727,"login":"Sheshiyer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MTE3Mjc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commits/fbf0eb5cd434d7a99cced747ddebae7a9c93da4f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-06T00:22:14Z","email":"sheshnarayan.iyer@gmail.com","name":"sheshiyer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-06T00:22:14Z","email":"sheshnarayan.iyer@gmail.com","name":"sheshiyer"},"message":"je-ne-sais-quoi P3 works: fix 512-token cap → first taste brief lands\n\nThe embedder (nv-embedqa-e5-v5) caps input at 512 tokens; the 6000-char brand\nDNA blew past it (NIM 400). Fixes:\n- nim.embedText: truncate each input to ~900 chars (~410 tokens) — token-dense\n  text runs ~0.46 tok/char, so nothing 400s again. The 200-row corpus embed was\n  already under the cap; this guards future long inputs.\n- bootstrap-brand: chunk the brand DNA into ~800-char pieces and average the\n  embeddings → a richer prototype than truncating.\n\nResult — the full right brain → left brain loop runs end-to-end:\n  tryambakam-noesis prototype (dim 1024, tone \"sacred, organic\", R3F/Three/GSAP)\n  + request \"immersive scroll hero for a meditation/consciousness web app\"\n  → taste brief: feel \"Modern Minimalism · Serene\", brand-biased exemplars\n  (Frequency Breathwork wellness at brand-fit 0.49, GSAP portfolios), code links,\n  and a conformance directive naming the brand DNA + favored techniques →\n  dispatch to creative-frontend-orchestrator.\n\nCorpus: 200 rows · 199 taste_schema · 200 embeddings. P0–P3 functional.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1b79704fee188d950efd47285f359d180ba27d15","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/git/trees/1b79704fee188d950efd47285f359d180ba27d15"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/git/commits/fbf0eb5cd434d7a99cced747ddebae7a9c93da4f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7611727?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer","id":7611727,"login":"Sheshiyer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MTE3Mjc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commit/fbf0eb5cd434d7a99cced747ddebae7a9c93da4f","node_id":"C_kwDOSxWr3doAKGZiZjBlYjVjZDQzNGQ3YTk5Y2NlZDc0N2RkZWJhZTdhOWM5M2RhNGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commit/9914c4c6e9cb996894773d4d1788b1d1bacb2006","sha":"9914c4c6e9cb996894773d4d1788b1d1bacb2006","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commits/9914c4c6e9cb996894773d4d1788b1d1bacb2006"}],"sha":"fbf0eb5cd434d7a99cced747ddebae7a9c93da4f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commits/fbf0eb5cd434d7a99cced747ddebae7a9c93da4f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7611727?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer","id":7611727,"login":"Sheshiyer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MTE3Mjc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commits/9914c4c6e9cb996894773d4d1788b1d1bacb2006/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-05T23:47:51Z","email":"sheshnarayan.iyer@gmail.com","name":"sheshiyer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-05T23:47:51Z","email":"sheshnarayan.iyer@gmail.com","name":"sheshiyer"},"message":"je-ne-sais-quoi: incremental checkpointing + resume for enrich/embed\n\nA killed/suspended run no longer loses in-memory work. enrich checkpoints every\n10 rows, embed every 20, both save() at the end and on SIGINT/SIGTERM. Both are\nidempotent (skip rows that already have taste_schema/embedding), so a re-run\nresumes from the last checkpoint. Fixes the prior loss of ~150 VLM annotations\nwhen the session suspend reaped the detached background job.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b0ac7d9b26063294d446864799420d0bb357acbd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/git/trees/b0ac7d9b26063294d446864799420d0bb357acbd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/git/commits/9914c4c6e9cb996894773d4d1788b1d1bacb2006","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7611727?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer","id":7611727,"login":"Sheshiyer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MTE3Mjc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commit/9914c4c6e9cb996894773d4d1788b1d1bacb2006","node_id":"C_kwDOSxWr3doAKDk5MTRjNGM2ZTljYjk5Njg5NDc3M2Q0ZDE3ODhiMWQxYmFjYjIwMDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commit/5cf2a56ae19374acf997de98db631bb92c2019a6","sha":"5cf2a56ae19374acf997de98db631bb92c2019a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commits/5cf2a56ae19374acf997de98db631bb92c2019a6"}],"sha":"9914c4c6e9cb996894773d4d1788b1d1bacb2006","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commits/9914c4c6e9cb996894773d4d1788b1d1bacb2006"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7611727?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer","id":7611727,"login":"Sheshiyer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MTE3Mjc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commits/5cf2a56ae19374acf997de98db631bb92c2019a6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-05T23:43:27Z","email":"sheshnarayan.iyer@gmail.com","name":"sheshiyer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-05T23:43:27Z","email":"sheshnarayan.iyer@gmail.com","name":"sheshiyer"},"message":"clusters: add ihlamury/design-skills (4 Awwwards skills) → creative-frontend\n\nIntegrate the freshly-installed design-skills pack as creative-frontend spokes.\n\n- Moved 4 skills from ~/.agents/skills into the repo (canonical) so they stop\n  being enumerated at startup and load on demand like the other spokes:\n  awwwards-animations · gsap-awwwards-website · awwwards-landing-page · awwwards-ui-skills.\n- skills.sh.json: added to the creative-frontend grouping (15 entries).\n- Normalized: cluster=creative-frontend, version, origin=\"ihlamury/design-skills\".\n- creative-frontend-orchestrator: added an \"Awwwards / award-worthy aesthetic\"\n  group to the cluster map + In-browser routing rules, so the router actually\n  dispatches award-grade requests (premium 60fps scroll, custom cursor, magnetic,\n  page transitions, kinetic type, generative art) to awwwards-animations, and the\n  worked GSAP/Locomotive/UI-system references to their spokes.\n- Fixed 2 USE WHEN triggers (gsap-awwwards-website, awwwards-landing-page).\n\nIndex: 720 skills / 40 clusters · active-spoke 428 (+4) · enumerated 54 (unchanged\n— debloat preserved). Health PASS 0/0.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"efe2fa610a9d25c8c0e8207c3828aa02d5759e3a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/git/trees/efe2fa610a9d25c8c0e8207c3828aa02d5759e3a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/git/commits/5cf2a56ae19374acf997de98db631bb92c2019a6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7611727?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer","id":7611727,"login":"Sheshiyer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MTE3Mjc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commit/5cf2a56ae19374acf997de98db631bb92c2019a6","node_id":"C_kwDOSxWr3doAKDVjZjJhNTZhZTE5Mzc0YWNmOTk3ZGU5OGRiNjMxYmI5MmMyMDE5YTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commit/af3c57885db348ef8846c74d300fac51b4f24399","sha":"af3c57885db348ef8846c74d300fac51b4f24399","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commits/af3c57885db348ef8846c74d300fac51b4f24399"}],"sha":"5cf2a56ae19374acf997de98db631bb92c2019a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commits/5cf2a56ae19374acf997de98db631bb92c2019a6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7611727?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer","id":7611727,"login":"Sheshiyer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MTE3Mjc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commits/af3c57885db348ef8846c74d300fac51b4f24399/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-05T23:00:24Z","email":"sheshnarayan.iyer@gmail.com","name":"sheshiyer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-05T23:00:24Z","email":"sheshnarayan.iyer@gmail.com","name":"sheshiyer"},"message":"je-ne-sais-quoi P2+P3: embed + taste-resolve + brand bootstrap\n\nThe engine that turns the enriched corpus into a taste brief.\n\n- embed.mjs (P2): each enriched row → NIM vector (text of the \"taste document\":\n  title + tags + VLM taste_schema + excerpt; --clip adds NV-CLIP image vectors).\n  Zero-dep — vectors live in the corpus row; brute-force cosine is instant at a\n  few hundred items, no vector DB.\n- taste-resolve.mjs (P3): the bridge / \"corpus callosum\". {request, brand} →\n  classify → cosine recall → brand-biased re-rank → TASTE BRIEF {classification,\n  top-K Codrops exemplars + code links, conformance directive, steerable axes,\n  suggested cluster}. Mirrors resolve-task.mjs.\n- bootstrap-brand.mjs (P3): builds a brand-DNA profile (prototype vector + rules)\n  from the brand''s docs + its on-brand sites'' tech stacks → taste/brands/<name>.json.\n\n.gitignore: taste/brands/*.json (model-dependent, regenerable via bootstrap).\nAll three node --check clean. Runs against the corpus once enrich+embed finish.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fc31aaf8b5935570efc236138d8496aec81336bd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/git/trees/fc31aaf8b5935570efc236138d8496aec81336bd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/git/commits/af3c57885db348ef8846c74d300fac51b4f24399","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7611727?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer","id":7611727,"login":"Sheshiyer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MTE3Mjc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commit/af3c57885db348ef8846c74d300fac51b4f24399","node_id":"C_kwDOSxWr3doAKGFmM2M1Nzg4NWRiMzQ4ZWY4ODQ2Yzc0ZDMwMGZhYzUxYjRmMjQzOTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commit/fbe5d3a106bad13b31b22bc8762e3fc9179621e0","sha":"fbe5d3a106bad13b31b22bc8762e3fc9179621e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commits/fbe5d3a106bad13b31b22bc8762e3fc9179621e0"}],"sha":"af3c57885db348ef8846c74d300fac51b4f24399","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commits/af3c57885db348ef8846c74d300fac51b4f24399"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7611727?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer","id":7611727,"login":"Sheshiyer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MTE3Mjc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commits/fbe5d3a106bad13b31b22bc8762e3fc9179621e0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-05T22:49:17Z","email":"sheshnarayan.iyer@gmail.com","name":"sheshiyer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-05T22:49:17Z","email":"sheshnarayan.iyer@gmail.com","name":"sheshiyer"},"message":"je-ne-sais-quoi: in-process NIM env loader (no shell-sourcing)\n\ntaste/scripts/lib/load-env.mjs — reads NVIDIA_API_KEY (+ NIM_* overrides) from\nthe user''s env files (~/.claude/.env, ~/.hermes/.env, ~/.codex/.env, ~/.env)\nINSIDE the Node process, never via shell `source` (which is blocked for leaking\nsecrets to subprocesses). Already-set env vars win; values are never logged.\nImported as a side-effect by nim.mjs so any NIM consumer auto-loads the key.\n\nValidated: VLM enrichment returns a well-formed taste_schema on a real Codrops\npreview (Surrealism · Dreamy · Fluid · Monochromatic Blue · Elegant · …) with the\ndefault model meta/llama-3.2-90b-vision-instruct.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0b4285b6a66a8e374b1636a69d8e9faf18ec68cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/git/trees/0b4285b6a66a8e374b1636a69d8e9faf18ec68cb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/git/commits/fbe5d3a106bad13b31b22bc8762e3fc9179621e0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7611727?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer","id":7611727,"login":"Sheshiyer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MTE3Mjc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commit/fbe5d3a106bad13b31b22bc8762e3fc9179621e0","node_id":"C_kwDOSxWr3doAKGZiZTVkM2ExMDZiYWQxM2IzMWIyMmJjODc2MmUzZmM5MTc5NjIxZTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commit/97b08a0c386b24b1c0223a4e4f2ea38540200cce","sha":"97b08a0c386b24b1c0223a4e4f2ea38540200cce","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commits/97b08a0c386b24b1c0223a4e4f2ea38540200cce"}],"sha":"fbe5d3a106bad13b31b22bc8762e3fc9179621e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commits/fbe5d3a106bad13b31b22bc8762e3fc9179621e0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7611727?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer","id":7611727,"login":"Sheshiyer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MTE3Mjc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commits/97b08a0c386b24b1c0223a4e4f2ea38540200cce/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-05T22:41:05Z","email":"sheshnarayan.iyer@gmail.com","name":"sheshiyer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-05T22:41:05Z","email":"sheshnarayan.iyer@gmail.com","name":"sheshiyer"},"message":"je-ne-sais-quoi P0: Codrops corpus tracer (NIM-ready)\n\nThe first phase of the taste right-brain — proves the extraction pipeline on\nreal Codrops data, with VLM enrichment + embeddings gated behind a swappable\nNIM client (activate by setting the key).\n\n- taste/scripts/crawl-codrops.mjs: polite RSS crawl (paginated), per-article\n  og:image (the multi-modal visual) + demo/code link extraction → structured\n  rows {url,title,tags,date,excerpt,demo_url,code_url,screenshot,taste_schema,\n  embedding,source} → taste-corpus.jsonl. Verified: 20/20 rows with previews,\n  20 code links on live Codrops (GSAP, WebGL, scroll, case studies).\n- taste/scripts/lib/nim.mjs: swappable hosted-NIM client — vlmAnnotate (taste\n  schema), embedText (nv-embedqa), embedImage (NV-CLIP). Models env-overridable.\n- taste/scripts/enrich.mjs: NIM-ready VLM enrichment; gates gracefully (exit 0,\n  clear \"pending\" message) when NVIDIA_API_KEY is unset — the corpus is valid\n  either way.\n- taste/README.md: wing overview, pipeline, NIM setup, attribution/ToS.\n- .gitignore: corpus shots + jsonl are runtime data; Codrops preview images are\n  NOT redistributed (kept local for embedding; corpus regenerable via the crawler).\n\nDesign: docs/plans/2026-06-06-je-ne-sais-quoi-taste-engine-design.md.\nNext P1: scale to the curated few-hundred subset; P2: embed + index.\nHealth PASS 0/0; node --check clean.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8a51b340b7466f976db68670d55ffa981c48b0f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/git/trees/8a51b340b7466f976db68670d55ffa981c48b0f4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/git/commits/97b08a0c386b24b1c0223a4e4f2ea38540200cce","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7611727?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer","id":7611727,"login":"Sheshiyer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MTE3Mjc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commit/97b08a0c386b24b1c0223a4e4f2ea38540200cce","node_id":"C_kwDOSxWr3doAKDk3YjA4YTBjMzg2YjI0YjFjMDIyM2E0ZTRmMmVhMzg1NDAyMDBjY2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commit/ebe4bda47854acc494dc8ce5f9a8f41243a8d72a","sha":"ebe4bda47854acc494dc8ce5f9a8f41243a8d72a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commits/ebe4bda47854acc494dc8ce5f9a8f41243a8d72a"}],"sha":"97b08a0c386b24b1c0223a4e4f2ea38540200cce","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commits/97b08a0c386b24b1c0223a4e4f2ea38540200cce"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7611727?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer","id":7611727,"login":"Sheshiyer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MTE3Mjc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commits/ebe4bda47854acc494dc8ce5f9a8f41243a8d72a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-05T22:33:22Z","email":"sheshnarayan.iyer@gmail.com","name":"sheshiyer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-05T22:33:22Z","email":"sheshnarayan.iyer@gmail.com","name":"sheshiyer"},"message":"design: je-ne-sais-quoi taste engine (right brain for skill-clusters)\n\nValidated design for the \"taste\" right-brain that pairs with the skill-clusters\nleft-brain. Captures the indefinable aesthetic quality from Codrops and feeds an\non-brand \"taste brief\" to the capability engine at build time.\n\nDecisions (from brainstorming):\n- Full right-brain: classify → retrieve exemplars → conform to brand-DNA.\n- Tier B: multi-modal (visual+text) NIM embeddings · VLM auto-annotation into a\n  structured taste schema · retrieve→re-rank vs brand prototypes+rules ·\n  preference loop + eval-triplet harness, fine-tune-ready. C-ready (style axes,\n  taste-graph, write-back distillation layer on later).\n- Embed+index now (hosted NIM API), fine-tune later via the loop.\n- One shared taste index + per-brand prototype vectors + explicit rules.\n- Curated recent Codrops subset first (~few hundred), then scale.\n- Name: je-ne-sais-quoi (alias jnsq). First brand: tryambakam-noesis,\n  bootstrapped from real Codrops-skinned sites (aleph1319x, witness-agents,\n  synchronocities-blog, Somatic-Canticles) + brand-docs-final — giving seed\n  prototypes AND free ground-truth triplets.\n\nHome: skill-clusters/taste/ wing; bridge taste-resolve.mjs mirrors resolve-task.mjs;\nloop taste-feedback.mjs mirrors loop-feedback.mjs. Phased P0–P5, tracer-first.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ce5e9ba0ec1b0770e1e8a90660bf0e4b1f870f8b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/git/trees/ce5e9ba0ec1b0770e1e8a90660bf0e4b1f870f8b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/git/commits/ebe4bda47854acc494dc8ce5f9a8f41243a8d72a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7611727?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/followers