","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commits/45dad3c205d8b72fbdf5ea58c3caa6006cd1ddc5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-05T20:02:59Z","email":"sheshnarayan.iyer@gmail.com","name":"sheshiyer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-05T20:02:59Z","email":"sheshnarayan.iyer@gmail.com","name":"sheshiyer"},"message":"docs: regenerate README + all internal pages (README-generator skill)\n\nFull visual-storytelling regeneration via the README Generator skill, with the\ndata brought current (40 clusters / 716 indexed / 54 enumerated / 27 active /\n13 deferred) and the closed-loop story told for the first time.\n\nRoot README (closed-loop-first, plastic badges, readme-gen markers):\n- Hero + the 4-organ loop (PAI · spec-kit · conducty · skill-clusters) with a\n  mermaid of the cycle; resolver called out as the organ none of the others have.\n- How-a-cluster-works; full 40-cluster catalog grouped by provenance\n  (flagship pilots · conductor · ECC-extracted · curated/newer); two execution\n  modalities (local vs github-delivery); debloat (716→54, −92%); tooling table;\n  ALL contributions (ECC · conducty · antigravity · explee · vercel-labs +\n  the user''s swarm-architect/github-next-wave); capsule footer.\n\n40 per-cluster pages (regenerated in parallel, one agent each, from real index +\norigin data): capsule banner · plastic badges (tier/spokes/source/install) ·\nmermaid hub-and-spoke (capped at ~10 representative spokes) · full skills table ·\ntier & loading · install · accurate origin attribution · back-link footer.\nVerified: 40/40 have banner+plastic+mermaid+footer, 0 PAI-artifact leaks,\nmermaid template valid (rust render valid:true; big graphs render on GitHub).\n\ndocs/: ROADMAP redone (journey: pilots→ECC→conducty→closed loop + forward\nroadmap) · ECC-EXTRACTION-PLAN status banner (✅ complete, historical) ·\nHARNESS-HANDOFF current-state anchor. CONDUCTOR-INTEGRATION already current.\n\n.readme-gen.json: badgeStyle=plastic saved for future --update merges.\nHealth PASS 0/0.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7a8c4729eb886b1f794214b249d03552b4436e52","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/git/trees/7a8c4729eb886b1f794214b249d03552b4436e52"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/git/commits/45dad3c205d8b72fbdf5ea58c3caa6006cd1ddc5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7611727?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer","id":7611727,"login":"Sheshiyer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MTE3Mjc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commit/45dad3c205d8b72fbdf5ea58c3caa6006cd1ddc5","node_id":"C_kwDOSxWr3doAKDQ1ZGFkM2MyMDVkOGI3MmZiZGY1ZWE1OGMzY2FhNjAwNmNkMWRkYzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commit/348675af86d3ba752f8d2b86396977e07c155c5c","sha":"348675af86d3ba752f8d2b86396977e07c155c5c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commits/348675af86d3ba752f8d2b86396977e07c155c5c"}],"sha":"45dad3c205d8b72fbdf5ea58c3caa6006cd1ddc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commits/45dad3c205d8b72fbdf5ea58c3caa6006cd1ddc5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7611727?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer","id":7611727,"login":"Sheshiyer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MTE3Mjc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commits/348675af86d3ba752f8d2b86396977e07c155c5c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-05T18:48:02Z","email":"sheshnarayan.iyer@gmail.com","name":"sheshiyer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-05T18:48:02Z","email":"sheshnarayan.iyer@gmail.com","name":"sheshiyer"},"message":"Wire swarm-architect + github-next-wave as the GitHub-delivery modality\n\nRecognize the user''s two frequently-used delivery orchestrators as a second\nexecution MODALITY of the conductor loop, alongside the local-subagent path.\nKept in place (swarm-architect in ai-agents-meta, github-next-wave in\ngit-pr-ops) per decision; wired via cross-refs + the shared organs.\n\nThe modality axis (classifier proposes, resolver validates):\n- resolve-task.mjs --modality <local|github-delivery>: the conductor proposes a\n  modality; the resolver VALIDATES it against detected work-shape signals (issues,\n  PRs, copilot, swarm/wave/worktree language) + orchestrator availability. Phantom\n  modality → reject+fallback; proposed≠detected → flag. Per-task CLUSTER is\n  identical across modalities (capability loadout); modality adds a per-task LANE\n  hint (human 👤 / copilot-swe-agent[bot] 🤖) for the github path.\n- github-delivery routes: Plan→swarm-architect, Execute→github-next-wave-\n  orchestrator, Gate→ship-battery.mjs (fail-closed), Close→loop-feedback.mjs.\n- loop-feedback.mjs now records + rolls up modality usage and the human/copilot\n  lane split — the close sees which modality each cycle used.\n\nSmoke: a GitHub-delivery plan auto-detected (16 signals), routed swarm→next-wave,\nsplit 3 human / 2 copilot, each task still cluster-resolved (frontend-web,\nai-agents-meta, devops-infra, git-pr-ops); --modality proposal validates and\nrejects phantoms.\n\nCross-refs (keep-in-place): conductor-core §4 (delivery modalities table),\nconductor-orchestrator (modality routing + github sub-flow), and a note in both\nspoke copies pointing to their full source repos (swarm-architect''s runbooks/\nplaybooks/OpenViking/Superset/Copilot-bootstrap + next-wave''s .github templates\nlive in the source repos, not the condensed spoke copies).\n\nHealth PASS 0/0; node --check clean. docs/CONDUCTOR-INTEGRATION.md updated.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e88667b5a2146bb26cdd92f80df22d93c65f12e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/git/trees/e88667b5a2146bb26cdd92f80df22d93c65f12e8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/git/commits/348675af86d3ba752f8d2b86396977e07c155c5c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7611727?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer","id":7611727,"login":"Sheshiyer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MTE3Mjc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commit/348675af86d3ba752f8d2b86396977e07c155c5c","node_id":"C_kwDOSxWr3doAKDM0ODY3NWFmODZkM2JhNzUyZjhkMmI4NjM5Njk3N2UwN2MxNTVjNWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commit/e2c33949d8a5fba8341cedffcf8c48e6abff6f37","sha":"e2c33949d8a5fba8341cedffcf8c48e6abff6f37","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commits/e2c33949d8a5fba8341cedffcf8c48e6abff6f37"}],"sha":"348675af86d3ba752f8d2b86396977e07c155c5c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commits/348675af86d3ba752f8d2b86396977e07c155c5c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7611727?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer","id":7611727,"login":"Sheshiyer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MTE3Mjc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commits/e2c33949d8a5fba8341cedffcf8c48e6abff6f37/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-05T18:15:03Z","email":"sheshnarayan.iyer@gmail.com","name":"sheshiyer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-05T18:15:03Z","email":"sheshnarayan.iyer@gmail.com","name":"sheshiyer"},"message":"Phase 4+5: fail-closed ship gate + closed-loop feedback (full integration)\n\nCompletes the closed loop across PAI · spec-kit · conducty · skill-clusters.\n\nPhase 4 — fail-closed gates (scripts/ship-battery.mjs):\n- Project-generic ship gate. Required gates exit NON-ZERO on failure (fail-closed):\n  structural (skills-health when a skills repo) · secrets (high-precision real\n  credential formats: AKIA / private-key / gh_ / sk- / xox-) · lint · typecheck ·\n  tests (run only when the project declares them). Advisory: secrets-heuristic\n  (placeholder-filtered inline assignments) + gitclean.\n- Proven both ways: planted AWS key → HOLD(secrets) exit 1; this repo (2528 files)\n  → SHIP exit 0, with example-doc passwords correctly downgraded to advisory so a\n  docs-heavy skills repo isn''t blocked by api_key=\"your-key\".\n- --warn-only previews; --json for machines. Wired into conductor-orchestrator\n  Ship row + conductor-core guardrails.\n\nPhase 5 — close the feedback (scripts/loop-feedback.mjs):\n- --record appends each conductor cycle (clusters dispatched, deferred activated,\n  escalations, classifier overrides/phantoms/bad-skills, ship verdict) to\n  feedback/loop-log.jsonl. --rollup aggregates into the signal the NEXT plan reads:\n  promote hot deferred clusters · retune high-override resolutions · author clusters\n  the classifier keeps phantom-proposing · harden gates that keep failing.\n- Full closed-loop smoke (resolve→ship→record→rollup, 2 cycles) surfaced\n  mobile-flutter as a promote-candidate and secrets as a process weak point.\n- feedback/*.jsonl git-ignored (runtime state); feedback/README.md documents the loop.\n\nLive-PAI enforcement upgrades (exit(0)→exit(2) flip; commit-on-criterion PostToolUse\nhook) are left as DOCUMENTED OPT-INS, not auto-applied — keeps the daily driver stable.\n\nAll 6 phases (0–5) now built + smoke-passed. Health PASS 0/0; node --check clean.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cfc3950a09fbf6f0f4b2b0f75379f82d1d27b70b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/git/trees/cfc3950a09fbf6f0f4b2b0f75379f82d1d27b70b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/git/commits/e2c33949d8a5fba8341cedffcf8c48e6abff6f37","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7611727?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer","id":7611727,"login":"Sheshiyer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MTE3Mjc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commit/e2c33949d8a5fba8341cedffcf8c48e6abff6f37","node_id":"C_kwDOSxWr3doAKGUyYzMzOTQ5ZDhhNWZiYTgzNDFjZWRmZmNmOGM0OGU2YWJmZjZmMzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commit/f32517104214f12c1c09ad63e1d6f5768d59a3cd","sha":"f32517104214f12c1c09ad63e1d6f5768d59a3cd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commits/f32517104214f12c1c09ad63e1d6f5768d59a3cd"}],"sha":"e2c33949d8a5fba8341cedffcf8c48e6abff6f37","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commits/e2c33949d8a5fba8341cedffcf8c48e6abff6f37"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7611727?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer","id":7611727,"login":"Sheshiyer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MTE3Mjc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commits/f32517104214f12c1c09ad63e1d6f5768d59a3cd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-05T18:08:44Z","email":"sheshnarayan.iyer@gmail.com","name":"sheshiyer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-05T18:08:44Z","email":"sheshnarayan.iyer@gmail.com","name":"sheshiyer"},"message":"Phase 3: classifier proposes, resolver validates (--propose + phantom audit)\n\nThe Phase 3 \"classifier line\" — built repo-side, zero PAI bloat.\n\nresolve-task.mjs --propose <file.json | id=cluster,id=cluster>:\n- The classifier is the conductor LLM itself (it already reads each task), so no\n  new ~/.claude hook is installed — it just emits proposals and feeds them back.\n- The resolver VALIDATES each proposal against skill-index.json:\n    · real cluster      → accept, override the keyword guess (source:classifier,\n                          ◇! / overrode when it beats keyword)\n    · phantom cluster    → REJECT, keep the keyword result (phantoms[])\n    · skill not in cluster → flag (badSkills[])\n  This is PAI''s Capability-Name audit applied to dispatch.\n- New output: source, proposed, agreed, overrode, phantom, skill/skillReal +\n  top-level phantoms / overrides / badSkills; human view shows ◇=/◇! markers and\n  a \"N validated · M overrode · K phantom rejected\" summary line.\n\nRefactor: shared describe(cluster) helper feeds both the keyword resolver and the\nclassifier-override path. clusterIsReal() = phantom-proof gate.\n\nconducty-execute Resolve step documents the propose→validate path; the conductor\nproposes, resolve-task validates, SkillClusterResolver hook enforces at runtime.\n\nSmoke (5 tasks): override expo→frontend-web, agree rust/flutter/supabase,\nphantom-cluster-xyz REJECTED→kept creative-frontend, bad-skill flagged. Inline\nform verified. Health PASS 0/0; node --check clean.\n\ndocs/CONDUCTOR-INTEGRATION.md: Phase 3 ✅.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b47d996601697a4d1d974339ee1be32fc0718365","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/git/trees/b47d996601697a4d1d974339ee1be32fc0718365"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/git/commits/f32517104214f12c1c09ad63e1d6f5768d59a3cd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7611727?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer","id":7611727,"login":"Sheshiyer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MTE3Mjc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commit/f32517104214f12c1c09ad63e1d6f5768d59a3cd","node_id":"C_kwDOSxWr3doAKGYzMjUxNzEwNDIxNGYxMmMxYzA5YWQ2M2UxZDZmNTc2OGQ1OWEzY2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commit/02c4477d6b915fb129f2c11bd5c2065d43ef9aad","sha":"02c4477d6b915fb129f2c11bd5c2065d43ef9aad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commits/02c4477d6b915fb129f2c11bd5c2065d43ef9aad"}],"sha":"f32517104214f12c1c09ad63e1d6f5768d59a3cd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commits/f32517104214f12c1c09ad63e1d6f5768d59a3cd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7611727?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer","id":7611727,"login":"Sheshiyer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MTE3Mjc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commits/02c4477d6b915fb129f2c11bd5c2065d43ef9aad/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-05T18:05:03Z","email":"sheshnarayan.iyer@gmail.com","name":"sheshiyer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-05T18:05:03Z","email":"sheshnarayan.iyer@gmail.com","name":"sheshiyer"},"message":"Phase 2: wire conducty Execute → resolver (real dispatch, not general-purpose)\n\nMake the resolver wiring actually run instead of just documented.\n\nconducty-execute patched (the spoke that does the dispatching):\n- New \"Resolve before dispatch (skill-clusters wiring)\" step: run\n  resolve-task.mjs per group → load the resolved <cluster>-orchestrator into\n  the subagent (curation item 1.5) → tier.mjs --activate deferred clusters →\n  fail closed via the SkillClusterResolver hook. subagent_type stays\n  general-purpose; the capability comes from the loaded hub.\n- origin updated to note the local patch.\n\nResolver scoring hardened v1 → v1.5 (the Phase 2 tracer drove every fix):\nA mixed RN/Rust/Flutter/Remotion/Supabase smoke collapsed 5/5 tasks onto\nfrontend-web under v1. Fixes, each surfaced by re-running the tracer:\n  1. IDF weighting        — distinctive tokens (rust/flutter/remotion) win over\n                            common ones; kills big-cluster keyword mass.\n  2. sqrt-dampen mass     — a cluster with five *-auth spokes can''t get 5x credit.\n  3. handle-match bonus   — a task that literally names a cluster prefers it.\n  4. drop stack-pollution — plan.md global stack no longer folded into scoring\n                            (it re-inflated the project''s dominant frontend stack\n                            onto every task); reserved as Phase 3 classifier context.\n  5. unique tokens        — presence, not frequency: \"auth\" x3 in a Rust task no\n                            longer swamps the lone \"rust\" signal.\nResult: 5/5 on the smoke (T002 Rust→rust, T003 Flutter→mobile-flutter w/ ◆activate).\n\nHonest residual: genuinely ambiguous stack-vs-domain tasks remain the\nclassifier''s job (Phase 3) — the keyword floor is now solid, not a guess.\n\ndocs/CONDUCTOR-INTEGRATION.md: Phase 1 + Phase 2 marked ✅; seam 3 → v1.5.\nHealth PASS 0/0; node --check clean.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d8690954bea3f89a9af552ca210c84f8100a8627","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/git/trees/d8690954bea3f89a9af552ca210c84f8100a8627"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/git/commits/02c4477d6b915fb129f2c11bd5c2065d43ef9aad","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7611727?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer","id":7611727,"login":"Sheshiyer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MTE3Mjc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commit/02c4477d6b915fb129f2c11bd5c2065d43ef9aad","node_id":"C_kwDOSxWr3doAKDAyYzQ0NzdkNmI5MTVmYjEyOWYyYzExYmQ1YzIwNjVkNDNlZjlhYWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commit/0593053409d9cb4a5a5967af169f8f481d987f57","sha":"0593053409d9cb4a5a5967af169f8f481d987f57","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commits/0593053409d9cb4a5a5967af169f8f481d987f57"}],"sha":"02c4477d6b915fb129f2c11bd5c2065d43ef9aad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commits/02c4477d6b915fb129f2c11bd5c2065d43ef9aad"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7611727?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer","id":7611727,"login":"Sheshiyer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MTE3Mjc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commits/0593053409d9cb4a5a5967af169f8f481d987f57/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-05T17:55:58Z","email":"sheshnarayan.iyer@gmail.com","name":"sheshiyer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-05T17:55:58Z","email":"sheshnarayan.iyer@gmail.com","name":"sheshiyer"},"message":"Phase 1: vendor conducty as the `conductor` cluster (closed-loop integration)\n\nAdopt conducty (robertbarclayy/conducty, MIT) the debloat-consistent way —\nvendor its loop skills as on-demand spokes rather than running its installer\n(which would bloat ~/.claude and edit CLAUDE.md).\n\nWhat landed:\n- skills/conductor-orchestrator + conductor-core: the integration glue. The\n  orchestrator runs conducty''s cycle (shape→plan→trace→execute→verify→improve\n  →review→ship) but wires the Execute step to scripts/resolve-task.mjs so each\n  task dispatches to the resolved <cluster>-orchestrator (replacing conducty''s\n  hard-coded general-purpose dispatch) and auto-activates deferred clusters.\n  conductor-core carries the four-organ integration contract.\n- 19 vendored conducty-* loop skills, stamped cluster:conductor / version /\n  origin:\"robertbarclayy/conducty (MIT)\". On-demand spokes (enumerated:false).\n- skills.sh.json: +conductor grouping (21 skills) → 40 clusters.\n- profiles.json: conductor → active tier (27 active / 13 deferred).\n- skill-index.json regenerated: 2 active-hub (enumerated) + 19 active-spoke.\n- NOTICE: conducty MIT attribution.\n\nDebloat invariant holds: only the 2 hubs enumerate at CLI startup (54 total\nactive-hub); the 19 loop skills load on demand from the pointer.\n\nHealth: PASS 0 errors / 0 warnings. Hubs deployed + spokes reachable verified.\nImplements docs/CONDUCTOR-INTEGRATION.md Phase 1 (→ Phase 2 wires Execute live).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"db09d533832671d6d573f8259e1c92af6cdd12f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/git/trees/db09d533832671d6d573f8259e1c92af6cdd12f4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/git/commits/0593053409d9cb4a5a5967af169f8f481d987f57","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7611727?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer","id":7611727,"login":"Sheshiyer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MTE3Mjc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commit/0593053409d9cb4a5a5967af169f8f481d987f57","node_id":"C_kwDOSxWr3doAKDA1OTMwNTM0MDlkOWNiNGE1YTU5NjdhZjE2OWY4ZjQ4MWQ5ODdmNTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commit/587018445b13dc8d5d06e8c919fa1de2127460e4","sha":"587018445b13dc8d5d06e8c919fa1de2127460e4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/commits/587018445b13dc8d5d06e8c919fa1de2127460e4"}],"sha":"0593053409d9cb4a5a5967af169f8f481d987f57","url":"https://api.github.