ctive ~/.claude config for hardcoded\n  .agents/skills/<name> paths to moved skills. Currently 0 stale refs.\n- docs/HARNESS-HANDOFF.md: the resolution contract + what''s verified-unaffected (PAI SKILLSYSTEM\n  uses ~/.claude/skills; SkillGuard string-matches; gsd agents tolerant; harness re-scans).\n- package.json: index, audit-refs scripts.\n\nNOTE (deployed outside this repo): ~/.claude/hooks/SkillClusterResolver.hook.ts (PreToolUse,\nmatcher Skill, fail-open) registered in ~/.claude/settings.json alongside SkillGuard — it returns\nresolution guidance for archived/deferred/spoke skill invocations instead of a confusing miss.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"57aecf9f075f59ac70efb1d4c301d32adf65f3af","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/git/trees/57aecf9f075f59ac70efb1d4c301d32adf65f3af"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/git/commits/8991067078cc5b467e390cfa927704ccb60abb66","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7611727?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer","id":7611727,"login":"Sheshiyer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MTE3Mjc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://ap