idated by the Skills-Health gate.\n\n- 21 new clusters (each: orchestrator + core + de-ECC''d spokes): rust, native-ios,\n  ai-agents-meta, quality-eval, frontend-web, python-backend, jvm, php-laravel,\n  systems-languages, mobile-flutter, backend-architecture, databases-data,\n  devops-infra, security, healthcare, blockchain-web3, research-knowledge,\n  business-content, social-media, agentic-ops, supply-chain\n- skills.sh.json: 27 groupings, 311 skills\n- NOTICE: MIT attribution to affaan-m/ECC\n- skills-health.mjs hardened: YAML block-scalar + CRLF frontmatter parsing\n- scripts/integrate-ecc.mjs: manifest merge; authored blockchain-web3-core;\n  fixed 5 scientific-* name!=dir mismatches\n- health: 0 errors / 175 advisory warnings\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b52e7fc98882af23a8b1af11a5990c0aa397d765","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/git/trees/b52e7fc98882af23a8b1af11a5990c0aa397d765"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/git/commits/f938bf0880bb061647e7e1faf1b1579f3b9b2fe0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7611727?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sheshiyer","id":7611727,"login":"Sheshiyer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MTE3Mjc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/starred{/owner}{/repo}