,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-04T21:26:12Z","email":"sheshnarayan.iyer@gmail.com","name":"sheshiyer"},"message":"feat: Skills-Health structural gate (the drift firewall ECC lacked)\n\nECC ships 10 schemas but none for SKILL.md frontmatter -> version on only 25/251 skills,\nlive superseded skills, 54 orphans. This adds the structural gate that prevents all three.\n\n- schemas/skill-frontmatter.schema.json: the frontmatter contract (name/description required;\n  cluster/version/origin/supersedes recommended)\n- scripts/skills-health.mjs: zero-dep validator -> schema check, name==dir, manifest<->disk\n  reconciliation (NO orphans), live-supersession ERROR, dead-symlink check. Fails closed (exit 1).\n- scripts/skills-normalize.mjs: backfill cluster (derived from manifest) + version into frontmatter\n- scripts/link-agents.sh: runs the gate before --apply (deploy blocked on failure; --skip-health override)\n- package.json: npm run health / health:json / normalize / link / link:apply\n- 76 skills normalized (cluster + version added); gate PASSES 0 errors / 47 advisory warnings\n\nProven fail-closed: orphan + name!=dir + short-desc -> 3 errors, exit 1.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"73570247e78d3525c760cf7ce46839766ca6a3da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/git/trees/73570247e78d3525c760cf7ce46839766ca6a3da"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sheshiyer/skill-clusters/git/commits/cc811a7d77146f4ed95a1f091afe47abb0ca9fab","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7611727?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sheshiyer/gists{/gist_id}","grav