ch what the project actually is\n\nIt was the pre-build spec, so most of it described a different project.\nCorrected:\n\n- renamed Orbit -> Facet throughout\n- dropped Pinia and SCSS: neither is used, and \"shared Pinia store\" directly\n  contradicts the decision the project is built on\n- React 18 -> 19, added Vite 8 / TypeScript 6\n- the shared layer was described as \"federated as singletons, so host and\n  remotes share one instance\" — the exact opposite of what the code does.\n  Replaced with the real mechanism: the store is injected by reference\n  through the mount() contract, precisely because module singletons do not\n  survive federated bundle boundaries\n- the host was credited with routing, theming and a global search bar; it has\n  none of them, it owns the store and mounts the remotes\n- local development listed pnpm dev / build / test / e2e root scripts that do\n  not exist; documented the real three-terminal, preview-not-dev workflow\n- the collection remote was described with comparison, detail and chart views;\n  it renders the shortlist count\n- adapter code samples updated to the real signatures (injectable store,\n  onScopeDispose instead of onMounted/onUnmounted)\n- roadmap checkboxes reflect the phases actually completed\n- added a Status table, and the trade-offs found while building: virtualization\n  vs. keyboard access, replaceState vs. pushState, hand-synced props across the\n  federated boundary, the single-Vue-copy pnpm override\n\nAlso deleted the three untouched Vite scaffold READMEs under apps/.","tree":{"sha":"73de6bbca324f666cfe4059435078aaea495e710","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuigiP2404/Facet/git/trees/73de6bbca324f666cfe4059435078aaea495e710"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuigiP2404/Facet/git/commits/6e5c967006a4062992b33c889439a6ff5e79e5b5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71146060?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuigiP2404/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuigiP2404/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuigiP2404/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuigiP2404/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LuigiP2404","id":71146060,"login":"LuigiP2404","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMTQ2MDYw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuigiP2404/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuigiP2404/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuigiP2404/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuigiP2404/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuigiP2404/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuigiP2404","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/LuigiP2404/Facet/commit/6e5c967006a4062992b33c889439a6ff5e79e5b5","node_id":"C_kwDOSxXhOdoAKDZlNWM5NjcwMDZhNDA2Mjk5MmIzM2M4ODk0MzlhNmZmNWU3OWU1YjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LuigiP2404/Facet/commit/63e72541fc31fe5489d9349c8fe83a74ca931149","sha":"63e72541fc31fe5489d9349c8fe83a74ca931149","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuigiP2404/Facet/commits/63e72541fc31fe5489d9349c8fe83a74ca931149"}],"sha":"6e5c967006a4062992b33c889439a6ff5e79e5b5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuigiP2404/Facet/commits/6e5c967006a4062992b33c889439a6ff5e79e5b5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71146060?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuigiP2404/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuigiP2404/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuigiP2404/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuigiP2404/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LuigiP2404","id":71146060,"login":"LuigiP2404","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMTQ2MDYw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuigiP2404/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuigiP2404/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuigiP2404/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuigiP2404/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuigiP2404/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuigiP2404","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuigiP2404/Facet/commits/63e72541fc31fe5489d9349c8fe83a74ca931149/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-25T15:06:03Z","email":"luigipaglionicofed@gmail.com","name":"LuigiP2404"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-25T15:06:03Z","email":"luigipaglionicofed@gmail.com","name":"LuigiP2404"},"message":"completed phases 2, 4 and 5: collection remote, search facets, virtualization, a11y\n\nPhase 4 — search remote (React):\n- ranking presets (balanced/popular/quality) + author/scope qualifiers\n- URL sync extended to q/author/scope/sort, defaults kept out of the URL\n- virtualized result list (@tanstack/react-virtual), size raised 20 -> 100\n- a11y pass: labels, role=search form, always-mounted live status region,\n  aria-pressed chips, and aria-setsize/posinset so screen readers see the\n  whole list instead of only the rows currently in the DOM\n\nPhase 2 — federation:\n- apps/collection scaffolded as a second remote (Vue, :5175)\n- single Vue copy enforced via overrides in pnpm-workspace.yaml, and verified\n  at runtime: shared: [''vue''] really loads one copy in the browser\n- each remote loaded in its own try/catch, so one dead preview server does\n  not take the other remote down with it\n\nPhase 5 — cross-framework shared state:\n- Vue store adapter made injectable; it was hardcoded on the module instance,\n  which only worked because its sole consumer was the host\n- remove action wired on both sides\n- three separately built bundles, two frameworks, one live store instance\n\nCleanup: dropped the unused Vite scaffold (demo pages, assets, icons and the\n296-line stylesheet whose :root variables would have clashed with @facet/tokens),\nturned App.tsx/App.vue into standalone harnesses for each remote, removed the\nvestigial search/hello smoke test, and fixed .gitignore (dist, -> dist, + .mf/).","tree":{"sha":"93b9b17a2bf9cb23e0c08c2761ac1863de763469","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuigiP2404/Facet/git/trees/93b9b17a2bf9cb23e0c08c2761ac1863de763469"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuigiP2404/Facet/git/commits/63e72541fc31fe5489d9349c8fe83a74ca931149","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71146060?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuigiP2404/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuigiP2404/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuigiP2404/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuigiP2404/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LuigiP2404","id":71146060,"login":"LuigiP2404","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMTQ2MDYw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuigiP2404/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuigiP2404/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuigiP2404/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuigiP2404/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuigiP2404/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuigiP2404","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/LuigiP2404/Facet/commit/63e72541fc31fe5489d9349c8fe83a74ca931149","node_id":"C_kwDOSxXhOdoAKDYzZTcyNTQxZmMzMWZlNTQ4OWQ5MzQ5YzhmZTgzYTc0Y2E5MzExNDk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LuigiP2404/Facet/commit/c70358ccd6a11fa9492cfd13b8db8ce486896358","sha":"c703