rAction high-level API for end-to-end Linux desktop control\n\n- New exported function executeComputerAction that the Computer Use engine can call directly\n- Automatically routes advanced Linux actions (xdotool) when on Linux\n- Clean integration point for the main agent loop\n- Keeps all existing behavior on macOS and other platforms\n\nThis completes the core wiring phase for real Linux desktop computer-use.","tree":{"sha":"4724752b386aa927e86e19296dbd17ef7d29922c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nilsenm/siraGPT/git/trees/4724752b386aa927e86e19296dbd17ef7d29922c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nilsenm/siraGPT/git/commits/c0e02b281202c47077e7a35693e67167c33a1c39","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/nilsenm/siraGPT/commit/c0e02b281202c47077e7a35693e67167c33a1c39","node_id":"C_kwDOSxaPaNoAKGMwZTAyYjI4MTIwMmM0NzA3N2U3YTM1NjkzZTY3MTY3YzMzYTFjMzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/nilsenm/siraGPT/commit/4102567192842d51fae75add9e0fee112d3b6f0a","sha":"4102567192842d51fae75add9e0fee112d3b6f0a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nilsenm/siraGPT/commits/4102567192842d51fae75add9e0fee112d3b6f0a"}],"sha":"c0e02b281202c47077e7a35693e67167c33a1c39","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nilsenm/siraGPT/commits/c0e02b281202c47077e7a35693e67167c33a1c39"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nilsenm/siraGPT/commits/4102567192842d51fae75add9e0fee112d3b6f0a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-04T16:54:59Z","email":"siragpt@siragpt.io","name":"SiraGPT Bot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-04T16:54:59Z","email":"siragpt@siragpt.io","name":"SiraGPT Bot"},"message":"fix(ci): stabilize Linux bridge follow-up","tree":{"sha":"a8d231056fb017ffbff6f22297c65bf2955b99d1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nilsenm/siraGPT/git/trees/a8d231056fb017ffbff6f22297c65bf2955b99d1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ni