t.io","name":"SiraGPT Bot"},"message":"fix(models): preserve image catalog activation state","tree":{"sha":"b373d6d4e2dff6e5aeb5d6b249448425a719aea4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nilsenm/siraGPT/git/trees/b373d6d4e2dff6e5aeb5d6b249448425a719aea4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nilsenm/siraGPT/git/commits/11821e5c58bfbd9e8705355ebdca3e4d091565b9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/nilsenm/siraGPT/commit/11821e5c58bfbd9e8705355ebdca3e4d091565b9","node_id":"C_kwDOSxaPaNoAKDExODIxZTVjNThiZmJkOWU4NzA1MzU1ZWJkY2EzZTRkMDkxNTY1Yjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/nilsenm/siraGPT/commit/10fc8a857146b63e41eaa93b084c42ae20f5e625","sha":"10fc8a857146b63e41eaa93b084c42ae20f5e625","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nilsenm/siraGPT/commits/10fc8a857146b63e41eaa93b084c42ae20f5e625"}],"sha":"11821e5c58bfbd9e8705355ebdca3e4d091565b9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nilsenm/siraGPT/commits/11821e5c58bfbd9e8705355ebdca3e4d091565b9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/207944715?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/replit-agent/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/replit-agent/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/replit-agent/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/replit-agent/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/replit-agent","id":207944715,"login":"replit-agent","node_id":"U_kgDODGT8Cw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/replit-agent/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/replit-agent/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/replit-agent/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/replit-agent/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/replit-agent/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/replit-agent","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nilsenm/siraGPT/commits/b30555cb235c0ad8e336bef161f6e31addd6243b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-03T21:24:22Z","email":"agent@replit.com","name":"Replit Agent"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-03T21:24:22Z","email":"agent@replit.com","name":"Replit Agent"},"message":"Fix recent-turns leak, keyless web search, multi-provider image gen\n\nThree-part task on the SiraGPT backend:\n\n1. \"[Recent user turns]\" leak: the conversation-memory filter module declares\n   enabled:false (its extraContext fold once leaked into the visible prompt),\n   but FILTERS_CONFIG hard-overrode it to true. Set the registry default to\n   false to match the module intent (belt-and-suspenders with the prior ai.js\n   extraContext-fold removal).\n\n2. Keyless web search for all models: free-tier fallback made injectable.\n   web-search-tools freeTierSearch accepts opts.freeSearch; searchFreshContext\n   gated by opts.disableFreeTier; gateway-adapter enrichWithWebSearch forwards\n   both.\n\n3. Multi-provider image generation: added 3 fal.ai IMAGE models + provider\n   ''Fal'' to the manifest, exported DEFAULT_ACTIVE_IMAGE_MODEL_NAMES (curated\n   active set across OpenAI/Gemini/OpenRouter/Fal). ai.js gains generateFalImage\n   + falImageSizeFor + a Fal branch in generateSingleImage; Fal edits redirect\n   to Gemini/OpenAI. model-sync seeds curated models active on create.\n\nDeviation from plan (architect review): the curated-IMAGE force-reactivation\noriginally ran on every /models read and /generate-image call, silently\noverriding admin deactivations. Gated it behind a per-instance\n_curatedImageActivationDone flag so it runs once per process (prod singleton)\nwhile tests on fresh instances still exercise it. Kept the curated allow-list\nin the picker/generate gate intentionally (curateVisibleAdminMediaModels must\nnever surface broken picker entries); the curated set already spans all\nimage-capable providers.\n\nConcurrency fix (production P2002), robust two-layer approach:\nensureStaticCatalogModels does findMany then create and runs on hot paths\n(/ai/models read, /admin/models/sync), so concurrent identical invocations raced\nto create the same aiModel row — the loser threw P2002 and 500''d \"Get models\".\n  Layer 1 (root cause): single-flight wrapper. Concurrent calls keyed by sorted,\n  de-duplicated type signature share one in-flight promise (this._ensureCatalogInFlight\n  Map), cleared in .finally so failures are never memoized and later calls re-run.\n  The original body moved to _ensureStaticCatalogModelsImpl.\n  Layer 2 (backstop): per-row create wrapped in try/catch — on P2002 fall back to a\n  metadata update WITHOUT isActive (preserve admin activation state); rethrow other\n  errors. Guards residual cross-scope races (e.g. all-types admin sync vs IMAGE read).\n\nTests: model-admin-image-catalog now covers fal models + activation semantics,\nP2002 recovery, non-P2002 propagation, single-flight dedupe, failure non-memoization,\nand mixed-scope cross-race fallback. filters-pipeline updated. Wired\norchestration-web-search, orchestration-gateway-adapter, filters-pipeline, and\nmodel-admin-image-catalog into the backend CI test string. Workflow boots clean.","tree":{"sha":"692e02dd31aae5ccec9851afc35fbcd9c9edab9b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nilsenm/siraGPT/git/trees/692e02dd31aae5ccec9851afc35fbcd9c9edab9b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nilsenm/siraGPT/git/commits/b30555cb235c0ad8e336bef161f6e31addd6243b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/207944715?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/replit-agent/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/replit-agent/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/replit-agent/fo