{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/207944715?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/replit-agent/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/replit-agent/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/replit-agent/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/replit-agent/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/replit-agent","id":207944715,"login":"replit-agent","node_id":"U_kgDODGT8Cw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/replit-agent/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/replit-agent/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/replit-agent/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/replit-agent/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/replit-agent/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/replit-agent","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nilsenm/siraGPT/commits/0a9d90ffb311457e5a0120e08cacd2da492c2442/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-03T20:02:03Z","email":"agent@replit.com","name":"Replit Agent"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-03T20:12:06Z","email":"infosiragpt@gmail.com","name":"infosiragpt-ops"},"message":"Fix recent-turns leak, keyless web search, multi-provider image gen\n\nThree-part task on the SiraGPT backend:\n\n1. \"[Recent user turns]\" leak: the conversation-memory filter module declares\n   enabled:false (its extraContext fold once leaked into the visible prompt),\n   but FILTERS_CONFIG hard-overrode it to true. Set the registry default to\n   false to match the module intent (belt-and-suspenders with the prior ai.js\n   extraContext-fold removal).\n\n2. Keyless web search for all models: free-tier fallback made injectable.\n   web-search-tools freeTierSearch accepts opts.freeSearch; searchFreshContext\n   gated by opts.disableFreeTier; gateway-adapter enrichWithWebSearch forwards\n   both.\n\n3. Multi-provider image generation: added 3 fal.ai IMAGE models + provider\n   ''Fal'' to the manifest, exported DEFAULT_ACTIVE_IMAGE_MODEL_NAMES (curated\n   active set across OpenAI/Gemini/OpenRouter/Fal). ai.js gains generateFalImage\n   + falImageSizeFor + a Fal branch in generateSingleImage; Fal edits redirect\n   to Gemini/OpenAI. model-sync seeds curated models active on create.\n\nDeviation from plan (architect review): the curated-IMAGE force-reactivation\noriginally ran on every /models read and /generate-image call, silently\noverriding admin deactivations. Gated it behind a per-instance\n_curatedImageActivationDone flag so it runs once per process (prod singleton)\nwhile tests on fresh instances still exercise it. Kept the curated allow-list\nin the picker/generate gate intentionally (curateVisibleAdminMediaModels must\nnever surface broken picker entries); the curated set already spans all\nimage-capable providers.\n\nTests: updated model-admin-image-catalog (fal models + activation semantics)\nand filters-pipeline; wired orchestration-web-search, orchestration-gateway-\nadapter, filters-pipeline, and model-admin-image-catalog into the backend CI\ntest string. Workflow boots clean.","tree":{"sha":"852de05b28f7bcd19d3871e693a962fa2dca591a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nilsenm/siraGPT/git/trees/852de05b28f7bcd19d3871e693a962fa2dca591a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nilsenm/siraGPT/git/commits/0a9d90ffb311457e5a0120e08cacd2da492c2442","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/243045210?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/infosiragpt-ops/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/infosiragpt-ops/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/infosiragpt-ops/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/infosiragpt-op