tController per-probe timeout, post-deploy warm-up hint.\n- backend/tests/health-snapshot.test.js: 10 node:test cases (mock fetch).\n- package.json: `ops:health` npm script.\n- .agents/skills/release-maintainer/SKILL.md: documents the command + its\n  validation command, with OpenClaw attribution.\n\nCode review (architect) flagged a false-green: liveness up + /health wedged was\nmapped to degraded→exit 0. Fixed to exit 1 (unhealthy); warm-up hint now only\napplies to authoritative composite \"unhealthy\" with checks. Added 3 tests.\n\nValidations: 10/10 tests pass; skill:validate:agents issues=[]; git diff --check\nclean; verify-ui-lock.sh OK (zero frontend changes). Backend-only, no UI changes.","tree":{"sha":"88d7b2d881d48500b7a23b13b5d5c71a349b6140","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nilsenm/siraGPT/git/trees/88d7b2d881d48500b7a23b13b5d5c71a349b6140"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nilsenm/siraGPT/git/commits/ee0759e18dd98bb51504937b0f55df67f5730828","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/207944715?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/replit-agent/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/replit-agent/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/replit-agent/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/replit-agent/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/replit-agent","id":207944715,"login":"replit-agent","node_id":"U_kgDODGT8Cw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/replit-agent/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/replit-agent/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/replit-agent/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/replit-agent/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/replit-agent/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"h