5e17e7f58b894a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/207944715?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/replit-agent/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/replit-agent/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/replit-agent/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/replit-agent/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/replit-agent","id":207944715,"login":"replit-agent","node_id":"U_kgDODGT8Cw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/replit-agent/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/replit-agent/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/replit-agent/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/replit-agent/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/replit-agent/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/replit-agent","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nilsenm/siraGPT/commits/f93ad989a4c12150fe23be8ac8fe77f50eb0aa38/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-03T05:00:54Z","email":"agent@replit.com","name":"Replit Agent"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-03T05:00:54Z","email":"agent@replit.com","name":"Replit Agent"},"message":"fix(sse): reduce streaming heartbeat 15s→5s to prevent ECONNRESET + duplicate-turn replays\n\nUser pasted prod logs showing `[Error: aborted] {ECONNRESET}`, `[ai/generate]\nactive duplicate turn replayed`, and a completed turn (aborted:false, 6.3s first\ntoken) and asked to fix it.\n\nRoot cause: the SSE keepalive heartbeat was 15s, but pre-first-token enrichment\n(file processing, memory/context retrieval, GPT/project injection) can take 6+\nseconds during which only the t=0 `start` event is flushed. An idle proxy\n(Next.js rewrites and/or Replit edge) resets the socket before the first token →\nclient reconnects with the identical request → backend''s active-duplicate-turn\ndedup replays the original turn. The machinery recovers (user gets the answer),\nbut it produces the error/duplicate noise and a reconnect delay.\n\nFix: lowered all three streaming heartbeat intervals in backend/src/routes/ai.js\n(main /ai/generate, image-gen, webdev) from 15000ms to 5000ms so the connection\nstays warm through the silent pre-first-token window. Heartbeats are client-safe\nno-ops. Verified with `node --check`; architect review APPROVED (low-risk).\n\nScope kept to the reported /ai/generate flow; other SSE routes still at 15s.","tree":{"sha":"698fb4b08f568dd1135eb094a89a4b66231cd015","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nilsenm/siraGPT/git/trees/698fb4b08f568dd1135eb094a89a4b66231cd015"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nilsenm/siraGPT/git/commits/f93ad989a4c12150fe23be8ac8fe77f50eb0aa38","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/207944715?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/replit-agent/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/replit-agent/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/replit-agent/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/replit-agent/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/replit-agent","id":207944715,"login":"replit-agent","node_id":"U_kgDODGT8Cw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/replit-agent/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/replit-agent/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/replit-agent/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/replit-agent/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/replit-agent/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/replit-agent","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/nilsenm/siraGPT/commit/f93