 = light|primary|\n   secondary|hero-secondary; ButtonSize = md|lg). Fixed to primary + md.\n\nIncludes the intended nav changes:\n- Team -> /#company (first)\n- Glossary -> /glossary with fire-orange flame badge (second)\n- Blog -> /blog (third)\n- Pricing -> /#plans\n- Free Tools -> /free/flesch-kincaid-calculator (new)\n- id=''solutions'' on aiTraining section so ''Go to Solution'' CTAs resolve\n- lucide Flame in desktop + mobile drawer","tree":{"sha":"2536f3af14c88589048cf3e80eb45c7e83ea3683","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/butterflyio/promptraise-web/git/trees/2536f3af14c88589048cf3e80eb45c7e83ea3683"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/butterflyio/promptraise-web/git/commits/7a21f1ad34da2eb2ef50ed366f7c201a3c694987","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/butterflyio/promptraise-web/commit/7a21f1ad34da2eb2ef50ed366f7c201a3c694987","node_id":"C_kwDOSxaom9oAKDdhMjFmMWFkMzRkYTJlYjJlZjUwZWQzNjZmN2MyMDFhM2M2OTQ5ODc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/butterflyio/promptraise-web/commit/06742bda1ff6a025ebe22b9f194670bc9334a0c8","sha":"06742bda1ff6a025ebe22b9f194670bc9334a0c8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/butterflyio/promptraise-web/commits/06742bda1ff6a025ebe22b9f194670bc9334a0c8"}],"sha":"7a21f1ad34da2eb2ef50ed366f7c201a3c694987","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/butterflyio/promptraise-web/commits/7a21f1ad34da2eb2ef50ed366f7c201a3c694987"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28396458?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/butterflyio/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/butterflyio/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/butterflyio/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/butterflyio/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/butterflyio","id":28396458,"login":"butterflyio","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4Mzk2NDU