thor":{"date":"2026-08-23T11:54:19Z","email":"root@vmi3084095.contaboserver.net","name":"root"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-23T11:54:19Z","email":"root@vmi3084095.contaboserver.net","name":"root"},"message":"feat(announcement): dismissible bar, safe-area inset, measured offset, pill CTA\n\n- Convert announcement bar to a client component (feat #1): dismissible via X,\n  persisted to localStorage for the session, header collapses back to top\n- Safe-area inset (#2): respects env(safe-area-inset-top) so the bar isn''t\n  clipped by notches/status bar on mobile\n- Self-measured offset (#3): bar publishes its real height to --announce-offset\n  (ResizeObserver), and the spacer + absolute header both read that var, so\n  the offset never drifts from the bar (fixes 2-line wrap / height changes)\n- Pill CTA affordance (#5): CTA is now a rounded pill instead of bare text\n- Correct link handling (#6): next/link for internal, target+rel for external","tree":{"sha":"cb5774b551f837e215cc80377e1a26c040596075","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/butterflyio/promptraise-web/git/trees/cb5774b551f837e215cc80377e1a26c040596075"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/butterflyio/promptraise-web/git/commits/06742bda1ff6a025ebe22b9f194670bc9334a0c8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/butterflyio/promptraise-web/commit/06742bda1ff6a025ebe22b9f194670bc9334a0c8","node_id":"C_kwDOSxaom9oAKDA2NzQyYmRhMWZmNmEwMjVlYmUyMmI5ZjE5NDY3MGJjOTMzNGEwYzg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/butterflyio/promptraise-web/commit/097fc78eb09fd1886e63983446cf18a0ac7e1cff","sha":"097fc78eb09fd1886e63983446cf18a0ac7e1cff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/butterflyio/promptraise-web/commits/097fc78eb09fd1886e63983446cf18a0ac7e1cff"}],"sha":"06742bda1ff6a025ebe22b9f194670bc9334a0c8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/butterflyio/promptraise-web/commits/06742bda1ff6a0