er}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/butterflyio/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/butterflyio","id":28396458,"login":"butterflyio","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4Mzk2NDU4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/butterflyio/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/butterflyio/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/butterflyio/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/butterflyio/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/butterflyio/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/butterflyio","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/butterflyio/promptraise-web/commits/efca4eb64a7a578f263eb0bfcf1759478f5cfac7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-18T14:23:03Z","email":"butterflyio@users.noreply.github.com","name":"butterflyio"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-18T14:23:03Z","email":"butterflyio@users.noreply.github.com","name":"butterflyio"},"message":"fix(site): stop client-side getSiteSettings fetch in header/footer - restores hydration + kills CORS storm\n\nROOT CAUSE of the inert calculator (paste/analyze, URL fetch, Try Web3 example,\ncopy all dead, no errors): SiteChrome is a client component that imported\nSiteShell -> SiteHeader/SiteFooter (async server components). Their\ngetSiteSettings() fetch code was bundled into the client bundle and executed in\nthe browser, firing CORS-failing Sanity XHRs in a loop that starved the page\nbefore hydration attached -> all buttons inert.\n\nFIX: thread settings as server props (layout -> SiteShell -> header/footer);\nSiteChrome now selects between server-rendered chrome/bare slots; header/footer\nno longer fetch anything. Verified locally with real Chromium: Try Web3 example\nfills textarea + renders results, genre pills toggle, URL mode opens, URL fetch\nreturns results.","tree":{"sha":"5aeb2ff3f313c19201cee422fb3