 --bg base surface was aliased to core''s --tw-bg-layout — the deliberately\nwarm \"page\" cream meant for the marketing site — which made the work canvas read too\nbeige. Point --bg at --tw-bg-container (near-white surface), the right token for a\nfocused app canvas; chrome (--bg-2) keeps the subtle --tw-bg-elevated cream.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"98ca7f88be70ce55e437137f13c22d960564af14","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/threadwick-hq/studio/git/trees/98ca7f88be70ce55e437137f13c22d960564af14"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/threadwick-hq/studio/git/commits/abfb9981d1f289f162f03fdd8a5e59c8da020632","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/40126502?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eiluviann/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eiluviann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eiluviann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eiluviann/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Eiluviann","id":40126502,"login":"Eiluviann","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTI2NTAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eiluviann/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eiluviann/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eiluviann/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eiluviann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eiluviann/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eiluviann","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/threadwick-hq/studio/commit/abfb9981d1f289f162f03fdd8a5e59c8da020632","node_id":"C_kwDOSxa_e9oAKGFiZmI5OTgxZDFmMjg5ZjE2MmYwM2ZkZDhhNWU1OWM4ZGEwMjA2MzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/threadwick-hq/studio/commit/4fbef5b8176b96a4c59e5b39ef73428e4adbfe2e","sha":"4fbef5b8176b96a4c59e5b39ef73428e4adbfe2e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/threadwick-hq/studio/commits/4fbef5b8176b96a4c59e5b39ef73428e4adbfe2e"}],"sha":"abfb9981d1f289f162f03fdd8a5e59c8da020632","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/threadwick-hq/studio/commits/abfb9981d1f289f162f03fdd8a5e59c8da020632"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/40126502?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eiluviann/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eiluviann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eiluviann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eiluviann/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Eiluviann","id":40126502,"login":"Eiluviann","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTI2NTAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eiluviann/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eiluviann/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eiluviann/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eiluviann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eiluviann/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eiluviann","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/threadwick-hq/studio/commits/4fbef5b8176b96a4c59e5b39ef73428e4adbfe2e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-17T18:46:50Z","email":"mickeyhuntr@gmail.com","name":"Sławomir Górski"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-17T18:46:50Z","email":"mickeyhuntr@gmail.com","name":"Sławomir Górski"},"message":"Consume @threadwick/core; alias studio CSS vars onto shared tokens\n\n- Add @threadwick/core as a file: dependency; import its tokens.css in main.tsx.\n- theme.ts composes core''s lightTheme with the studio''s component overrides\n  (Button 500, Card, Segmented, Modal, Tooltip) instead of a hardcoded palette.\n- index.css :root now aliases the studio''s --bg/--ink/--accent/--line/... onto core''s\n  --tw-* tokens, so the whole shell follows \"Brick & Ecru\" with no churn across the CSS.\n  Chart-marker hues (--origin/--space/--next) and the serif name face stay studio-local.\n- Licence was already AGPL-3.0-or-later (no change).\n\nVerified: tsc + eslint + vite build pass; built CSS carries core''s OKLCH tokens and the\nold brand hex is gone; the projects view renders on the unified palette, no console errors.\n\nNote: ~22 functional hex literals in the chart-rendering TS stay studio-local; tokenising\nthose and deduping domain primitives vs @threadwick/core/domain are follow-ups.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d27f4daf781b8ccc7f18f05e303e4f9090036140","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/threadwick-hq/studio/git/trees/d27f4daf781b8ccc7f18f05e303e4f9090036140"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/threadwick-hq/studio/git/commits/4fbef5b8176b96a4c59e5b39ef73428e4adbfe2e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/40126502?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eiluviann/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eiluviann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eiluviann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eiluviann/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Eiluviann","id":40126502,"login":"Eiluviann","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTI2NTAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eiluviann/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eiluviann/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eiluviann/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eiluviann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eiluviann/subscriptions","type":