rs","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/threadwick-hq/studio/commits/a8b146c914a795e6468cfbefff6d0c3a0c1cf52a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-11T00:01:52Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-11T00:01:52Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Record the Threadwick brand, voice, naming and free-first fairness model\n\ndocs/BRAND.md is the durable source of truth shared with the homepage\nrepo: spine line, the two audiences, voice, naming and vocabulary\n(project/pattern/chart, resources), the US/UK stitch table and symbol\nconvention, the free-first fairness model and access tiers, no-lock-in,\nprivacy posture, billing UX rules, visual identity tokens with the AA\ncontrast notes, the fairness-annotated roadmap, and cross-repo sync\nrules. CLAUDE.md gains a Brand & values summary pointing at it.\n\nCloses #59\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01BZsB2zJDTUc3nMM2KzfWsY","tree":{"sha":"00df41087727445492cea6e9680c822192dca4be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/threadwick-hq/studio/git/trees/00df41087727445492cea6e9680c822192dca4be"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/threadwick-hq/studio/git/commits/a8b146c914a795e6468cfbefff6d0c3a0c1cf52a","verification":{"payload":"tree 00d