age":"Address PR feedback: header overflow + alignment, spoiler animation, marquee border, icons, placeholders\n\nHeader (Refs #45, #47, #48):\n- The crumb trail now shrinks with ellipsis instead of spilling past the\n  viewport — long names made the page horizontally scrollable, which is\n  what cut off the right editor pane.\n- All crumb pieces share one line-height/padding so mixed sans/serif\n  crumbs center on the same axis; extra spacing after the brand.\n- Hovering the editable pattern title now shows a white input-style\n  field, distinct from the link-tint hover of plain crumbs.\n\nEditor:\n- Mode switcher glyphs are flex-centered and uniformly sized (Refs #37).\n- Marquee pane border is solid and stays 1.4px on screen at any zoom\n  via non-scaling-stroke (Refs #39).\n- \"How it works\" animates open/closed (0fr grid-row transition), the\n  chevron points up when closed, and the separator spans the full panel\n  width; reduced-motion disables the transitions (Refs #41).\n- Rotate actions use the iconoir Refresh glyph, mirrored for\n  counter-clockwise (Refs #55).\n\nNames:\n- Untitled project/pattern names render muted everywhere (titles,\n  crumbs, cards) to read as placeholders (Refs #56).\n- The project page title gets the same self-sizing inline-edit\n  affordance as the pattern title (Refs #57).\n- Dropped the dashed \"New pattern\" placeholder card; the section\n  header button covers it (Refs #58).\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01BZsB2zJDTUc3nMM2KzfWsY","tree":{"sha":"447b21ed6d6ddfb0e072512700111b83ae28e783","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/threadwick-hq/studio/git/trees/447b21ed6d6ddfb0e072512700111b83ae28e783"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/threadwick-hq/studio/git/commits/946611c1388bcff331948a3615f9d3286e32545f","verification":{"payload":"tree 447b21ed6d6ddfb0e072512700111b83ae28e783\nparent ec7f724d0f3d03891c92cf5743a238165ac948ff\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1781134487 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1781134487 +0000\n\nAddress PR feedback: header overflow + alignment, spoiler animation, marquee border, icons, placeholders\n\nHeader (Refs #45, #47, #48):\n- The crumb trail now shrinks with ellipsis instead of spilling past the\n  viewport — long names made the page horizontally scrollable, which is\n  what cut off the right editor pane.\n- All crumb pieces share one line-height/padding so mixed sans/serif\n  crumbs center on the same axis; extra spacing after the brand.\n- Hovering the editable pattern title now shows a white input-style\n  field, distinct from the link-tint hover of plain crumbs.\n\nEditor:\n- Mode switcher glyphs are flex-centered and uniformly sized (Refs #37).\n- Marquee pane border is solid and stays 1.4px on screen at any zoom\n  via non-scaling-stroke (Refs #39).\n- \"How it works\" animates open/closed (0fr grid-row transition), the\n  chevron points up when closed, and the separator spans the full panel\n  width; reduced-motion disables the transitions (Refs #41).\n- Rotate actions use the iconoir Refresh glyph, mirrored for\n  counter-clockwise (Refs #55).\n\nNames:\n- Untitled project/pattern names render muted everywhere (titles,\n  crumbs, cards) to read as placeholders (Refs #56).\n- The project page title gets the same self-sizing inline-edit\n  affordance as the pattern title (Refs #57).\n- Dropped the dashed \"New pattern\" placeholder card; the section\n  header button covers it (Refs #58).\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01BZsB2zJDTUc3nMM2KzfWsY\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQLsGXE/r\nUfKykOoqrQRqqiTZICRpaDY69vveEU6yR3t1Tso/QnWnKIVMruetl1VZOTKVgnygTcnsTUYsmSth\nJQg=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-10T23:34:49Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api