\nblend with the UI font (Refs #47).\n\nThe editable pattern title sizes itself to its text via a hidden twin\n(min/max width capped), gets a hover affordance revealing the hidden\ninput, and the Granny square badge now hugs the title (Refs #45).\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01BZsB2zJDTUc3nMM2KzfWsY","tree":{"sha":"64a34c995e4d227fb1dbf395916823ff8473789f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/threadwick-hq/studio/git/trees/64a34c995e4d227fb1dbf395916823ff8473789f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/threadwick-hq/studio/git/commits/90fe0d175ed928cdc435cf5c1f7ace586801b895","verification":{"payload":"tree 64a34c995e4d227fb1dbf395916823ff8473789f\nparent a8ede2b6e11bfb27ea452d8bcd798ee41f5265e2\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1781131857 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1781131857 +0000\n\nPersistent app header with breadcrumbs and a self-sizing pattern title\n\nThe TopBar is now mounted once at app level and never remounts: views\nportal their controls into a slot in the bar, so navigation swaps only\nthe slot''s children and the page content below (Refs #48).\n\nThe back button gives way to breadcrumbs — All projects / project /\npattern — with project and pattern names in the serif face sized to\nblend with the UI font (Refs #47).\n\nThe editable pattern title sizes itself to its text via a hidden twin\n(min/max width capped), gets a hover affordance revealing the hidden\ninput, and the Granny square badge now hugs the title (Refs #45).\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01BZsB2zJDTUc3nMM2KzfWsY\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQJnhaeBm\n4P8YWoUm/dB4h7dPObVJyAzRkPrrMVGSo/gRTNphRZYj2MnzpaN7csyEUaRqbDRgNjilr/jM7RON\nHAg=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-10T22:59:00Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/