feb1677e74b5302a7738292474","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/threadwick-hq/studio/commits/0a532c91a12407feb1677e74b5302a7738292474"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/threadwick-hq/studio/commits/49c86541c1d7321d3f18f0e037f4aa08de8ea31e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-10T22:41:29Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-10T22:41:29Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Marquee: keep the window pane visible; select only fully-contained stitches\n\nThe marquee rect was wiped mid-gesture: each selection change re-renders\nthe canvas and drawCursor cleared the cursor layer whenever a marquee was\nactive. Draw the pane from drawCursor instead, so re-renders repaint it.\nSelection now requires full containment — both the stitch base and head\nmust sit inside the pane (stitchWithinRect, unit-tested).\n\nRefs #39\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01BZsB2zJDTUc3nMM2KzfWsY","tree":{"sha":"a6612f933291663aebeea74eb494cd504d8065f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/threadwick-hq/studio/git/trees/a6612f933291663aebeea74eb494cd504d8065f0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/threadwick-hq/studio/git/commits/49c86541c1d7321d3f18f0e037f4aa08de8ea31e","verification":{"payload":"tree a6612f933291663aebeea74eb494cd504d8065f0\nparent 0afcf21f670419d57364be33b6b434fbe363a032\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1781131289 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1781131289 +0000\n\nMarquee: keep the window pane visible; select only fully-contained stitches\n\nThe marquee rect was wiped mid-gesture: each selection change re-renders\nthe canvas and drawCursor cleared the cursor layer whenever a marquee was\nactive. Draw the pane from drawCursor instead, so re-renders repaint it.\nSelection now requires full containment — both the stitch base and head\nmust sit inside the pane (stitchWithinRect, unit-tested).\n\nRefs #39\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01BZsB2zJDTUc3nMM2KzfWsY\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQKDbIaYy\nk7ugEnPfRiWEZD/TfJe7MuVojiUdhci+XFwxxDQErvVcWYLaKksFlbEC6XJNbVF/KrlffRmm5j+I\nqQY=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-10T22:59:00Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":