 base/outDir\n(no @vercel/microfrontends plugin), and no SPA fallback rewrite is\nneeded since the app has no client-side router.\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_016LSb5tYiPMKT93hSXaw9D8","tree":{"sha":"f8283d4dda3258029081ba59d826ad02b6475906","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/threadwick-hq/studio/git/trees/f8283d4dda3258029081ba59d826ad02b6475906"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/threadwick-hq/studio/git/commits/1deea551d053a399007279c2334624970f3993bc","verification":{"payload":"tree f8283d4dda3258029081ba59d826ad02b6475906\nparent 1e6625069d9b1fbc89abf6e424b711ee9c46f315\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1781100455 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1781100455 +0000\n\nRetire GitHub Pages remnants; document the Vercel /studio deployment\n\nThe Pages deploy workflow was already deleted; this removes the last\nartifact (.nojekyll) and updates the README, whose live-app link, build\nnotes, and Deployment section still described the old GitHub Pages\nsetup. The Deployment section now documents the actual hosting: the\nthreadwick-studio Vercel project mounted at threadwick.com/studio via a\nVercel Microfrontends group, driven by base ''/studio/'' +\noutDir ''dist/studio'' in vite.config.ts and the existing vercel.json.\n\nNo config changes: vite.config.ts keeps the verified manual base/outDir\n(no @vercel/microfrontends plugin), and no SPA fallback rewrite is\nneeded since the app has no client-side router.\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_016LSb5tYiPMKT93hSXaw9D8\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQOmtyCel\nB3Kc0AUgD/aQP9UGM4hEiZF934SklIu2aypQOf7r2f1fpLazAPPuVMr+sXG5qhHrfdqRpbiURCdv\ntA8=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-10T14:07:53Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https