},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/threadwick-hq/studio/commits/3915a649f82c9a58a8028b852bbfa4880b3be98a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-07T23:36:20Z","email":"40126502+Eiluviann@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Aurelio Solís"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-07T23:36:20Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Rename \"stitchgrid studio\" to \"threadwick studio\" (#24)\n\nReflect the project rename across user-facing branding, docs, package\nmetadata, and internal identifiers:\n\n- Wordmark, page title, README/BACKLOG/CLAUDE headings, print footer,\n  and the logo aria-label now read \"threadwick studio\".\n- package.json / package-lock.json name -> threadwick-studio.\n- Portable file format id -> \"threadwick-studio\" and the export\n  extension -> .threadwick.json. Import ignores the format field and\n  accepts any .json, so older exports still round-trip.\n- Debug global window.stitchgrid -> window.threadwick.\n- localStorage key -> threadwickstudio:v2, with a one-time fallback that\n  reads the old stitchgridstudio:v2 key and migrates it forward, so no\n  existing user loses their saved library.\n\nTypecheck, lint, tests (incl. export/import round-trip), and build pass.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ec173869597c7e909e75b0d6e65c295a3c98fe53","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/threadwick-hq/studio/git/trees/ec173869597c7e909e75b0d6e65c295a3c98fe53"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/threadwick-hq/studio/git/commits/3915a649f82c9a58a8028b852bbfa4880b3be98a","verification":{"payload":"tree ec173869597c7e909e75b0d6e65c295a3c98fe53\nparent 1756baa92a144077af5daad2a139dcc21e213451\nauthor Aurelio Solís <40126502+Eiluviann@users.noreply.github.com> 1780875380 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1780875380 +0200\n\nRename \"stitchgrid studio\" to \"threadwick studio\" (#24)\n\nReflect the project rename across user-facing branding, docs, package\nmetadata, and internal identifiers:\n\n- Wordmark, page title, README/BACKLOG/CLAUDE headings, print footer,\n  and the logo aria-label now read \"threadwick studio\".\n- package.json / package-lock.json name -> threadwick-studio.\n- Portable file format id -> \"threadwick-studio\" and the export\n  extension -> .threadwick.json. Import ignores the format field and\n  accepts any .json, so older exports still round-trip.\n- Debug global window.stitchgrid -> window.threadwick.\n- localStorage key -> threadwickstudio:v2, with a one-time fallback that\n  reads the old stitchgridstudio:v2 key and migrates it forward, so no\n  existing user loses their saved library.\n\nTypecheck, lint, tests (incl. export/import round-trip), and build pass.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqJgB0CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAy1wQALIvX3xf4OfiAZ7+JrXKQ8lJ\nGf5e7urmCriVLGB+qxeSQPPpe7GH3/Xq09DydtdhTd3eat524ReA1j5M8LwHRnO0\nftBd5GQ335WbO8vtxZ6tiD32vi6nreVBjeghZLF80Z7o1IKWVKrsw5Z1V3FOK5/4\nvFmRIRUokXSjkGMxrMH/EFvi8xlv5SuIrqmzIbhwYLnchVw6lMUB7T7Puu6iOc1J\nVosmMritFP4rx9DDlt9agtMEbqUnkOXSmeZWil7rHCKqolx7YaBz26/oJoJtMAbO\n/0068Vv0DlSnXnlxqnmrECTNROoBK8DwrfoN3IailrxRJj6ECm/rYjRePh1ByMSb\nOpb1CO8ZT1oA6QH0zdGkgovozOUZorchRTijKy8Jg+TVt1q4ptTcwrmcarcQSASI\nrWfkXe79sS7NyeOjJRpTmyzC1Mu6DWzEJItX4cJkQ6VhzxfO5T5160BkPrGZ0oC2\nH/wrY4gOcEiGu3q/6S2FcFEJINqwlcJJBahJtmhNbFrEx6bA7Ju5Kp0soETTogW0\n3cFOJd+eudJTsO82f1wp1nJKw4GSGc0gRzEbnMPxvUWiaDtybTqsEUF399AeTnr1\nDJhtfYpkzIYgGSqXFnAqY65tu7SQwbMFzApu7U5Fy9Lz1Q2q2iNz4kF/tm4YRP0d\nvlAwUJfz5IaKNk9nHhET\n=NwbR\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-07T23:36:21Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https: