://api.github.com/users/Eiluviann","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/threadwick-hq/studio/commits/cf8153049a9f86a300057dcf46754a54debf0318/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-07T22:50:16Z","email":"40126502+Eiluviann@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Aurelio Solís"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-07T22:50:16Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Project versioning (draft / published / outdated) (#19)\n\nEach project keeps an ordered list of versions (Draft / Published / Outdated), each with its own patterns + resources. Publishing the draft makes it live and outdates the prior published version; \"Edit as new draft\" snapshots the published version into a fresh draft so the next version is worked on without disturbing the published one. Project gains versions[] + activeVersionId (FILE_VERSION 3); normalizeProject migrates legacy projects; the store routes all access through the active version and guards mutations so non-draft versions are read-only. UI: status badges, version switcher, publish/discard/new-draft actions, read-only project view + editor. Verified tsc/eslint/build + 27 tests + headless lifecycle flow.","tree":{"sha":"27297aa46ef597943fb9a38f3e3f589c44fac776","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/threadwick-hq/studio/git/trees/27297aa46ef597943fb9a38f3e3f589c44fac776"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/threadwick-hq/studio/git/commits/cf8153049a9f86a300057dcf46754a54debf0318","verification":{"payload":"tree 27297aa46ef597943fb9a38f3e3f589c44fac776\nparent 2ee5c28475be736b4be2fe95e50b3f4cb3e56f7b\nauthor Aurelio Solís <40126502+Eiluviann@users.noreply.github.com> 1780872616 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1780872616 +0200\n\nProject versioning (draft / published / outdated) (#19)\n\nEach project keeps an ordered list of versions (Draft / Published / Outdated), each with its own patterns + resources. Publishing the draft makes it live and outdates the prior published version; \"Edit as new draft\" snapshots the published version into a fresh draft so the next version is worked on without disturbing the published one. Project gains versions[] + activeVersionId (FILE_VERSION 3); normalizeProject migrates legacy projects; the store routes all access through the active version and guards mutations so non-draft versions are read-only. UI: status badges, version switcher, publish/discard/new-draft actions, read-only project view + editor. Verified tsc/eslint/build + 27 tests + headless lifecycle flow.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqJfWoCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA+bUQAHgPtX9QHo9s5YzVkutwkfLm\nB9lUgKXKe9/TMR+yRvfUpj+K6+FMUte4hvqhsUt76TOLoGdlt7Fgczx6mB7IsUcm\nN+b5+3+pdnM7zY57BZdP4pW/BEQZ0z9c6ggA47JZ5gAtVVrMzpdJycWIMJ9NV2Tt\nCeWw0S0SFn+YP7dZmC4V2CcBQSB3AiNUa7BUfTyp/i5q42fruHPRMo270JR2EjB5\nCqhqJ80pfjr5aqAbl4u6wrucyBUtcy5bQGd0PI5YaJcpiurdSJAIAtbJ4M7NJyjU\niq8n2SkapbRd9rUnx1KIT6vH5QVapQZEQQMnGdGw+8Dj9MExFy88wBCYx9+WEr1r\nBuHUb1m5fwaHYVvj2VPsHTG0hj5fPdDAlAlYTADbC5WZ9YBkqCc7gKoFqHVAb75N\nRRIh8BUD4WrLgnbPJ0vUcpRt2LRpqV7NPvw8Rycha0weLHSbXH1svMNBsa9Ne5vb\n5GMZDttvyaTmllg8v0g+qBwLU8xl3E/9BDU8FdTnN7bWuFqk3xDa7kYKWzhYvdE9\nIWRRlbgtNm9XlK4TsnOMPXsFpD04MoPo3kJEAyiL8M53JvVhjQ+Y41dS7Zi5MIis\nrPw4bQ3Q5gvDSFSSY9fd2w9iZ78Y/ocizs/J+4U00j8VuczULWi+bznIwNZCfU5p\nAH6K9gT7qw3RmTxdrFTu\n=riDW\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-07T22:50:17Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/