rl":"https://api.github.com/repos/thanghokdps/claude-root/commits/500afc9d97987f990c89c6912200614e365d3fc5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-04T07:11:44Z","email":"thang.hoquang@asnet.com.vn","name":"Thang Ho Quang"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-04T07:11:44Z","email":"thang.hoquang@asnet.com.vn","name":"Thang Ho Quang"},"message":"refactor: consolidate the two init skills, drop an orphan script\n\n/init-project and /project-init were both full skills describing different\ndirectory trees — one created .claude/commands/ and .claude/docs/solutions/,\nthe other .claude/memory/*, and neither created the other''s. Whichever you ran\ndecided what the project got. /init-project also hand-reimplemented what\ninit.sh already does, then called /project-init from its last stage anyway.\n\n/project-init is now the single path; /init-project is a user-invoked stub\npointing at it. The .claude/commands/ copy that only lived there has moved\ninto init.sh, so nothing is lost.\n\nAlso drops the README section for scripts/save-session-memory.sh, removed in\n340862b. It wrote memory/sessions/$TODAY.md, the same file state-breadcrumb.sh\nwrites directly, and was never copied, registered or referenced. The README\nclaimed state-breadcrumb.sh called it; it does not. Verified state-breadcrumb\nstill writes sessions/ after removal.","tree":{"sha":"fed51697f22fc59d93c466c1122905a59566dc7c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/thanghokdps/claude-root/git/trees/fed51697f22fc59d93c466c1122905a59566dc7c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/thanghokdps/claude-root/git/commits/500afc9d97987f990c89c6912200614e365d3fc5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/139756762?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thanghoquang-agilityio/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thanghoquang-agilityio/followers","fo