nghoquang-agilityio","node_id":"U_kgDOCFSE2g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thanghoquang-agilityio/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thanghoquang-agilityio/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thanghoquang-agilityio/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thanghoquang-agilityio/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thanghoquang-agilityio/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/thanghoquang-agilityio","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/thanghokdps/claude-root/commits/826f0bab7ec54fb807d669bfa5eb1e87c3149382/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-04T07:11:19Z","email":"thang.hoquang@asnet.com.vn","name":"Thang Ho Quang"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-04T07:11:19Z","email":"thang.hoquang@asnet.com.vn","name":"Thang Ho Quang"},"message":"fix(skills): add missing frontmatter, rebuild fix-bug around a tight red loop\n\ncheckpoint, code-review, feature, sync-memory and fix-bug had no frontmatter\nat all, so none of them could ever be model-invoked. Four of the five are the\nskills init.sh installs into every project.\n\nfix-bug additionally replaces a four-line \"Stage 1 - Reproduce\" with the\ndiagnosis discipline: nine ranked ways to build a red loop, an explicit\ncompletion criterion (name one command you have already run, paste its output,\nprove it is red-capable, deterministic, fast and agent-runnable) and a hard\nstop before hypothesising without one. Adds 3-5 ranked falsifiable hypotheses\nbefore testing any, [DEBUG-xxxx]-tagged instrumentation so cleanup is one grep,\nand \"no correct seam is itself the finding\".","tree":{"sha":"bf5634c0d2cf888862bb1843542fc7182701d933","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/thanghokdps/claude-root/git/trees/bf5634c0d2cf888862bb1843542fc7182701d933"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/thanghokdps/claude-root/git/commi