":"https://api.github.com/users/2heal1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/2heal1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/2heal1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/2heal1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/2heal1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/2heal1","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/2heal1/divebell/commits/c955794f746620b6f8ec72243a37d2de403db357/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-07T03:40:45Z","email":"TwoHeal@163.com","name":"Hanric"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-07T03:40:45Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: 添加ps、kill、kill-all守护进程管理命令 (#151)\n\n* feat: 添加ps、kill、kill-all守护进程管理命令\n\n本次提交新增了三个CLI命令用于管理Divebell守护进程：\n1.  `divebell ps`：列出当前用户的所有运行中守护进程\n2.  `divebell kill`：通过索引、PID或端口号终止指定守护进程\n3.  `divebell kill-all`：终止所有 tracked 的守护进程\n\n同时完成了以下配套改动：\n- 新增daemon命令模块实现核心逻辑\n- 扩展命令类型定义与分类\n- 更新文档与帮助信息\n- 重构Bridge进程管理相关工具函数\n\n* fix(cli): resolve exactOptionalPropertyTypes violations in daemon.ts\n\nUse conditional spread instead of passing undefined directly to optional\nproperties to satisfy exactOptionalPropertyTypes compiler option.\nFixes CI failures in runPsCommand, runKillCommand, runKillAllCommand\nand createKillNotFoundError.\n\n* fix(cli): sync cli-reference.md with help.ts command table\n\nAdd start command, update stop/open/runtimes descriptions and options\nto match the current CLI command definitions in help.ts.\nFixes docs:cli:check failure in pkg.pr.new CI.","tree":{"sha":"128b64803d336137cfaf0b95cd57ce12a888c4f1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/2heal1/divebell/git/trees/128b64803d336137cfaf0b95cd57ce12a888c4f1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/2heal1/divebell/git/commits/c955794f746620b6f8ec72243a37d2de403db357","verification":{"payload":"tree 128b64803d336137cfaf0b95cd57ce12a888c4f1\nparent e63248a58e68799215caaae71002b73e76162276\nauthor Hanric <TwoHeal@163.com> 1786074045 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786074045 +0800\n\nfeat: 添加ps、kill、kill-all守护进程管理命令 (#151)\n\n* feat: 添加ps、kill、kill-all守护进程管理命令\n\n本次提交新增了三个CLI命令用于管理Divebell守护进程：\n1.  `divebell ps`：列出当前用户的所有运行中守护进程\n2.  `divebell kill`：通过索引、PID或端口号终止指定守护进程\n3.  `divebell kill-all`：终止所有 tracked 的守护进程\n\n同时完成了以下配套改动：\n- 新增daemon命令模块实现核心逻辑\n- 扩展命令类型定义与分类\n- 更新文档与帮助信息\n- 重构Bridge进程管理相关工具函数\n\n* fix(cli): resolve exactOptionalPropertyTypes violations in daemon.ts\n\nUse conditional spread instead of passing undefined directly to optional\nproperties to satisfy exactOptionalPropertyTypes compiler option.\nFixes CI failures in runPsCommand, runKillCommand, runKillAllCommand\nand createKillNotFoundError.\n\n* fix(cli): sync cli-reference.md with help.ts command table\n\nAdd start command, update stop/open/runtimes descriptions and options\nto match the current CLI command definitions in help.ts.\nFixes docs:cli:check failure in pkg.pr.new CI.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqdVO9CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAqz8QAB4ONG5vfQ2o88z1BuduuXBW\nqXarqbPifJXCkaacg5FaKKVSZKDE8sC6p8DbcrqkGW5XDV4H0e0jfsxPNe1W0aWe\nnNsqRJJaHiU5xcCVqvcEkQkxWJ6z6xV4q5FheJmEV1ECzWNv66C3Zju4Xi71EYbV\nA5cmiESvhnAV42KZ9xohRlbTSzrBVGcOKLwVlSzzvKntwIcsVN9l2O3VvBBw0oeM\n3KmYoCtXY0yLJso9N5fbhu+/MlJqizVnBKo2QfzYi9BkjaRef8tcWel3JIs2fpUX\nTndW816CNKff59nRBcOmLSLYHC84ryMwdAEdxVLFvWkJh2d3QCroZfX8GEBGcATs\nQBo+u4RrclUB7a8D45RYR1nHqL8l+GbG+ntBs6w3VZbgVFxXrkJrMvsyri9/aKTS\n40n3JJy9YfmI3islDlmpc6LZtkCqGYY4XnoQkzMa15r0sph76OJgvhPw/av0Dh2a\nZtFzTRC2Od4nXRPWrePS4P859uiH9pWwdI0mNYNrOgI9oRakUzx7jLfXgw2qNtwS\nuZxSE7YAGws+uFU7wAZAg4qQ2yQtBYW6NSSvDNvF0hmbGt5TFrQva2mT9kwv/qv7\nceds534WnQLJ+Z5HeTtWqpaZRTa5fWILtbIh96ese2W2X9fhkgFbl4byQvD7bn6b\nQOQuXD6pf02Nz/z4S4aA\n=hR3f\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-07T03:45:27Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/198