6T11:05:52Z","email":"eneisyou@gmail.com","name":"EISYOU"},"message":"i18n(qa): supa-review の description を run_loop 最適化結果で更新\n\nskill-creator の description 最適化ループを 4 skill で実行(各20クエリ・3 runs・\n最大5 iteration、claude -p 実測、60/40 train/test 分割で過学習を回避)。\n\n- supa-tdd / supa-implement / supa-acceptance: 元 description が held-out test で\n  最良(8/8・8/8・7/8)のため据え置き。\n- supa-review: 元は test recall 50%(should-trigger の半分が未発火)。最適化案が\n  test 5/8→7/8(recall 50%→83%・precision 100% 維持)で勝ったため反映。\n  負境界(通用 review→Superpowers 等)を保持しつつ具体的トリガ信号を追加。\n\n計測は skill-creator の一時コピーを Python 3.14 で実行し、検出系を「呼び出しごとに\n隔離した .claude/skills/ へ実 skill 配置」へ改造して成立させた(原本プラグインは\n無改変・一時物は破棄済み)。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"dac7c8bb6e8e0a426c677a485413e332b042221d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eneisyou/supadevops/git/trees/dac7c8bb6e8e0a426c677a485413e332b042221d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eneisyou/supadevops/git/commits/8c785a1484e209dc60026e4dd77fca620842a9d7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165663319?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eneisyou/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eneisyou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eneisyou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eneisyou/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/eneisyou","id":165663319,"login":"eneisyou","node_id":"U_kgDOCd_SVw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eneisyou/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eneisyou/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eneisyou/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eneisyou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eneisyou/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://ap