文へ全面翻訳。\n構造(フェーズ・規約・ファイル構成・コード例の識別子/型/パス)は不変、\n散文・コメント・Mermaid ラベル・JSON description のみを翻訳した。\n\n範囲: README.md / skills(supa-tdd, supa-implement, supa-acceptance, supa-review)\n      / agents(supa-implementer, supa-reviewer) / commands(supa, supa-init)\n      / hooks/validate.sh / .claude-plugin(plugin.json, marketplace.json)\n\n不変: コード識別子・JSON/JSDoc キー・パス・npm/CLI コマンド・機械的ディレクティブ\n      (// @ts-check 等)・ワークフロー名・慣用英語名(Next.js/Expo/Playwright 等)。\n\n品質保証(skill-creator 軽量QA):\n- かな/日本語新字体の残存 0、日本語約物を簡体へ正規化(・→、 「」→\"\" 〜→～)\n- JSON 構文・bash 構文・Markdown コードフェンス均衡を検証\n- 用語一貫性を確認(契约优先/桩/验收/人工门控/纪律 等)\n- 4 skill が quick_validate 合格(frontmatter 健全・description は角括弧なし/長さ適正)\n- description は作文ガイド準拠(使用条件+不使用条件を明記)、約物を全角に統一\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"323fa1db14f2719bc0ce38fd8b029ce31fb74b20","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eneisyou/supadevops/git/trees/323fa1db14f2719bc0ce38fd8b029ce31fb74b20"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eneisyou/supadevops/git/commits/3393d7ecbe5eae6edc2b834aba2239a9e6ba5b51","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165663319?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eneisyou/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eneisyou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eneisyou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eneisyou/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/eneisyou","id":165663319,"login":"eneisyou","node_id":"U_kgDOCd_SVw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eneisyou/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eneisyou/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eneisyou/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eneisyou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eneisyou/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/eneisyou","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/eneisyou/supadevops/commit/3393d7ecbe5eae6edc2b834aba2239a9e6ba5b51","node_id":"C_kwDOSxzOzNoAKDMzOTNkN2VjYmU1ZWFlNmVkYzJiODM0YWJhMjIzOWE5ZTZiYTViNTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/eneisyou/supadevops/commit/acbb6d7a95cc703992b6899e2ff237235cccfffa","sha":"acbb6d7a95cc703992b6899e2ff237235cccfffa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eneisyou/supadevops/commits/acbb6d7a95cc703992b6899e2ff237235cccfffa"}],"sha":"3393d7ecbe5eae6edc2b834aba2239a9e6ba5b51","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eneisyou/supadevops/commits/3393d7ecbe5eae6edc2b834aba2239a9e6ba5b51"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165663319?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eneisyou/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eneisyou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eneisyou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eneisyou/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/eneisyou","id":165663319,"login":"eneisyou","node_id":"U_kgDOCd_SVw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eneisyou/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eneisyou/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eneisyou/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eneisyou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eneisyou/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/eneisyou","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eneisyou/supadevops/commits/acbb6d7a95cc703992b6899e2ff237235cccfffa/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-16T09:00:51Z","email":"eneisyou@gmail.com","name":"EISYOU"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-16T09:00:51Z","email":"eneisyou@gmail.com","name":"EISYOU"},"message":"refactor: 各プラグイン部品を自己完結化 + メタデータ修正\n\nskills/agents/commands が README.md を正典として参照する構成をやめ、\n規約・記入例を各部品へインライン化(これ単体で完結する方針へ)。\n\n- supa-tdd: 5フェーズ・規約・記入例を全文インライン化(README §参照を除去)\n- supa-init: 具体ツリー + 設定ファイル全文(turbo/next/jest/jsconfig 等)へ拡張\n- supa-implement/-acceptance/-review: §参照を除去し authoring 手順を自足化\n- supa-implementer/-reviewer: レビュー観点・規約を agent 内に展開\n- marketplace.json: name を supa-marketplace → magcen-zone に修正\n- plugin.json: author を magcen-zone → EISYOU(eneisyou@gmail.com)に修正\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7129c0c03da250dd95ffab4d7ae657c5be7386c7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eneisyou/supadevops/git/trees/7129c0c03da250dd95ffab4d7ae657c5be7386c7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eneisyou/supadevops/git/commits/acbb6d7a95cc703992b6899e2ff237235cccfffa","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165663319?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eneisyou/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eneisyou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eneisyou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eneisyou/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/eneisyou","id":165663319,"login":"eneisyou","node_id":"U_kgDOCd_SVw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eneisyou/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eneisyou/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eneisyou/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eneisyou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eneisyou/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/eneisyou","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/eneisyou/supadevops/commit/acbb6d7a95cc703992b6899e2ff237235cccfffa","node_id":"C_kwDOSxzOz