s","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-28T09:40:30Z","email":"dkoblenc@gmail.com","name":"dkoblenc"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-28T09:40:30Z","email":"dkoblenc@gmail.com","name":"dkoblenc"},"message":"feat: implement cover letter generation feature in CV builder\n\n- Added a new \"Generate cover letter\" button in the CV builder, allowing users to create concise cover letters based on their current CV and a specified vacancy description.\n- Introduced validation to ensure that both the company name and vacancy description are provided before generating a cover letter.\n- Updated the Playwright configuration to rebuild the UI on changes and increased the web server timeout for better performance.\n- Enhanced the TypeScript configuration to exclude the `vitest.config.ts` file.\n- Created comprehensive documentation for the cover letter feature, including user stories, acceptance criteria, and E2E tests to validate functionality.\n- Refactored existing components and added new utility functions to support the cover letter generation logic.","tree":{"sha":"0e4e907a99b3aec220262b62c8a605fc996d883f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Notalama/next-cv-builder/git/trees/0e4e907a99b3aec220262b62c8a605fc996d883f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Notalama/next-cv-builder/git/commits/26029bcefb42e5fdc242f937a237f099801007be","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18893494?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Notalama/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Notalama/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Notalama/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Notalama/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Notalama","id":18893494,"login":"Notalama","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4ODkzNDk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/us