ttps://api.github.com/repos/Notalama/next-cv-builder/commits/51938fb124b54fb85e2a71f976cd61a0b2734180/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-28T09:06:55Z","email":"dkoblenc@gmail.com","name":"dkoblenc"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-28T09:06:55Z","email":"dkoblenc@gmail.com","name":"dkoblenc"},"message":"feat: add MCP cover letter generation tool\n\n- Introduced a new MCP endpoint at `/api/mcp` for generating ultra-concise cover letters from saved CVs.\n- Implemented the `generate_cover_letter` tool, which accepts CV ID, company name, job role, and optional job description and language.\n- Added input validation using Zod to ensure required fields are provided.\n- Integrated Google Gemini and Vercel AI SDK for generating cover letters, with a fallback mock implementation.\n- Updated environment configuration to include `MCP_API_KEY` for secure access to the MCP endpoint.\n- Created comprehensive tests for the cover letter generation logic and input validation.\n- Documented the new feature in `docs/specs/cover-letter-mcp.md` for clarity on usage and requirements.","tree":{"sha":"ac0aab6eb220f6997e33559c5031d1ff116818a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Notalama/next-cv-builder/git/trees/ac0aab6eb220f6997e33559c5031d1ff116818a9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Notalama/next-cv-builder/git/commits/51938fb124b54fb85e2a71f976cd61a0b2734180","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18893494?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Notalama/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Notalama/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Notalama/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Notalama/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Notalama","id":18893494,"login":"Notalama","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4ODkzNDk0","organizations_