o}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sdkwork-ai/sdkwork-specs/commits/19bbeb696a6d477fe99457af41bad04a75f2b0d2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T03:59:24Z","email":"sdkwork@zowalk.com","name":"sdkwork-ai"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T03:59:24Z","email":"sdkwork@zowalk.com","name":"sdkwork-ai"},"message":"spec(mobile-ui): codify scroll containment and scrollbar/tab-bar separation\n\nAdds the scroll-containment standard to §5: the viewport wrapper is a fixed\n100dvh overflow-hidden frame, the app canvas is the only scroll container\n(hidden scrollbar, overscroll containment), the bottom tab bar stays fixed\noutside the scroll flow, and the scroll container carries tab-bar-height\nbottom padding. Document-level scrolling is forbidden so the page scrollbar\ncan never overlap or scroll alongside the fixed tab bar. Requires per-root\nregression of document scrollTop, tab-bar position, sticky header, and\nlast-row visibility.\n\nExtracted from the sdkwork-appstore H5 scroll fix (round 16): the document\nscrollbar previously drew over the fixed bottom tab bar and appeared to move\nwith it.","tree":{"sha":"45c3d038efadb03914f1ed3aed79078600ef6ac2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sdkwork-ai/sdkwork-specs/git/trees/45c3d038efadb03914f1ed3aed79078600ef6ac2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sdkwork-ai/sdkwork-specs/git/commits/19bbeb696a6d477fe99457af41bad04a75f2b0d2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218460407?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/following{/othe