lk.com","name":"sdkwork-ai"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T21:38:44Z","email":"sdkwork@zowalk.com","name":"sdkwork-ai"},"message":"fix(tools): preserve repo-owned pnpm settings through workspace sync and register the drive upload-image family for webserver\n\n- sync-workspace regenerated pnpm-workspace.yaml from\n  {packages, catalog} alone, silently deleting repo-owned top-level\n  settings (linkWorkspacePackages / preferWorkspacePackages /\n  overrides). parsePnpmWorkspaceSettings + a settings pass through\n  renderPnpmWorkspace carry them verbatim; the tool''s authority stays\n  packages + catalog.\n- the webserver consumer overlay was missing the three drive\n  upload-image packages its apps consume with workspace:* protocol,\n  which made every post-overlay install fail workspace resolution.","tree":{"sha":"1ad3e61e972ac48c4d5e59c42d33d73c11c35dad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sdkwork-ai/sdkwork-specs/git/trees/1ad3e61e972ac48c4d5e59c42d33d73c11c35dad"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sdkwork-ai/sdkwork-specs/git/commits/5d0be27c7e40bd2390be2255e4626c6b5d9c0c5c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218460407?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sdkwork-ai","id":218460407,"login":"sdkwork-ai","node_id":"U_kgDODQVw9w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/star