"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T21:29:04Z","email":"sdkwork@zowalk.com","name":"sdkwork-ai"},"message":"chore(workspace): record sdkwork-im sibling federation overlay\n\nThe sdkwork-im consumer record carried a stale subset of the sibling\npackages the repository''s pnpm-workspace.yaml actually federates, so\ncheck-workspace-member-protocol reported permanent drift and the\nprescribed sync-workspace.mjs remediation aligned the local file to the\nstale record (stripping live members) instead of updating the registry.\nRecord the full sibling overlay (164 ../sdkwork-* entries) the consumer\nrequires; local members stay repository-owned and are not part of the\noverlay.","tree":{"sha":"8759936b76bd506b1e7e5c51e665d4dd85446979","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sdkwork-ai/sdkwork-specs/git/trees/8759936b76bd506b1e7e5c51e665d4dd85446979"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sdkwork-ai/sdkwork-specs/git/commits/7f95b3efb63e116879f6f64f54fefbb40137a239","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218460407?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sdkwork-ai","id":218460407,"login":"sdkwork-ai","node_id":"U_kgDODQVw9w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/sdkwork-ai/sdkwork-specs/commit/7f95b3efb63e116879f6f64f54fefbb40137a239","node_id":"C_kwDOSyFxZdoAKDdmOTViM2VmYjYzZTExNjg3OWY2ZjY0ZjU0ZmVmYmI0MDEzN2EyMzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/sdkwork-ai/sdkwork-specs/commit/7e11ae57fc05d860d7b891d32feae5546776bbc2","sha":"7e11ae57fc05d860d7b891d32feae5546776bbc2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sdkwork-ai/sdkwork-specs/commits/7e11ae57fc05d860d7b891d32feae5546776bbc2"}],"sha":"7f95b3efb63e116879f6f64f54fefbb40137a239","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sdkwork-ai/sdkwork-specs/commits/7f95b3efb63e116879f6f64f54fefbb40137a239"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218460407?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sdkwork-ai","id":218460407,"login":"sdkwork-ai","node_id":"U_kgDODQVw9w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sdkwork-ai/sdkwork-specs/commits/7e11ae57fc05d860d7b891d32feae5546776bbc2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T19:30:58Z","email":"sdkwork@zowalk.com","name":"sdkwork-ai"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T19:30:58Z","email":"sdkwork@zowalk.com","name":"sdkwork-ai"},"message":"fix(tools): skip symlinked entries in the OpenAPI walker\n\nwalkOpenApiFiles used statSync, which follows junctions/symlinks. pnpm\nleaves node_modules.__stale__donor* debris containing junction farms and\ncross-app node_modules symlinks (observed in sdkwork-im under\napps/sdkwork-im-h5), so the walk revisited the same physical tree under\never-growing logical paths and the workspace-wide API validators\n(check-api-operation-patterns, check-api-response-envelope) hung for\nmany minutes before path-length exhaustion. lstat + skip-symlinks keeps\nthe same authority discovery (OpenAPI authorities are never reached\nthrough a symlink) and makes the scan terminate deterministically.\n\nEvidence: with sdkwork-im''s debris present, both validators now finish\nin seconds and pass where they previously hung past 10 minutes.","tree":{"sha":"f39ccf45e905b9c5a19d3365679d0b7a0c872f4d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sdkwork-ai/sdkwork-specs/git/trees/f39ccf45e905b9c5a19d3365679d0b7a0c872f4d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sdkwork-ai/sdkwork-specs/git/commits/7e11ae57fc05d860d7b891d32feae5546776bbc2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218460407?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sdkwork-ai","id":218460407,"login":"sdkwork-ai","node_id":"U_kgDODQVw9w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/starred{/ow