pos/sdkwork-ai/sdkwork-specs/commits/0bc8aadd1ad6b85a875aaf1a5f85725385658b07"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218460407?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sdkwork-ai","id":218460407,"login":"sdkwork-ai","node_id":"U_kgDODQVw9w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sdkwork-ai/sdkwork-specs/commits/fa403fc3bd0a63b554a5d622aed83d9974913a8c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-11T14:20:55Z","email":"sdkwork@zowalk.com","name":"sdkwork-ai"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-11T14:20:55Z","email":"sdkwork@zowalk.com","name":"sdkwork-ai"},"message":"feat(specs): add ROLLBACK_RESTRICTION_SPEC and propagate it to every AGENTS.md\n\nA repository lost multiple days of work to a rollback rather than a deletion:\na stale origin/main baseline was fetched, HEAD was reset onto it, and a bulk\ngit add -A committed the stale snapshot back into history. Repairing that\ndamage by resetting to the parent would have discarded the commit''s legitimate\nadditions too. DESTRUCTIVE_OPERATION_SPEC covers deletion; nothing covered\nstate movement, so the discipline had no authority.\n\nAdd ROLLBACK_RESTRICTION_SPEC.md (fix-forward rule; named prohibition of\ngit reset / checkout -f / switch -f / reflex revert / stash discard / ref\ndeletion / reflog expiry / amend on pushed history / rebase / filter-branch /\nforce push as a defect remedy; additive-only recovery with an explicit\nenumerated pathspec; three-snapshot blob evidence before a bulk restore;\ncheckpoint commit plus backup branch, tag, and patch before any restore;\ngit ls-remote as the only remote-head authority; explicit human authorization\nrecorded in the commit message; object-hash verification and a checklist).\n\nAdd tools/sync-agent-rollback-restriction-standard.mjs, which materializes the\ndiscipline as the SDKWORK-ROLLBACK-RESTRICTION-STANDARD managed block and\ngenerates the in-block verify command per file.\n\nRegister the spec in README (global layer, required standards, entry matrix,\nminimum rules), tools/README.md, SOUL.md (core principle, new 5.1 gate, refusal\npoints), AGENTS_SPEC.md (required sections, managed-block registry, task matrix,\ntemplate, verification), CODE_STYLE_SPEC.md (universal rule and new 8.1 rollback\nsection), and this repository''s AGENTS.md.\n\nSwept with --workspace: 100/100 repositories aligned for both the rollback and\nthe destructive-operation managed block.","tree":{"sha":"e677d9481e0c91ed506a9fd1f05c1972e9869716","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sdkwork-ai/sdkwork-specs/git/trees/e677d9481e0c91ed506a9fd1f05c1972e9869716"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sdkwork-ai/sdkwork-specs/git/commits/fa403fc3bd0a63b554a5d622aed83d9974913a8c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218460407?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id"