ngle-sourced\n  from env files incl. staging; WSL redis-server Type=simple drop-in note;\n  dev parity rule (docker dev == .env.postgres identity); image tag\n  provenance (bundle image.env, no hardcoded tags); packaging->install\n  regression checklist; §7 acceptance items added\n- SDKWORK_WEBSERVER_SPEC §17.3: mandatory Adaptive Web root materialization\n  with placeholder-shell seeding so fail-closed static-root validation\n  never crashes the data plane on missing module dists\n- ENVIRONMENT_SPEC §7.1: development container deployments must resolve the\n  identical workspace identity as .env.postgres (cross-reference §6.1)","tree":{"sha":"9bad673e56974144332da643b9ab63533140e41f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sdkwork-ai/sdkwork-specs/git/trees/9bad673e56974144332da643b9ab63533140e41f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sdkwork-ai/sdkwork-specs/git/commits/835c658d5ecb2f6910b7e815e7a680189006f43a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218460407?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sdkwork-ai","id":218460407,"login":"sdkwork-ai","node_id":"U_kgDODQVw9w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdkwork-ai","user_view_type":"public"},"html_ur