b.com/users/tomjwxf/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomjwxf/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomjwxf/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomjwxf/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomjwxf","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/governancemanners-coder/mission-control/commits/36a252436437a61be1c174d9010ed9b662ffaf1d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-10T17:40:34Z","email":"tomjwxf@gmail.com","name":"TJF"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-10T17:40:34Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: add Ed25519 receipt signing to MCP audit pipeline (#556)\n\nCloses #555.\n\nImplements tamper-evident audit receipts for MCP tool calls:\n\n- src/lib/receipt-signing.ts: Ed25519 signing with Node crypto (no deps)\n- Migration 050: adds payload_hash, signature, public_key columns\n- logMcpCall(): signs each record at write time (~0.3ms overhead)\n- verifyMcpCallReceipt() + verifyMcpCallReceipts(): integrity checks\n- GET /api/mcp-audit/verify: single-record or batch verification endpoint\n- Security scan integration: reports signed/unsigned ratio\n- Canonical JSON serialization (sorted keys) for deterministic hashing\n- Auto-generated keypair persisted in settings table\n- 147 lines of tests covering sign/verify/tamper/malformed inputs","tree":{"sha":"d00a73f6458fe6a9f3813223a509e8111401fafe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/governancemanners-coder/mission-control/git/trees/d00a73f6458fe6a9f3813223a509e8111401fafe"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/governancemanners-coder/mission-control/git/commits/36a252436437a61be1c174d9010ed9b662ffaf1d","verification":{"payload":"tree d00a73f6458fe6a9f3813223a509e8111401fafe\nparent 2bb8bf6ed4afa44751029bd3da285d920776ba6b\nauthor TJF <tomjwxf@gmail.com> 1775842834 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1775842834 +0700\n\n