om/users/0xNyk/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/0xNyk","id":93952610,"login":"0xNyk","node_id":"U_kgDOBZmaYg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/governancemanners-coder/mission-control/commits/e8023d3733133bee31410f1c6684b469368d776f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-03T08:14:46Z","email":"93952610+0xNyk@users.noreply.github.com","name":"nyk"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-03T08:14:46Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: redesign onboarding — auto-detect runtimes, remove install step (#547)\n\nReplace the 4-card runtime installation step with auto-detection in\nthe Welcome screen. Runtimes are now detected and displayed as a\nstatus list (installed/authenticated/not installed) without requiring\nusers to install anything during onboarding. Runtime management\nmoves exclusively to Settings > Agent Runtimes.\n\nChanges:\n- Remove agent-runtimes from onboarding wizard steps (4→3 local, 5→4 gateway)\n- Redesign StepWelcome with runtime status list + live system status chips\n- Delete step-agent-runtimes.tsx (592 lines) — Settings handles this now\n- Consolidate step definitions: API route imports from onboarding-flow.ts\n- Enhance empty-state-launchpad with version/auth details per runtime\n- Add i18n keys for runtime status labels (10 locales)\n- Fix runtime detection: search ~/.local/bin, ~/Library/pnpm, hermes --help\n- Fix Codex auth detection via OPENAI_API_KEY env var\n- Fix version string cleanup for LACP-wrapped binaries\n\nNo migration needed — existing completed_steps arrays silently drop\nthe removed step ID via parseCompletedSteps validation.","tree":{"sha":"7f65e847f63478bdb6e3a92419843424fec0a401","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/governancemanners-coder/mission-control/git/trees/7f65e847f63478bdb6e3a92419843424fec0a401"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/governancemanners-coder/mission-control/git/commits/e8023d3733133bee31410f1c6684b469368d776f","verification":{"payload":"tree 7f65e847f63478bdb6e3a92419843424fec0a401\nparent 04719fa2333d756fe0879ba0c4c874d139f201dc\nauthor nyk <93952610+0xNyk@users.noreply.github.com> 1775204086 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1775204086 +0700\n\nfeat: redesign onboarding — auto-detect runtimes, remove install step (#547)\n\nReplace the 4-card runtime installation step with auto-detection in\nthe Welcome screen. Runtimes are now detected and displayed as a\nstatus list (installed/authenticated/not installed) without requiring\nusers to install anything during onboarding. Runtime management\nmoves exclusively to Settings > Agent Runtimes.\n\nChanges:\n- Remove agent-runtimes from onboarding wizard steps (4→3 local, 5→4 gateway)\n- Redesign StepWelcome with runtime status list + live system status chips\n- Delete step-agent-runtimes.tsx (592 lines) — Settings handles this now\n- Consolidate step definitions: API route imports from onboarding-flow.ts\n- Enhance empty-state-launchpad with version/auth details per runtime\n- Add i18n keys for runtime status labels (10 locales)\n- Fix runtime detection: search ~/.local/bin, ~/Library/pnpm, hermes --help\n- Fix Codex auth detection via OPENAI_API_KEY env var\n- Fix version string cleanup for LACP-wrapped binaries\n\nNo migration needed — existing completed_steps arrays silently drop\nthe removed step ID via parseCompletedSteps validation.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpz3b2CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAQX4QAGhY7caTMRqZC6kS/Ff3WgF6\nLAwclfSwa1BMSlR2KST4UW+Hp1T0rGC2sn2YEsvnjURINxwkbxrPyJy5PfEyasG0\nq6/dm2uJxp/YQM9DzO+ZBZFrxKAgjDqWsrLQVPjWld7g1N7tM4MdLeRdkkIBXS6D\nSeDYV23A8lEB5aOehGD+HEQvKxIUmjZnY4Oju9TvQDw3G8WFPVOjHQ5qo04WVSb1\nOAENPKN6eqj4bXqEYRgF/j+JHQjiaNK4+8RECI3Nzay21eHZi6cpycT8ZVb2NRl8\n0mcH/qbxIM/aS5TagHgSkSNTCASW7tTa90uT01mS1VRjdFWIcLSnU6aM/9hwZK0V\nATGcZ8YbZ6e+/XrcWxEZbb7+ty2r7IQMcStJbH0MHxUeN5j8GMRgxfn1Dm73DxlA\njBfbF+Z3FearVhJinBYdJ9Ri6+JhCHldYek7yza1xK1vKFz6CQG5r3TBZ+dXTm2R\na23KuaSfgJmKPDue3v3kQ8rVtxaiIuBnueo3IaDGYfUpjPLLbgplDH4pqCWS2xuT\nKEbOa5L2xChH7leZohV9y+mm7M0fkBsl63c5szgVzOQmmUWZ9Io8opp/SuoAguPC\nu5/6pV0gNjjrw2pUnxqqUTyN40RDlSCi52LeKxdv/qZmeKzzgVpo0eoJS+naw72j\nAhT2P9+OEBCjB6Y4OUBt\n=f8xH\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-05T16:11:58Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/governancemanners-coder/mission-control/commit/e8023d3733133bee31410f1